DG.put("sasatr-naam-maalaa/4",{"n":4,"title":"ਅਥ ਸ੍ਰੀ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਨਾਮ","title_roman":"Ath sree paasi ke naam","page":942,"blocks":[{"type":"heading","kind":"chhand","name":"ਦੋਹਰਾ","gurmukhi":"ਦੋਹਰਾ","roman":"Dohraa","meaning_en":"Dohra.","page":942,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਦੋਹਰਾ:","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"type":"verse","number":[253],"number_text":"੨੫੩।","page":942,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਬੀਰ ਗ੍ਰਸਿਤਹੀ ਗ੍ਰੀਵ ਧਰ ਬਰੁਣਾਯੁਧ ਕਹਿ ਅੰਤ।","roman":"Beer grasithee greev dhar barunaayudh kahi ant |","meaning_en":"Seizer of heroes, holder of the neck — and at the end say 'Varunayudh' (weapon of Varun);","page":942,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"This chapter gives names of the paas (noose), the weapon of Varun (god of waters) and of Yama.","meaning_pa":"ਬੀਰ ਗ੍ਰਸਿਤਹੀ', 'ਗ੍ਰੀਵਧਰ' ਅਤੇ 'ਬਰੁਣਾਯੁਧ' ਅੰਤ ਉਤੇ ਕਹਿ ਦਿਓ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਸਕਲ ਨਾਮ ਸ੍ਰੀ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਨਿਕਸਤ ਚਲੈ ਅਨੰਤ। ੨੫੩।","roman":"Sakal naam sree paasi ke niksat chalai anant | 253 |","meaning_en":"endless names of the revered noose come forth. 253.","page":942,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਇਸ ਤਰ੍ਰਹਾ ਪਾਸ (ਫਾਹੀ) ਦੇ ਅਨੇਕਾ ਨਾਮ ਬਣਦੇ ਜਾਣਗੇ ॥੨੫੩॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[254],"number_text":"੨੫੪।","page":942,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਗ੍ਰੀਵ ਗ੍ਰਸਿਤਨਿ ਭਵ ਧਰਾ ਜਲਧ ਰਾਜ ਹਥੀਆਰ।","roman":"Greev grasitni bhav dharaa jaladh raaj hatheeaar |","meaning_en":"Seizer of necks, arising from water (?), weapon of the king of the waters —","page":942,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਭਵ ਧਰਾ: read as 'born of water' or 'held by'; uncertain.","meaning_pa":"ਗ੍ਰੀਵ ਗ੍ਰਸਿਤਨਿ', 'ਭਵ ਧਰਾ' ਅਤੇ 'ਜਲਧ ਰਾਜ' ਦਾ ਹਥਿਆਰ ਹੈ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਪਰੌ ਦੁਸਟ ਕੇ ਕੰਠ ਮੈ ਮੋਕਹੁ ਲੇਹੁ ਉਬਾਰ। ੨੫੪।","roman":"Parau dusat ke kanth mai mokhu lehu ubaar | 254 |","meaning_en":"fall upon the throat of the wicked, and save me. 254.","page":942,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਦੁਸ਼ਟ ਦੀ ਗਰਦਨ ਉਤੇ ਵਜਦਾ ਹੈ ਅਤੇ ਮੈਨੂੰ ਬਚਾ ਲੈਂਦਾ ਹੈ ॥੨੫੪॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[255],"number_text":"੨੫੫।","page":942,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਪ੍ਰਿਥਮ ਨਦਨ ਕੇ ਨਾਮ ਲੈ ਏਸ ਏਸ ਪਦ ਭਾਖਿ।","roman":"Pritham nadan ke naam lai es es pad bhaakhi |","meaning_en":"First take the names of rivers, then speak the words 'es es' (lord, lord);","page":942,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"Lord of rivers = ocean/Varun; then 'sastra' = the noose. ਨਦਨ: printed so; read as ਨਦੀਨ.","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ ਨਦੀਆਂ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਲੈ ਕੇ, ਮਗਰੋਂ ਸਭ ਦੇ 'ਏਸ ਏਸ' ਪਦ ਕਹਿ ਦਿਓ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਸਸਤ੍ਰ ਉਚਰਿ ਸਭ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਨਾਮ ਚੀਨਿ ਚਿਤਿ ਰਾਖੁ। ੨੫੫।","roman":"Sasatr uchri sabh paasi ke naam cheeni chiti raakhu | 255 |","meaning_en":"utter 'sastra', and recognise all these in mind as names of the noose. 255.","page":942,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਫਿਰ 'ਸਸਤ੍ਰ' ਪਦ ਉਚਾਰੋ। (ਇਹ) ਸਾਰੇ ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਚਿਤ ਵਿਚ ਰਖ ਲਵੋ ॥੨੫੫॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[256],"number_text":"੨੫੬।","page":942,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਗੰਗਾ ਏਸ ਬਖਾਨਿ ਕੈ ਈਸ ਸਸਤ੍ਰ ਕਹਿ ਅੰਤਿ।","roman":"Gangaa es bakhaani kai ees sasatr kahi anti |","meaning_en":"Speak 'Ganga-es' (lord of the Ganga), and at the end say 'is sastra';","page":942,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਗੰਗਾ ਏਸ' (ਸਬਦ) ਕਹਿ ਕੇ, ਅੰਤ ਉਤੇ 'ਈਸ ਸਸਤ੍ਰ' ਕਹਿ ਦਿਓ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਸਕਲ ਨਾਮ ਸ੍ਰੀ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਨਿਕਸਤ ਚਲੈ ਅਨੰਤ। ੨੫੬।","roman":"Sakal naam sree paasi ke niksat chalai anant | 256 |","meaning_en":"endless names of the revered noose come forth. 256.","page":942,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਸ) ਤੋਂ ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਅਨੇਕ ਨਾਮ ਨਿਕਲ ਸਕਦੇ ਹਨ ॥੨੫੬॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[257],"number_text":"੨੫੭।","page":942,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਜਟਜ ਜਾਨਵੀ ਕ੍ਰਿਤਹਾ ਗੰਗਾ ਈਸ ਬਖਾਨੁ।","roman":"Jataj jaanvee krithaa gangaa ees bakhaanu |","meaning_en":"Speak 'Jataj' (born of the matted hair), 'Janvi', 'Kritha' (?), 'Ganga', then 'is';","page":942,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"Names of the Ganga; ਕ੍ਰਿਤਹਾ uncertain.","meaning_pa":"(ਪਹਿਲਾ) 'ਜਟਜ' (ਜਟਾ ਤੋਂ ਪੈਦਾ ਹੋਈ ਗੰਗਾ) ਜਾਨਵੀ (ਗੰਗਾ) ਕ੍ਰਿਤਹਾ (ਪਾਪ ਹਰਨ ਵਾਲੀ, ਗੰਗਾ) ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਹਿ ਕੇ ਫਿਰ 'ਗੰਗਾ ਈਸ' ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਆਯੁਧ ਅੰਤਿ ਬਖਾਨੀਐ ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਜਾਨ। ੨੫੭।","roman":"Aayudh anti bakhaaneeai naam paasi ke jaan | 257 |","meaning_en":"speak 'ayudh' at the end, and know these as names of the noose. 257.","page":942,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਅੰਤ ਉਤੇ 'ਆਯੁਧ' (ਸ਼ਸਤ੍ਰ) ਕਹੋ। ਇਹ ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਬਣ ਜਾਦੇ ਹਨ ॥੨੫੭॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[258],"number_text":"੨੫੮।","page":942,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਸਕਲ ਅਘਨ ਕੇ ਨਾਮ ਲੈ ਹਾ ਆਯੁਧ ਸੁ ਬਖਾਨ।","roman":"Sakal aghan ke naam lai haa aayudh su bakhaan |","meaning_en":"Take all the names of sins, then speak 'ha' (destroyer) and 'ayudh';","page":942,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"Destroyer of sins = the Ganga; then (her lord's) weapon; chain uncertain.","meaning_pa":"ਸਾਰਿਆਂ ਪਾਪਾ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਲੈ ਕੇ, (ਫਿਰ) 'ਹਾ' ਅਤੇ 'ਆਯੁਧ' ਸ਼ਬਦਾ ਦਾ ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਸਕਲ ਨਾਮ ਸ੍ਰੀ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਚਤੁਰ ਚਿਤ ਮਹਿ ਜਾਨ। ੨੫੮।","roman":"Sakal naam sree paasi ke chatur chit mahi jaan | 258 |","meaning_en":"O wise one, know in your mind all these as names of the revered noose. 258.","page":942,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਸਾਰੇ ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਹਨ। ਵਿਦਵਾਨ ਮਨ ਵਿਚ ਸੋਚ ਲੈਣ ॥੨੫੮॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[259],"number_text":"੨੫੯।","page":943,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਕਿਲਬਿਖ ਪਾਪ ਬਖਾਨਿ ਕੈ ਰਿਪੁ ਪਤਿ ਸਸਤ੍ਰ ਬਖਾਨ।","roman":"Kilbikh paap bakhaani kai ripu pati sasatr bakhaan |","meaning_en":"Speak 'kilbikh', 'pap' (sin), then speak 'ripu' (foe), 'pati' (lord), 'sastra';","page":943,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"Foe of sin = Ganga; her lord = the ocean (Varun); his weapon = the noose.","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਕਿਲਵਿਖ' ਜਾ 'ਪਾਪ' ਕਹਿ ਕੇ, (ਫਿਰ) 'ਰਿਪੁ ਪਤਿ ਸਸਤ੍ਰ' ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਸਕਲ ਨਾਮ ਸ੍ਰੀ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਲੀਜਹੁ ਚਤੁਰ ਪਛਾਨ। ੨੫੯।","roman":"Sakal naam sree paasi ke leejhu chatur pachhaan | 259 |","meaning_en":"O wise one, recognise all these as names of the revered noose. 259.","page":943,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਸਾਰੇ ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਹਨ, ਵਿਦਵਾਨ ਵਿਚਾਰ ਲੈਣ ॥੨੫੯॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[260],"number_text":"੨੬੦।","page":943,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਅਧਰਮ ਪਾਪ ਬਖਾਨਿ ਕੈ ਨਾਸਨੀਸ ਅਸਤ੍ਰ ਭਾਖਿ।","roman":"Adhram paap bakhaani kai naasnees asatr bhaakhi |","meaning_en":"Speak 'adharam', 'pap' (sin), then say 'nasani' (destroyer), 'is', 'astra';","page":943,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਅਧਰਮ' ਜਾ 'ਪਾਪ' ਕਹਿ ਕੇ (ਫਿਰ) 'ਨਾਸਨੀਸ ਅਸਤ੍ਰ' ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਸਕਲ ਨਾਮ ਸ੍ਰੀ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਚੀਨ ਚਤੁਰ ਚਿਤਿ ਰਾਖਿ। ੨੬੦।","roman":"Sakal naam sree paasi ke cheen chatur chiti raakhi | 260 |","meaning_en":"O wise one, recognise all these as names of the revered noose and keep them in mind. 260.","page":943,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਸਾਰੇ ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਹਨ। ਚਿਤ ਵਿਚ ਚਤੁਰ ਲੋਗ ਵਿਚਾਰ ਲੈਣ ॥੨੬੦॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[261],"number_text":"੨੬੧।","page":943,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਸਕਲ ਜਟਨਿ ਕੋ ਨਾਮ ਲੈ ਜਾ ਪਤਿ ਅਸਤ੍ਰ ਬਖਾਨਿ।","roman":"Sakal jatni ko naam lai jaa pati asatr bakhaani |","meaning_en":"Take all the names of matted hair, then speak 'ja' (born), 'pati', 'astra';","page":943,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"Born of (Shiva's) matted hair = Ganga.","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ ਜਟਨਿ (ਗੰਗਾ) ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਲੈ ਕੇ, ਫਿਰ 'ਜਾ ਪਤਿ' ਅਤੇ 'ਅਸਤ੍ਰ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਅਮਿਤ ਨਾਮ ਸ੍ਰੀ ਪਾਸ ਕੇ ਚਤੁਰ ਚਿਤ ਮਹਿ ਜਾਨੁ। ੨੬੧।","roman":"Amit naam sree paas ke chatur chit mahi jaanu | 261 |","meaning_en":"O wise one, know in your mind the countless names of the revered noose. 261.","page":943,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਬੇਅੰਤ ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਹਨ। ਚਤੁਰ ਪੁਰਸ਼ ਮਨ ਵਿਚ ਜਾਣ ਲੈਣ ॥੨੬੧॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[262],"number_text":"੨੬੨।","page":943,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਤਉਸਾਰਾ ਸਤ੍ਰੁ ਬਖਾਨਿ ਕੈ ਭੇਦਕ ਗ੍ਰੰਥ ਬਖਾਨ।","roman":"Tausaaraa satru bakhaani kai bhedak granth bakhaan |","meaning_en":"Speak 'Tausara-satru' (?), then speak 'bhedak granth' (?);","page":943,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"Line obscure; perhaps 'foe of the mountain', 'splitter of knots/rocks' (river); uncertain.","meaning_pa":"ਤਉਸਾਰਾ ਸਤ੍ਰੁ' (ਤੁਸਾਰ ਦਾ ਵੈਰੀ) ਕਹਿ ਕੇ, ਫਿਰ 'ਭੇਦਕ ਗ੍ਰੰਥ' ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਸਸਤ੍ਰ ਸਬਦ ਪੁਨਿ ਭਾਖੀਐ ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਪਹਿਚਾਨ। ੨੬੨।","roman":"Sasatr sabad puni bhaakheeai naam paasi pahichaan | 262 |","meaning_en":"then speak the word 'sastra', and recognise these as names of the noose. 262.","page":943,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਮਗਰੋਂ 'ਸ਼ਸਤ੍ਰ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਹੋ, (ਇਹ) ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਵਜੋਂ ਪਛਾਣੋ ॥੨੬੨॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[263],"number_text":"੨੬੩।","page":943,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਗਿਰਿ ਪਦ ਪ੍ਰਿਥਮ ਬਖਾਨਿ ਕੈ ਨਾਸਨਿ ਨਾਥ ਬਖਾਨਿ।","roman":"Giri pad pritham bakhaani kai naasni naath bakhaani |","meaning_en":"First speak the word 'giri' (mountain), then speak 'nasani' (destroyer) and 'nath' (lord);","page":943,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"Destroyer of mountains = river; its lord = ocean.","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਗਿਰਿ' ਪਦ ਕਹਿ ਕੇ, (ਮਗਰੋਂ) 'ਨਾਸਨਿ ਨਾਥ' ਦਾ ਉਚਾਰਨ ਕਰੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਸਸਤ੍ਰ ਸਬਦ ਪੁਨਿ ਭਾਖੀਐ ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਪਹਿਚਾਨ। ੨੬੩।","roman":"Sasatr sabad puni bhaakheeai naam paasi pahichaan | 263 |","meaning_en":"then speak the word 'sastra', and recognise these as names of the noose. 263.","page":943,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਮਗਰੋਂ 'ਸ਼ਸਤ੍ਰ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਹੋ, (ਇਹ) ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਵਜੋਂ ਪਛਾਣੋ ॥੨੬੨॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[264],"number_text":"੨੬੪।","page":943,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਫੋਕੀ ਨੋਕੀ ਪਖਧਰ ਪਤ੍ਰੀ ਪਰੀ ਬਖਾਨ।","roman":"Phokee nokee pakhdhar patree paree bakhaan |","meaning_en":"Speak 'phoki', 'noki', 'pakhdhar' (wing-bearing), 'patri', 'pari' (feathered);","page":943,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"These are arrow-epithets (notched, pointed, feathered); their use for the noose is odd; printed so; uncertain.","meaning_pa":"ਫੋਕੀ (ਫੋਕ) ਨੋਕੀ, ਪਖਧਰ, ਪਤ੍ਰੀ, ਪਰੀ,","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਪਛੀ ਪਛਿ ਅੰਤਕ ਕਹੋ ਸਕਲ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਨਾਮ। ੨੬੪।","roman":"Pachhee pachhi antak kaho sakal paasi ke naam | 264 |","meaning_en":"say 'pachhi', 'pachhi-antak' — all are names of the noose. 264.","page":943,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"uncertain.","meaning_pa":"ਪਛੀ, ਪਛਿ ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਹਿ ਕੇ ਫਿਰ 'ਅੰਤਕ' ਪਦ ਕਹੋ। (ਇਸ ਤਰ੍ਰਹਾ) ਸਾਰੇ ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਬਣਦੇ ਹਨ ॥੨੬੪॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[265],"number_text":"੨੬੫।","page":943,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਕਸਟ ਸਬਦ ਪ੍ਰਿਥਮੈ ਉਚਰਿ ਅਘਨ ਸਬਦ ਕਹੁ ਅੰਤਿ।","roman":"Kasat sabad prithmai uchri aghan sabad kahu anti |","meaning_en":"First utter the word 'kasht' (pain), and at the end say the word 'aghan' (sins);","page":943,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਕਸਟ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਉਚਾਰੋ, (ਫਿਰ) ਅੰਤ ਉਤੇ 'ਅਘਨ' ਸਬਦ ਕਹੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਪਤਿ ਸਸਤ੍ਰ ਭਾਖਹੁ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਨਿਕਸਹਿ ਨਾਮ ਅਨੰਤ। ੨੬੫।","roman":"Pati sasatr bhaakhhu paasi ke nikashi naam anant | 265 |","meaning_en":"speak 'pati', 'sastra', and endless names of the noose come forth. 265.","page":943,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"Chain unclear; uncertain.","meaning_pa":"(ਫਿਰ) 'ਪਤਿ ਸਸਤ੍ਰ' ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ। (ਇਸ ਤਰ੍ਰਹਾ) ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਬਣਦੇ ਜਾਣਗੇ ॥੨੬੫॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[266],"number_text":"੨੬੬।","page":943,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਪਬ੍ਯਾ ਪ੍ਰਿਥਮ ਬਖਾਨਿ ਕੈ ਭੇਦਨ ਈਸ ਬਖਾਨ।","roman":"Pabyaa pritham bakhaani kai bhedan ees bakhaan |","meaning_en":"First speak 'pabya' (mountain), then speak 'bhedan' (splitter) and 'is';","page":943,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਪਬ੍ਯਾ: read as parbat; splitter of mountains = river, its lord = ocean.","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਪਬ੍ਰਯਾ' (ਨਦੀ) ਕਹਿ ਕੇ ਫਿਰ 'ਭੇਦਨ (ਭੇਦਣ ਵਾਲੀ) ਈਸ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਹਿ ਦਿਓ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਸਸਤ੍ਰ ਸਬਦ ਪੁਨਿ ਭਾਖਿਐ ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਪਹਿਚਾਨ। ੨੬੬।","roman":"Sasatr sabad puni bhaakhiai naam paasi pahichaan | 266 |","meaning_en":"then speak the word 'sastra', and recognise these as names of the noose. 266.","page":943,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[267],"number_text":"੨੬੭।","page":943,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਜਲਨਾਇਕ ਬਾਰਸਤ੍ਰੁ ਭਨਿ ਸਸਤ੍ਰ ਸਬਦ ਪੁਨਿ ਦੇਹੁ।","roman":"Jalnaaik baarastru bhani sasatr sabad puni dehu |","meaning_en":"Say 'Jalnaik' (leader of waters), 'Barsatru' (?), then add the word 'sastra';","page":943,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਬਾਰਸਤ੍ਰੁ: perhaps 'lord of water' or 'foe of water'; uncertain.","meaning_pa":"ਫਿਰ 'ਸ਼ਸਤ੍ਰ' ਪਦ ਦਾ ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ। ਇਸ ਨੂੰ ਪਾਸ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਸਮਝ ਲਵੋ ॥੨੬੬॥ ਜਲਨਾਇਕ' ਜਾ 'ਬਾਰਸਤ੍ਰੁ' ਕਹਿ ਕੇ, ਫਿਰ 'ਸ਼ਸਤ੍ਰ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਹਿ ਦਿਓ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB","note_pa":"ਇਹ ਅਰਥ ਇਸ ਪੰਕਤੀ ਸਮੇਤ ਉੱਪਰਲੀਆਂ 2 ਪੰਕਤੀਆਂ ਦਾ ਇਕੱਠਾ ਹੈ।"},{"gurmukhi":"ਸਕਲ ਨਾਮ ਸ੍ਰੀ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਚੀਨ ਚਤੁਰ ਚਿਤਿ ਲੇਹੁ। ੨੬੭।","roman":"Sakal naam sree paasi ke cheen chatur chiti lehu | 267 |","meaning_en":"O wise one, recognise in your mind all these as names of the revered noose. 267.","page":943,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਸਾਰੇ ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਹਨ, ਚਤੁਰ ਪੁਰਸ਼ ਚਿਤ ਵਿਚ ਵਿਚਾਰ ਲੈਣ ॥੨੬੭॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[268],"number_text":"੨੬੮।","page":943,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਸਭ ਗੰਗਾ ਕੇ ਨਾਮ ਲੈ ਪਤਿ ਕਹਿ ਸਸਤ੍ਰ ਬਖਾਨ।","roman":"Sabh gangaa ke naam lai pati kahi sasatr bakhaan |","meaning_en":"Take all the names of the Ganga, say 'pati', and speak 'sastra';","page":943,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਪਹਿਲਾ) ਗੰਗਾ ਦੇ ਸਾਰੇ ਨਾਮ ਲੈ ਕੇ 'ਪਤਿ ਸਸਤ੍ਰ' ਦਾ ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਸਭੈ ਨਾਮ ਸ੍ਰੀ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਲੀਜਹੁ ਚਤੁਰ ਪਛਾਨ। ੨੬੮।","roman":"Sabhai naam sree paasi ke leejhu chatur pachhaan | 268 |","meaning_en":"O wise one, recognise all these as names of the revered noose. 268.","page":943,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਸਾਰੇ ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਹੋਣਗੇ। ਸਮਝਦਾਰ ਲੋਗ ਵਿਚਾਰ ਕਰ ਲੈਣ ॥੨੬੮॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[269],"number_text":"੨੬੯।","page":943,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਜਮੁਨਾ ਪ੍ਰਿਥਮ ਬਖਾਨਿ ਕੈ ਏਸ ਅਸਤ੍ਰ ਕਹਿ ਅੰਤਿ।","roman":"Jamunaa pritham bakhaani kai es asatr kahi anti |","meaning_en":"First speak 'Jamuna', and at the end say 'es astra';","page":943,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਜਮੁਨਾ' ਨਾਮ ਕਹਿ ਕੇ ਫਿਰ 'ਏਸ ਅਸਤ੍ਰ' ਅੰਤ ਉਤੇ ਕਹੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਸਕਲ ਨਾਮ ਸ੍ਰੀ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਨਿਕਸਤ ਚਲਤ ਅਨੰਤ। ੨੬੯।","roman":"Sakal naam sree paasi ke niksat chalat anant | 269 |","meaning_en":"endless names of the revered noose come forth. 269.","page":943,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਇਹ ਸਾਰੇ ਅਨੰਤ ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਬਣਦੇ ਜਾਣਗੇ ॥੨੬੯॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[270],"number_text":"੨੭੦।","page":943,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਕਾਲਿੰਦ੍ਰੀ ਪਦ ਪ੍ਰਿਥਮ ਭਨਿ ਇੰਦ੍ਰ ਸਬਦ ਕਹਿ ਅੰਤਿ।","roman":"Kaalindree pad pritham bhani indr sabad kahi anti |","meaning_en":"First say the word 'Kalindri', and at the end say the word 'indra' (lord);","page":943,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਕਾਲਿੰਦ੍ਰੀ' ਪਦ ਕਹੋ, (ਫਿਰ) ਅੰਤ ਉਤੇ 'ਇੰਦ੍ਰ' ਸਬਦ ਕਹੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਅਸਤ੍ਰ ਬਹੁਰਿ ਕਹੁ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਨਿਕਸਹਿ ਨਾਮ ਅਨੰਤ। ੨੭੦।","roman":"Asatr bahuri kahu paasi ke nikashi naam anant | 270 |","meaning_en":"then say 'astra', and endless names of the noose come forth. 270.","page":943,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਮਗਰੋਂ 'ਅਸਤ੍ਰ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਹੋ, (ਇਸ ਤਰ੍ਰਹਾ) ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਬਣਦੇ ਜਾਣਗੇ ॥੨੭੦॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[271],"number_text":"੨੭੧।","page":943,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਕਾਲਿਨੁਜਾ ਪਦ ਪ੍ਰਿਥਮਹ ਕਹਿ ਇਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ ਪੁਨਿ ਭਾਖੁ।","roman":"Kaalinujaa pad prithmah kahi israasatr puni bhaakhu |","meaning_en":"First say the word 'Kalinuja' (?), then speak 'israstra' (lord's weapon);","page":943,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਕਾਲਿਨੁਜਾ: perhaps 'younger sister of Kal (Yama)' = Yamuna; uncertain.","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਕਾਲਿਨੁਜਾ' (ਯਮੁਨਾ) ਕਹਿ ਕੇ ਫਿਰ 'ਇਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ' (ਈਸਰ ਦਾ ਅਸਤ੍ਰ) ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਸਕਲ ਨਾਮ ਸ੍ਰੀ ਪਾਸ ਕੇ ਚੀਨਿ ਚਤੁਰ ਚਿਤਿ ਰਾਖੁ। ੨੭੧।","roman":"Sakal naam sree paas ke cheeni chatur chiti raakhu | 271 |","meaning_en":"O wise one, recognise all these as names of the revered noose and keep them in mind. 271.","page":943,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਸਾਰੇ ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਹਨ। ਚਤੁਰ ਲੋਗ ਮਨ ਵਿਚ ਵਿਚਾਰ ਲੈਣ ॥੨੭੧॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[272],"number_text":"੨੭੨।","page":943,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਕ੍ਰਿਸਨ ਬਲਭਾ ਪ੍ਰਿਥਮ ਕਹਿ ਇਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ ਕਹਿ ਅੰਤਿ।","roman":"Krisan balbhaa pritham kahi israasatr kahi anti |","meaning_en":"First say 'Krishna-vallabha' (beloved of Krishna, the Yamuna), and at the end say 'israstra';","page":943,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਕ੍ਰਿਸਨ ਬਲਭਾ' ਕਹਿ ਕੇ (ਫਿਰ) 'ਇਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ' ਅੰਤ ਉਤੇ ਕਹੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਸਕਲ ਨਾਮ ਸ੍ਰੀ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਨਿਕਸਤ ਚਲਤ ਅਨੰਤ। ੨੭੨।","roman":"Sakal naam sree paasi ke niksat chalat anant | 272 |","meaning_en":"endless names of the revered noose come forth. 272.","page":943,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਸ ਤਰ੍ਰਹਾ) ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਸਾਰੇ ਨਾਮ ਬਣਦੇ ਚਲੇ ਜਾਣਗੇ ॥੨੭੨॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[273],"number_text":"੨੭੩।","page":943,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਸੂਰਜ ਪੁਤ੍ਰਿ ਕੋ ਪ੍ਰਿਥਮ ਕਹਿ ਪਤਿ ਕਹਿ ਸਸਤ੍ਰ ਬਖਾਨ।","roman":"Sooraj putri ko pritham kahi pati kahi sasatr bakhaan |","meaning_en":"First say 'Suraj-putri' (daughter of the sun, the Yamuna), say 'pati', and speak 'sastra';","page":943,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਸੂਰਜ ਪੁਤ੍ਰਿ' ਕਹਿ ਕੇ, ਫਿਰ 'ਪਤਿ' ਅਤੇ 'ਅਸਤ੍ਰ' ਸ਼ਬਦਾ ਦਾ ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਸਕਲ ਨਾਮ ਸ੍ਰੀ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਲੀਜੀਅਹੁ ਚਤੁਰ ਪਛਾਨ। ੨੭੩।","roman":"Sakal naam sree paasi ke leejeeahu chatur pachhaan | 273 |","meaning_en":"O wise one, recognise all these as names of the revered noose. 273.","page":943,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਇਹ ਸਾਰੇ ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਹਨ, ਵਿਦਵਾਨ ਵਿਚਾਰ ਲੈਣ ॥੨੭੩॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[274],"number_text":"੨੭੪।","page":943,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਭਾਨੁ ਆਤਜਮਾ ਆਦਿ ਕਹਿ ਅੰਤ ਆਯੁਧ ਪਦ ਦੇਹੁ।","roman":"Bhaanu aatajmaa aadi kahi ant aayudh pad dehu |","meaning_en":"Say 'Bhanu-atmaja' (daughter of the sun) first, and add the word 'ayudh' at the end;","page":943,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਆਤਜਮਾ: printed so; read as ਆਤਮਜਾ.","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਭਾਨ ਆਤਮਜਾ' (ਸੂਰਜ ਦੀ ਪੁੱਤਰੀ) ਕਹਿ ਕੇ ਅੰਤ ਉਤੇ 'ਆਯੁਧ' ਪਦ ਰਖੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਸਕਲ ਨਾਮ ਏ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਚੀਨ ਚਤੁਰ ਚਿਤ ਲੇਹੁ। ੨੭੪।","roman":"Sakal naam e paasi ke cheen chatur chit lehu | 274 |","meaning_en":"O wise one, recognise in your mind all these as names of the noose. 274.","page":943,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਸਾਰੇ ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਹਨ। ਸਿਆਣੇ ਲੋਗ ਵਿਚਾਰ ਲੈਣ ॥੨੭੪॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[275],"number_text":"੨੭੫।","page":943,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਸੂਰ ਆਤਜਮਾ ਆਦਿ ਕਹਿ ਅੰਤਿ ਸਸਤ੍ਰ ਪਦ ਦੀਨ।","roman":"Soor aatajmaa aadi kahi anti sasatr pad deen |","meaning_en":"Say 'Sur-atmaja' first, and put the word 'sastra' at the end;","page":943,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਸੂਰ ਆਤਮਜਾ' ਕਹਿ ਕੇ ਅੰਤ 'ਸਸਤ੍ਰ' ਪਦ ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਸਕਲ ਨਾਮ ਸ੍ਰੀ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਚੀਨਹੁ ਚਿਤ ਪਰਬੀਨ। ੨੭੫।","roman":"Sakal naam sree paasi ke cheenhu chit parbeen | 275 |","meaning_en":"O skilled one, recognise in your mind all these as names of the revered noose. 275.","page":943,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਸਾਰੇ ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਹਨ, ਪ੍ਰਬੀਨ ਲੋਗ ਚਿਤ ਵਿਚ ਵਿਚਾਰ ਲੈਣ ॥੨੭੫॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[276],"number_text":"੨੭੬।","page":944,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਕਾਲ ਪਿਤਾ ਪ੍ਰਥਮੈ ਉਚਰਿ ਅੰਤਿ ਤਨੁਜ ਪਦਿ ਦੇਹੁ।","roman":"Kaal pitaa prathmai uchri anti tanuj padi dehu |","meaning_en":"First utter 'Kal-pita' (father of Yama, the sun), and at the end add the word 'tanuj' (daughter);","page":944,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਕਾਲ ਪਿਤਾ' ਉਚਾਰੋ, ਫਿਰ 'ਤਨੁਜ' ਪਦ ਕਹੋ,","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਪਤਿ ਕਹਿ ਅਸਤ੍ਰ ਬਖਾਨੀਐ ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਲਖਿ ਲੇਹੁ। ੨੭੬।","roman":"Pati kahi asatr bakhaaneeai naam paasi lakhi lehu | 276 |","meaning_en":"saying 'pati', speak 'astra', and recognise these as names of the noose. 276.","page":944,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਫਿਰ) ਅੰਤ ਉਤੇ 'ਪਤਿ' ਅਤੇ 'ਅਸਤ੍ਰ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਜੋੜ ਦਿਓ। (ਇਨ੍ਰਹਾ ਨੂੰ) ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਸਮਝ ਲਵੋ ॥੨੭੬॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[277],"number_text":"੨੭੭।","page":944,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਦਿਵਕਰ ਤਨੁਜਾ ਪ੍ਰਿਥਮ ਕਹਿ ਪਤਿ ਕਹਿ ਸਸਤ੍ਰ ਬਖਾਨ।","roman":"Divkar tanujaa pritham kahi pati kahi sasatr bakhaan |","meaning_en":"First say 'Divkar-tanuja' (daughter of the sun), say 'pati', and speak 'sastra';","page":944,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਦਿਵਕਰ ਤਨੁਜਾ' (ਸੂਰਜ ਦੀ ਪੁੱਤਰੀ) ਕਹਿ ਕੇ, ਫਿਰ 'ਪਤੀ' ਅਤੇ 'ਸ਼ਸਤ੍ਰ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਦਾ ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਸਕਲ ਨਾਮ ਸ੍ਰੀ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਲੀਜਹੁ ਚਤੁਰ ਪਛਾਨ। ੨੭੭।","roman":"Sakal naam sree paasi ke leejhu chatur pachhaan | 277 |","meaning_en":"O wise one, recognise all these as names of the revered noose. 277.","page":944,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਇਹ ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਹਨ, ਚਤੁਰ ਲੋਗ ਪਛਾਣ ਲੈਣ ॥੨੭੭॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[278],"number_text":"੨੭੮।","page":944,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਪਾਸਿ ਗ੍ਰੀਵਹਾ ਕੰਠ ਰਿਪੁ ਬਰੁਣਾਯੁਧ ਜਿਹ ਨਾਮ।","roman":"Paasi greevhaa kanth ripu barunaayudh jih naam |","meaning_en":"Paas, griv-ha (neck-seizer), kanth-ripu (foe of the throat), Varunayudh are its names;","page":944,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਜਿਸ ਦੇ 'ਪਾਸਿ', 'ਗ੍ਰੀਵਹਾ', 'ਕੰਠ ਰਿਪੁ' ਅਤੇ 'ਬਰੁਣਾਯੁਧ' ਨਾਮ ਹਨ,","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਪਰੋ ਦੁਸਟ ਕੇ ਕੰਠ ਮੈ ਕਰੋ ਹਮਾਰੋ ਕਾਮ। ੨੭੮।","roman":"Paro dusat ke kanth mai karo hamaaro kaam | 278 |","meaning_en":"fall upon the throat of the wicked and accomplish our work. 278.","page":944,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਉਹ ਦੁਸ਼ਟ ਦੇ ਗਲੇ ਵਿਚ ਪੈਂਦੀ ਹੈ ਅਤੇ ਮੇਰੇ ਕੰਮ ਸੰਵਾਰਦੀ ਹੈ ॥੨੭੮॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[279],"number_text":"੨੭੯।","page":944,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਆਦਿ ਕੰਠ ਕੇ ਨਾਮ ਲੈ ਗ੍ਰਾਹਕ ਪਦ ਕਹਿ ਅੰਤਿ।","roman":"Aadi kanth ke naam lai graahak pad kahi anti |","meaning_en":"Take the names of the throat first, and at the end say the word 'grahak' (seizer);","page":944,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਕੰਠ' ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਲੈ ਕੇ ਅੰਤ ਉਤੇ 'ਗ੍ਰਾਹਕ' ਪਦ ਕਹਿ ਦਿਓ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਬਰੁਣਾਯੁਧ ਕੇ ਨਾਮ ਸਭੁ ਨਿਕਸਤ ਚਲਤ ਬਿਅੰਤ। ੨੭੯।","roman":"Barunaayudh ke naam sabhu niksat chalat biant | 279 |","meaning_en":"endless names of Varun's weapon come forth. 279.","page":944,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਸ ਤਰ੍ਰਹਾ) ਪਾਸ (ਬਰੁਣਾਯੁਧ) ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਬਣਦੇ ਜਾਦੇ ਹਨ ॥੨੭੯॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[280],"number_text":"੨੮੦।","page":944,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਰਿ ਕੰਠ ਗਰ ਗ੍ਰੀਵ ਭਨਿ ਗ੍ਰਹਿਤਾ ਬਹੁਰਿ ਬਖਾਨ।","roman":"Naari kanth gar greev bhani grahitaa bahuri bakhaan |","meaning_en":"Say 'nari', 'kanth', 'gar', 'griv' (neck, throat), then speak 'grahita' (seizer);","page":944,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਨਾਰਿ', 'ਕੰਠ', 'ਗਰ', 'ਗ੍ਰੀਵ' (ਸਾਰੇ ਗਰਦਨ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ) ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਹਿ ਕੇ ਫਿਰ 'ਗ੍ਰਹਿਤਾ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਸਕਲ ਨਾਮ ਏ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਨਿਕਸਤ ਚਲਤ ਅਪ੍ਰਮਾਨ। ੨੮੦।","roman":"Sakal naam e paasi ke niksat chalat apramaan | 280 |","meaning_en":"innumerable names of the noose come forth. 280.","page":944,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਸ ਤਰ੍ਰਹਾ) ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਸਾਰੇ ਨਾਮ ਬਣਦੇ ਜਾਣਗੇ ॥੨੮੦॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[281],"number_text":"੨੮੧।","page":944,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਜਮੁਨਾ ਪ੍ਰਿਥਮ ਬਖਾਨਿ ਕੈ ਏਸਰਾਯੁਧਹਿੰ ਬਖਾਨ।","roman":"Jamunaa pritham bakhaani kai esraayudhhin bakhaan |","meaning_en":"First speak 'Jamuna', then speak 'esrayudh' (weapon of her lord);","page":944,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਸਕਲ ਨਾਮ ਸ੍ਰੀ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਚੀਨਹੁ ਚਤੁਰ ਸੁਜਾਨ। ੨੮੧।","roman":"Sakal naam sree paasi ke cheenhu chatur sujaan | 281 |","meaning_en":"O wise and knowing one, recognise all these as names of the revered noose. 281.","page":944,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਜਮੁਨਾ' ਪਦ ਕਹਿ ਕੇ (ਫਿਰ) 'ਏਸਰਾਯੁਧ' ਬਖਾਨ ਕਰੋ। (ਇਹ) ਸਾਰੇ ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਹਨ। ਵਿਦਵਾਨ ਲੋਗ ਮਨ ਵਿਚ ਵਿਚਾਰ ਲੈਣ ॥੨੮੧॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB","note_pa":"ਇਹ ਅਰਥ ਇਸ ਪੰਕਤੀ ਸਮੇਤ ਉੱਪਰਲੀਆਂ 2 ਪੰਕਤੀਆਂ ਦਾ ਇਕੱਠਾ ਹੈ।"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[282],"number_text":"੨੮੨।","page":944,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਕ ਬਰਣਾਦਿ ਬਖਾਨਿ ਕੈ ਮੰਦ ਬਹੁਰ ਪਦ ਦੇਹੁ।","roman":"Ka barnaadi bakhaani kai mand bahur pad dehu |","meaning_en":"Speak the letter 'ka' first, then add the word 'mand';","page":944,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"'ka' + 'mand' = kamand, the lasso/noose."},{"gurmukhi":"ਹੋਤ ਹੈ ਨਾਮ ਕਮੰਦ ਕੇ ਚੀਨ ਚਤੁਰ ਚਿਤਿ ਲੇਹੁ। ੨੮੨।","roman":"Hot hai naam kamand ke cheen chatur chiti lehu | 282 |","meaning_en":"this becomes a name of the kamand; O wise one, recognise it in your mind. 282.","page":944,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਕ' ਅੱਖਰ ਕਹਿ ਕੇ ਫਿਰ 'ਮੰਦ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਜੋੜ ਦਿਓ। ਇਹ ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸ (ਕਮੰਦ) ਦੇ ਹੋ ਜਾਦੇ ਹਨ। ਚਤੁਰ ਲੋਗ ਮਨ ਵਿਚ ਵਿਚਾਰ ਲੈਣ ॥੨੮੨॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB","note_pa":"ਇਹ ਅਰਥ ਇਸ ਪੰਕਤੀ ਸਮੇਤ ਉੱਪਰਲੀਆਂ 2 ਪੰਕਤੀਆਂ ਦਾ ਇਕੱਠਾ ਹੈ।"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[283],"number_text":"੨੮੩।","page":944,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਕਿਸਨ ਆਦਿ ਪਦ ਉਚਰਿ ਕੈ ਬਲਭਾਂਤਿ ਪਦ ਦੇਹੁ।","roman":"Kisan aadi pad uchri kai balbhaanti pad dehu |","meaning_en":"Utter the word 'Kisan' (Krishna) first, then add the word 'vallabha';","page":944,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਬਲਭਾਂਤਿ: read as vallabha at the end; uncertain.","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਕਿਸਨ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਉਚਾਰ ਕੇ ਫਿਰ 'ਬਲਭਾਤਿ' ਪਦ ਕਹਿ ਦਿਓ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਪਤਿ ਅਸਤ੍ਰਾਂਤਿ ਉਚਾਰੀਐ ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਲਖਿ ਲੇਹੁ। ੨੮੩।","roman":"Pati astraanti uchaareeai naam paasi lakhi lehu | 283 |","meaning_en":"utter 'pati' and 'astra' at the end, and recognise these as names of the noose. 283.","page":944,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਮਗਰੋਂ) ਅੰਤ ਤੇ 'ਪਤਿ' ਅਤੇ 'ਅਸਤ੍ਰ' ਉਚਾਰਨ ਕਰੋ। (ਇਹ) ਪਾਸ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਸਮਝ ਲਵੋ ॥੨੮੩॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[284],"number_text":"੨੮੪।","page":944,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਬੀਰ ਗ੍ਰਸਤਨੀ ਸੁਭਟਹਾ ਕਾਲਾਯੁਧ ਜਿਹ ਨਾਮ।","roman":"Beer grasatnee subhathaa kaalaayudh jih naam |","meaning_en":"Seizer of heroes, slayer of warriors, weapon of Kal are its names;","page":944,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਬੀਰ ਗ੍ਰਸਤਨੀ', 'ਸੁਭਟਹਾ' ਅਤੇ 'ਕਾਲਾਯੁਧ' ਜਿਸ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਹਨ,","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਪਰੋ ਦੁਸਟ ਕੇ ਕੰਠ ਮੈ ਕਰੋ ਹਮਾਰੋ ਕਾਮ। ੨੮੪।","roman":"Paro dusat ke kanth mai karo hamaaro kaam | 284 |","meaning_en":"fall upon the throat of the wicked and accomplish our work. 284.","page":944,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਉਹ) ਵੈਰੀ ਦੇ ਗਲੇ ਵਿਚ ਪੈ ਜਾਦੀ ਹੈ ਅਤੇ ਮੇਰੇ ਕੰਮ ਸੰਵਾਰਦੀ ਹੈ ॥੨੮੪॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[285],"number_text":"੨੮੫।","page":944,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਕਾਲ ਅਕਾਲ ਕਰਾਲ ਭਨਿ ਆਯੁਧ ਬਹੁਰਿ ਬਖਾਨੁ।","roman":"Kaal akaal karaal bhani aayudh bahuri bakhaanu |","meaning_en":"Say 'Kal', 'Akal', 'Karal', then speak 'ayudh';","page":944,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਕਾਲ, ਅਕਾਲ ਅਤੇ ਕਰਾਲ ਕਹਿ ਕੇ, ਫਿਰ 'ਆਯੁਧ' ਪਦ ਦਾ ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਸਕਲ ਨਾਮ ਏ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਚਤੁਰ ਚਿਤ ਮਹਿ ਜਾਨੁ। ੨੮੫।","roman":"Sakal naam e paasi ke chatur chit mahi jaanu | 285 |","meaning_en":"O wise one, know in your mind all these as names of the noose. 285.","page":944,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਸਾਰੇ ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਹਨ, ਚਤੁਰ ਲੋਗ ਸਮਝ ਲੈਣ ॥੨੮੫॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[286],"number_text":"੨੮੬।","page":944,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਆਦਿ ਉਚਰੀਐ ਸੂਰਜ ਪਦ ਪੂਤ ਉਚਰੀਐ ਅੰਤਿ।","roman":"Aadi uchreeai sooraj pad poot uchreeai anti |","meaning_en":"Utter the word 'Suraj' first, and utter 'put' (son) at the end;","page":944,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"Son of the sun = Yama; his weapon = the noose.","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਸੂਰਜ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਉਚਾਰੋ, (ਫਿਰ) 'ਪੂਤ' ਤੋਂ ਬਾਦ 'ਸਸਤ੍ਰ' ਪਦ ਅੰਤ ਤੇ ਉਚਾਰੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਸਸਤ੍ਰ ਭਾਖੀਐ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਨਿਕਸਹਿ ਨਾਮ ਬਿਅੰਤ। ੨੮੬।","roman":"Sasatr bhaakheeai paasi ke nikashi naam biant | 286 |","meaning_en":"speak 'sastra', and endless names of the noose come forth. 286.","page":944,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਸ ਤਰ੍ਰਹਾ) ਬੇਅੰਤ ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਬਣ ਜਾਦੇ ਹਨ ॥੨੮੬॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[287],"number_text":"੨੮੭।","page":944,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਸਕਲ ਸੂਰਜ ਕੇ ਨਾਮ ਲੈ ਸੁਤ ਪਦ ਅਸਤ੍ਰ ਬਖਾਨ।","roman":"Sakal sooraj ke naam lai sut pad asatr bakhaan |","meaning_en":"Take all the names of the sun, then speak 'sut' and 'astra';","page":944,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਪਹਿਲਾ) ਸੂਰਜ ਦੇ ਸਾਰੇ ਨਾਮ ਲੈ ਕੇ, (ਫਿਰ) 'ਸੁਤ' ਅਤੇ 'ਅਸਤ੍ਰ' ਸ਼ਬਦਾ ਦਾ ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਸਕਲ ਨਾਮ ਸ੍ਰੀ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਚਤੁਰ ਚਿਤ ਮੈ ਜਾਨੁ। ੨੮੭।","roman":"Sakal naam sree paasi ke chatur chit mai jaanu | 287 |","meaning_en":"O wise one, know in your mind all these as names of the revered noose. 287.","page":944,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਸਾਰੇ ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਹਨ। ਚਤੁਰ ਪੁਰਸ਼ ਚਿਤ ਵਿਚ ਜਾਣ ਲੈਣ ॥੨੮੭॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[288],"number_text":"੨੮੮।","page":944,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਭਾਨੁ ਦਿਵਾਕਰ ਦਿਨਧ ਭਨਿ ਸੁਤ ਕਹਿ ਅਸਤ੍ਰ ਬਖਾਨੁ।","roman":"Bhaanu divaakar dinadh bhani sut kahi asatr bakhaanu |","meaning_en":"Say 'Bhanu', 'Divakar', 'Dinadh' (sun), say 'sut', and speak 'astra';","page":944,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ ਭਾਨੁ, ਦਿਵਾਕਰ, ਦਿਨਧ ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਹਿ ਕੇ ਫਿਰ 'ਸੁਤ' ਅਤੇ 'ਅਸਤ੍ਰ' ਪਦ ਜੋੜੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਸਕਲ ਨਾਮ ਸ੍ਰੀ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਚਤੁਰ ਚਿਤ ਮੈ ਜਾਨੁ। ੨੮੮।","roman":"Sakal naam sree paasi ke chatur chit mai jaanu | 288 |","meaning_en":"O wise one, know in your mind all these as names of the revered noose. 288.","page":944,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਸਾਰੇ ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਹਨ। ਚਤੁਰ ਪੁਰਸ਼ ਚਿਤ ਵਿਚ ਜਾਣ ਲੈਣ ॥੨੮੭॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[289],"number_text":"੨੮੯।","page":944,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਦਿਨਮਣਿ ਦਿਵਕਰਿ ਰੈਣਹਾ ਸੁਤ ਕਹਿ ਅਸਤ੍ਰ ਬਖਾਨ।","roman":"Dinamni divakri rainhaa sut kahi asatr bakhaan |","meaning_en":"Say 'Dinmani', 'Divkari', 'Rainha' (destroyer of night), say 'sut', and speak 'astra';","page":944,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਦਿਨਮਣਿ, ਦਿਵਕਰਿ ਅਤੇ ਰੈਣਹਾ (ਸ਼ਬਦ) ਕਹਿ ਕੇ ਫਿਰ 'ਸੁਤ' ਅਤੇ ਅਸਤ੍ਰ' ਪਦ ਜੋੜੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਸਕਲ ਨਾਮ ਸ੍ਰੀ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਚਤੁਰ ਚਿਤ ਮੈ ਜਾਨੁ। ੨੮੯।","roman":"Sakal naam sree paasi ke chatur chit mai jaanu | 289 |","meaning_en":"O wise one, know in your mind all these as names of the revered noose. 289.","page":944,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਸਾਰੇ ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਹਨ, ਚਤੁਰ ਲੋਗ ਸਮਝ ਲੈਣ ॥੨੮੮॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[290],"number_text":"੨੯੦।","page":944,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਦਿਨ ਕੋ ਨਾਮ ਬਖਾਨਿ ਕੈ ਮਾਣਿ ਪਦ ਬਹੁਰਿ ਬਖਾਨ।","roman":"Din ko naam bakhaani kai maani pad bahuri bakhaan |","meaning_en":"Speak the name of the day, then speak the word 'mani' (jewel);","page":944,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"Jewel of the day = the sun."},{"gurmukhi":"ਸੁਤ ਕਹਿ ਅਸਤ੍ਰ ਬਖਾਨੀਐ ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਪਹਿਚਾਨ। ੨੯੦।","roman":"Sut kahi asatr bakhaaneeai naam paasi pahichaan | 290 |","meaning_en":"say 'sut', speak 'astra', and recognise these as names of the noose. 290.","page":944,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਦਿਨ' ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਕਹਿ ਕੇ (ਫਿਰ) 'ਮਣਿ ' ਪਦ ਦਾ ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ। (ਮਗਰੋਂ) 'ਸੁਤ' ਅਤੇ 'ਅਸਤ੍ਰ' (ਸ਼ਬਦ) ਕਹਿ ਦਿਓ, (ਇਹ) ਸਭ ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਹਨ ॥੨੯੦॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB","note_pa":"ਇਹ ਅਰਥ ਇਸ ਪੰਕਤੀ ਸਮੇਤ ਉੱਪਰਲੀਆਂ 2 ਪੰਕਤੀਆਂ ਦਾ ਇਕੱਠਾ ਹੈ।"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[291],"number_text":"੨੯੧।","page":944,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਦਿਵਕਰਿ ਦਿਨਪਤਿ ਨਿਸਰਿ ਭਨਿ ਦਿਨ ਨਾਇਕ ਪੁਨਿ ਭਾਖੁ।","roman":"Divakri dinapti nisri bhani din naaik puni bhaakhu |","meaning_en":"Say 'Divkari', 'Dinpati', 'Nisari' (foe of night), then speak 'Din-naik';","page":944,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਦਿਵਕਰਿ, ਦਿਨਪਤਿ, ਨਿਸਰਿ (ਨਿਸਅਰਿ) ਅਤੇ ਦਿਨਨਾਇਕ (ਸ਼ਬਦ) ਕਹਿ ਕੇ","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਸੁਤ ਕਹਿ ਅਸਤ੍ਰ ਬਖਾਨੀਐ ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਲਖਿ ਰਾਖੁ। ੨੯੧।","roman":"Sut kahi asatr bakhaaneeai naam paasi lakhi raakhu | 291 |","meaning_en":"say 'sut', speak 'astra', and keep these in mind as names of the noose. 291.","page":944,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਫਿਰ 'ਸੁਤ' ਅਤੇ 'ਅਸਤ੍ਰ' ਪਦਾ ਦਾ ਉਚਾਰਨ ਕਰੋ। (ਇਹ) ਸਭ ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਜਾਣ ਲਵੋ ॥੨੯੧॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[292],"number_text":"੨੯੨।","page":944,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਸਕਲ ਸੂਰਜ ਕੇ ਨਾਮ ਲੈ ਸੁਤ ਕਹਿ ਅਸਤ੍ਰ ਬਖਾਨੁ।","roman":"Sakal sooraj ke naam lai sut kahi asatr bakhaanu |","meaning_en":"Take all the names of the sun, say 'sut', and speak 'astra';","page":944,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਸੂਰਜ ਦੇ ਸਾਰੇ ਨਾਮ ਲੈ ਕੇ, (ਫਿਰ) 'ਸੁਤ' ਅਤੇ 'ਅਸਤ੍ਰ' ਪਦ ਜੋੜੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਸਕਲ ਨਾਮ ਸ੍ਰੀ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਚਤੁਰ ਚਿਤ ਮਹਿ ਜਾਨੁ। ੨੯੨।","roman":"Sakal naam sree paasi ke chatur chit mahi jaanu | 292 |","meaning_en":"O wise one, know in your mind all these as names of the revered noose. 292.","page":944,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਇਹ ਸਾਰੇ ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਹਨ। ਚਤੁਰ ਲੋਗ ਮਨ ਵਿਚ ਜਾਣ ਲੈਣ ॥੨੯੨॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[293],"number_text":"੨੯੩।","page":945,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਜਮ ਪਦ ਪ੍ਰਿਥਮ ਬਖਾਨਿ ਕੈ ਸਸਤ੍ਰ ਸਬਦ ਪੁਨਿ ਦੇਹੁ।","roman":"Jam pad pritham bakhaani kai sasatr sabad puni dehu |","meaning_en":"First speak the word 'Jam' (Yama), then add the word 'sastra';","page":945,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਜਮ' ਪਦ ਕਹਿ ਕੇ ਫਿਰ 'ਸਸਤ੍ਰ' ਪਦ ਕਹਿ ਦਿਓ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਸਕਲ ਨਾਮ ਸ੍ਰੀ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਚੀਨ ਚਤੁਰ ਚਿਤਿ ਲੇਹੁ। ੨੯੩।","roman":"Sakal naam sree paasi ke cheen chatur chiti lehu | 293 |","meaning_en":"O wise one, recognise in your mind all these as names of the revered noose. 293.","page":945,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਇਹ ਸਾਰੇ ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਹਨ। ਸੂਝਵਾਨ ਲੋਗ ਮਨ ਵਿਚ ਵਿਚਾਰ ਕਰ ਲੈਣ ॥੨੯੩॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[294],"number_text":"੨੯੪।","page":945,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਬਈਵਸਤੁ ਪਦ ਆਦਿ ਕਹਿ ਆਯੁਧ ਅੰਤਿ ਬਖਾਨੁ।","roman":"Baeevastu pad aadi kahi aayudh anti bakhaanu |","meaning_en":"Say the word 'Baivasat' (Vaivasvat, Yama) first, and speak 'ayudh' at the end;","page":945,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਬਈਵਸਤੁ' (ਸੂਰਜ ਦਾ ਪੁੱਤਰ, ਯਮ) ਪਦ ਕਹਿ ਕੇ (ਫਿਰ) ਅੰਤ ਉਤੇ 'ਆਯੁਧ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਜੋੜੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਸਕਲ ਨਾਮ ਸ੍ਰੀ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਚਤੁਰ ਚਿਤ ਮਹਿ ਜਾਨੁ। ੨੯੪।","roman":"Sakal naam sree paasi ke chatur chit mahi jaanu | 294 |","meaning_en":"O wise one, know in your mind all these as names of the revered noose. 294.","page":945,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਸਾਰੇ ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਹਨ। ਸਮਝਦਾਰ ਲੋਗ ਮਨ ਵਿਚ ਵਿਚਾਰ ਲੈਣ ॥੨੯੪॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[295],"number_text":"੨੯੫।","page":945,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਕਾਲ ਸਬਦ ਕੋ ਆਦਿ ਕਹਿ ਅਸਤ੍ਰ ਸਬਦ ਕਹਿ ਅੰਤ।","roman":"Kaal sabad ko aadi kahi asatr sabad kahi ant |","meaning_en":"Say the word 'Kal' first, and say the word 'astra' at the end;","page":945,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਕਾਲ' ਪਦ ਦਾ ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ, (ਮਗਰੋਂ) 'ਅਸਤ੍ਰ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਦਾ ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਸਕਲ ਨਾਮ ਸ੍ਰੀ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਨਿਕਸਤ ਚਲੈ ਅਨੰਤ। ੨੯੫।","roman":"Sakal naam sree paasi ke niksat chalai anant | 295 |","meaning_en":"endless names of the revered noose come forth. 295.","page":945,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਸ ਤਰ੍ਰਹਾ) ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਅਨੇਕਾ ਨਾਮ ਬਣ ਸਕਦੇ ਹਨ ॥੨੯੫॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[296],"number_text":"੨੯੬।","page":945,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਪਿਤਰ ਰਾਜ ਪਦ ਪ੍ਰਿਥਮ ਕਹਿ ਅਸਤ੍ਰ ਸਬਦ ਪੁਨਿ ਦੇਹੁ।","roman":"Pitar raaj pad pritham kahi asatr sabad puni dehu |","meaning_en":"First say the word 'Pitar-raj' (king of the ancestors, Yama), then add the word 'astra';","page":945,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਪਿਤਰ ਰਾਜ' ਪਦ ਦਾ ਉਚਾਰਨ ਕਰੋ, ਫਿਰ 'ਅਸਤ੍ਰ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਦਾ ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਸਕਲ ਨਾਮ ਸ੍ਰੀ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਚਤੁਰ ਚੀਨ ਚਿਤਿ ਲੇਹੁ। ੨੯੬।","roman":"Sakal naam sree paasi ke chatur cheen chiti lehu | 296 |","meaning_en":"O wise one, recognise in your mind all these as names of the revered noose. 296.","page":945,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਸਾਰੇ ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਹਨ। ਚਤੁਰ ਲੋਗ ਮਨ ਵਿਚ ਜਾਣ ਲੈਣ ॥੨੯੬॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[297],"number_text":"੨੯੭।","page":945,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਦੰਡੀ ਪ੍ਰਿਥਮ ਬਖਾਨਿ ਕੈ ਅਸਤ੍ਰ ਸਬਦ ਕਹਿ ਅੰਤਿ।","roman":"Dandee pritham bakhaani kai asatr sabad kahi anti |","meaning_en":"First speak 'Dandi' (staff-bearer, Yama), and say the word 'astra' at the end;","page":945,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਦੰਡੀ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਹਿ ਕੇ ਫਿਰ ਅੰਤ ਤੇ 'ਅਸਤ੍ਰ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਦਾ ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਸਕਲ ਨਾਮ ਸ੍ਰੀ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਚੀਨਹੁ ਚਤੁਰ ਬਿਅੰਤ। ੨੯੭।","roman":"Sakal naam sree paasi ke cheenhu chatur biant | 297 |","meaning_en":"O wise one, recognise the countless names of the revered noose. 297.","page":945,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਇਹ ਸਾਰੇ ਬੇਅੰਤ ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਹਨ। ਚਤੁਰ ਪੁਰਸ਼ ਸਮਝ ਲੈਣ ॥੨੯੭॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[298],"number_text":"੨੯੮।","page":945,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਜਮੁਨਾ ਭ੍ਰਾਤ ਬਖਾਨ ਕੈ ਆਯੁਧ ਬਹੁਰਿ ਬਖਾਨੁ।","roman":"Jamunaa bhraat bakhaan kai aayudh bahuri bakhaanu |","meaning_en":"Speak 'Jamuna-bhrat' (brother of the Yamuna, Yama), then speak 'ayudh';","page":945,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਜਮੁਨਾ ਭ੍ਰਾਤ' ਪਦ ਕਹਿ ਕੇ ਮਗਰੋਂ 'ਆਯੁਧ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਦਾ ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਸਕਲ ਨਾਮ ਸ੍ਰੀ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਚਤੁਰ ਚਿਤ ਮਹਿ ਜਾਨੁ। ੨੯੮।","roman":"Sakal naam sree paasi ke chatur chit mahi jaanu | 298 |","meaning_en":"O wise one, know in your mind all these as names of the revered noose. 298.","page":945,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਸਾਰੇ ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਹਨ। ਸਮਝਦਾਰ ਲੋਗ ਸਮਝ ਲੈਣ ॥੨੯੮॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[299],"number_text":"੨੯੯।","page":945,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਸਭ ਜਮੁਨਾ ਕੇ ਨਾਮ ਲੈ ਭ੍ਰਾਤ ਅਸਤ੍ਰ ਪੁਨਿ ਦੇਹੁ।","roman":"Sabh jamunaa ke naam lai bhraat asatr puni dehu |","meaning_en":"Take all the names of the Yamuna, then add 'bhrat' and 'astra';","page":945,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਜਮੁਨਾ' ਦੇ ਸਾਰੇ ਨਾਮ ਲੈ ਕੇ, ਫਿਰ 'ਭ੍ਰਾਤ' ਅਤੇ 'ਅਸਤ੍ਰ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਜੋੜੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਸਕਲ ਨਾਮ ਸ੍ਰੀ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਚਤੁਰ ਚਿਤਿ ਲਖਿ ਲੇਹੁ। ੨੯੯।","roman":"Sakal naam sree paasi ke chatur chiti lakhi lehu | 299 |","meaning_en":"O wise one, recognise in your mind all these as names of the revered noose. 299.","page":945,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਸਾਰੇ ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਹਨ। ਚਤੁਰ ਲੋਗ ਮਨ ਵਿਚ ਸਮਝ ਲੈਣ ॥੨੯੯॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[300],"number_text":"੩੦੦।","page":945,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਪਿਤਰ ਸਬਦ ਪ੍ਰਿਥਮੈ ਉਚਰਿ ਏਸਰ ਬਹੁਰਿ ਬਖਾਨ।","roman":"Pitar sabad prithmai uchri esar bahuri bakhaan |","meaning_en":"First utter the word 'pitar' (ancestors), then speak 'esar' (lord);","page":945,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"Lord of ancestors = Yama; 'astra' understood.","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਪਿਤਰ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਦਾ ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ, ਪਿਛੋਂ 'ਏਸਰ' ਪਦ ਦਾ ਉਚਾਰਨ ਕਰੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਸਕਲ ਨਾਮ ਸ੍ਰੀ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਚਤੁਰ ਚਿਤ ਮਹਿ ਜਾਨੁ। ੩੦੦।","roman":"Sakal naam sree paasi ke chatur chit mahi jaanu | 300 |","meaning_en":"O wise one, know in your mind all these as names of the revered noose. 300.","page":945,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਸਾਰੇ ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਹਨ। ਵਿਦਵਾਨ ਲੋਗ ਸਮਝ ਲੈਣ ॥੩੦੦॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[301],"number_text":"੩੦੧।","page":945,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਸਭ ਪਿਤਰਨ ਕੇ ਨਾਮ ਲੈ ਨਾਇਕ ਬਹੁਰਿ ਬਖਾਨ।","roman":"Sabh pitran ke naam lai naaik bahuri bakhaan |","meaning_en":"Take the names of all the ancestors, then speak 'naik' (leader);","page":945,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਪਹਿਲਾ) ਸਾਰਿਆਂ ਪਿਤਰਾ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਲੈ ਕੇ, ਫਿਰ ਅੰਤ ਉਤੇ 'ਨਾਇਕ' ਪਦ ਦਾ ਬਖਾਨ ਕਰੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਸਕਲ ਨਾਮ ਸ੍ਰੀ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਚਤੁਰ ਚਿਤ ਮਹਿ ਜਾਨੁ। ੩੦੧।","roman":"Sakal naam sree paasi ke chatur chit mahi jaanu | 301 |","meaning_en":"O wise one, know in your mind all these as names of the revered noose. 301.","page":945,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਸਾਰੇ ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਹਨ। ਵਿਦਵਾਨ ਲੋਗ ਸਮਝ ਲੈਣ ॥੩੦੦॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[302],"number_text":"੩੦੨।","page":945,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਸਕਲ ਜਗਤ ਕੇ ਨਾਮ ਲੈ ਘਾਇਕ ਅਸਤ੍ਰ ਬਖਾਨੁ।","roman":"Sakal jagat ke naam lai ghaaik asatr bakhaanu |","meaning_en":"Take all the names of the world, then speak 'ghaik' (destroyer) and 'astra';","page":945,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"Destroyer of the world = Kal/Yama.","meaning_pa":"(ਪਹਿਲਾ) 'ਜਗਤ' ਦੇ ਸਾਰੇ ਨਾਮ ਲੈ ਕੇ (ਫਿਰ) 'ਘਾਇਕ' ਅਤੇ 'ਅਸਤ੍ਰ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਜੋੜੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਸਕਲ ਨਾਮ ਸ੍ਰੀ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਚਤੁਰ ਚਿਤ ਮਹਿ ਜਾਨੁ। ੩੦੨।","roman":"Sakal naam sree paasi ke chatur chit mahi jaanu | 302 |","meaning_en":"O wise one, know in your mind all these as names of the revered noose. 302.","page":945,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਸਾਰੇ ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਹਨ। ਸੂਝਵਾਨ ਲੋਗ ਮਨ ਵਿਚ ਵਿਚਾਰ ਲੈਣ ॥੩੦੧॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[303],"number_text":"੩੦੩।","page":945,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਰਿਪੁ ਖੰਡਨਿ ਦਲ ਦਾਹਨੀ ਸਤ੍ਰੁ ਤਾਪਨੀ ਸੋਇ।","roman":"Ripu khandni dal daahnee satru taapnee soi |","meaning_en":"Breaker of foes, burner of armies, tormentor of enemies is it;","page":945,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਰਿਪੁ ਖੰਡਨ' 'ਦਲ ਦਾਹਨੀ' ਅਤੇ 'ਸਤ੍ਰੁ ਤਾਪਨੀ' (ਆਦਿ) ਜੋ ਨਾਮ ਹਨ,","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਸਕਲ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਨਾਮ ਸਭ ਜਾ ਤੇ ਬਚ੍ਯੋ ਨ ਕੋਇ। ੩੦੩।","roman":"Sakal paasi ke naam sabh jaa te bachyo na koi | 303 |","meaning_en":"these are all names of the noose, from which no one has escaped. 303.","page":945,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਇਹ ਸਾਰੇ ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਹਨ, ਜਿਸ ਤੋਂ ਕੋਈ ਵੀ ਬਚਿਆ ਨਹੀਂ ਹੈ ॥੩੦੩॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[304],"number_text":"੩੦੪।","page":945,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਰਿਪੁ ਪਦ ਪ੍ਰਿਥਮ ਬਖਾਨਿ ਕੈ ਗ੍ਰਸਿਤਨਿ ਬਹੁਰਿ ਬਖਾਨੁ।","roman":"Ripu pad pritham bakhaani kai grasitni bahuri bakhaanu |","meaning_en":"First speak the word 'ripu' (foe), then speak 'grasitani' (seizer);","page":945,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਰਿਪੁ' ਪਦ ਕਹਿ ਕੇ, ਪਿਛੋਂ 'ਗ੍ਰਸਿਤਨਿ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਹਿ ਦਿਓ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਸਕਲ ਨਾਮ ਜਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਚਤੁਰ ਚਿਤ ਮਹਿ ਜਾਨੁ। ੩੦੪।","roman":"Sakal naam jam paasi ke chatur chit mahi jaanu | 304 |","meaning_en":"O wise one, know in your mind all these as names of Yama's noose. 304.","page":945,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਸਭ ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਹਨ। ਵਿਚਾਰਵਾਨ ਮਨ ਵਿਚ ਸਮਝ ਲੈਣ ॥੩੦੪॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[305],"number_text":"੩੦੫।","page":945,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਖਲ ਪਦ ਆਦਿ ਉਚਾਰਿ ਕੈ ਖੰਡਨਿ ਅੰਤਿ ਬਖਾਨ।","roman":"Khal pad aadi uchaari kai khandni anti bakhaan |","meaning_en":"Utter the word 'khal' (wicked) first, and speak 'khandani' (breaker) at the end;","page":945,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਖਲ' ਪਦ ਕਥਨ ਕਰ ਕੇ, ਬਾਦ ਵਿਚ 'ਖੰਡਨਿ' ਪਦ ਜੋੜ ਦਿਓ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਸਕਲ ਨਾਮ ਜਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਚੀਨੀਅਹੁ ਚਤੁਰ ਸੁਜਾਨ। ੩੦੫।","roman":"Sakal naam jam paasi ke cheeneeahu chatur sujaan | 305 |","meaning_en":"O wise and knowing ones, recognise all these as names of Yama's noose. 305.","page":945,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਸਾਰੇ ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਹਨ। ਵਿਚਾਰਵਾਨ ਮਨ ਵਿਚ ਸੋਚ ਲੈਣ ॥੩੦੫॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[306],"number_text":"੩੦੬।","page":945,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਦਲ ਦਾਹਨਿ ਰਿਪੁ ਗ੍ਰਸਿਤਨੀ ਸਤ੍ਰੂ ਤਾਪਨੀ ਸੋਇ।","roman":"Dal daahni ripu grasitnee satroo taapnee soi |","meaning_en":"Burner of armies, seizer of foes, tormentor of enemies is it;","page":945,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਕਾਲ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਨਾਮ ਸਭ ਜਾ ਤੇ ਰਹਿਤ ਨ ਕੋਇ। ੩੦੬।","roman":"Kaal paasi ke naam sabh jaa te rahit na koi | 306 |","meaning_en":"these are all names of Kal's noose, from which no one is free. 306.","page":945,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਦਲ ਦਾਹਨਿ', 'ਰਿਪੁ ਗ੍ਰਸਿਤਨੀ' ਅਤੇ 'ਸਤ੍ਰੁ ਤਾਪਨੀ' (ਆਦਿ ਨਾਮ) ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਹਨ, ਜਿਨ੍ਰਹਾ ਤੋਂ ਕੋਈ ਵੀ ਖਾਲੀ ਨਹੀਂ ਹੈ ॥੩੦੬॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB","note_pa":"ਇਹ ਅਰਥ ਇਸ ਪੰਕਤੀ ਸਮੇਤ ਉੱਪਰਲੀਆਂ 2 ਪੰਕਤੀਆਂ ਦਾ ਇਕੱਠਾ ਹੈ।"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[307],"number_text":"੩੦੭।","page":945,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਜਾ ਪਦ ਪ੍ਰਿਥਮ ਉਚਾਰਿ ਕੈ ਮੀ ਪਦ ਅੰਤਿ ਬਖਾਨੁ।","roman":"Jaa pad pritham uchaari kai mee pad anti bakhaanu |","meaning_en":"First utter the syllable 'ja', and speak the syllable 'mi' at the end;","page":945,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"'ja' + 'mi' = jami (of Yama), a name of the noose; uncertain.","meaning_pa":"ਜਾ' ਪਦ ਨੂੰ ਪਹਿਲਾ ਉਚਾਰ ਕੇ ਪਿਛੋਂ 'ਮੀ' ਪਦ ਅੰਤ ਉਤੇ ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਜਾਮੀ ਪਦ ਏ ਹੋਤ ਹੈ ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਜਾਨੁ। ੩੦੭।","roman":"Jaamee pad e hot hai naam paasi ke jaanu | 307 |","meaning_en":"this becomes the word 'jami'; know it as a name of the noose. 307.","page":945,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਸ) 'ਜਾਮੀ' ਪਦ ਨੂੰ ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਸਮਝ ਲਵੋ ॥੩੦੭॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[308],"number_text":"੩੦੮।","page":945,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਦਿਸਾ ਬਾਰੁਣੀ ਪ੍ਰਿਥਮ ਕਹਿ ਏਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ ਕਹਿ ਅੰਤਿ।","roman":"Disaa baarunee pritham kahi esraasatr kahi anti |","meaning_en":"First say 'disa baruni' (the western direction, Varun's), and at the end say 'esarastra' (lord's weapon);","page":945,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"Lord of the west = Varun.","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਬਾਰੁਣੀ ਦਿਸਾ' (ਵਰਣ ਦੀ ਦਿਸ਼ਾ, ਪੱਛਮ) ਪਹਿਲਾ ਕਹਿ ਕੇ, ਫਿਰ 'ਏਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਅੰਤ ਉਤੇ ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਸਕਲ ਸ੍ਰੀ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਨਿਕਸਤ ਚਲਤ ਬਿਅੰਤ। ੩੦੮।","roman":"Naam sakal sree paasi ke niksat chalat biant | 308 |","meaning_en":"endless names of the revered noose come forth. 308.","page":945,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਬੇਅੰਤ ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਬਣਦੇ ਜਾਣਗੇ ॥੩੦੮॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[309],"number_text":"੩੦੯।","page":945,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਪਛਮ ਆਦਿ ਬਖਾਨਿ ਕੈ ਏਸਰ ਪੁਨਿ ਪਦ ਦੇਹੁ।","roman":"Pachham aadi bakhaani kai esar puni pad dehu |","meaning_en":"Speak 'pachham' (west) first, then add the word 'esar';","page":945,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਪਛਮ' ਪਦ ਕਹਿ ਕੇ ਫਿਰ 'ਏਸਰ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਹਿ ਦਿਓ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਆਯੁਧ ਬਹੁਰਿ ਬਖਾਨੀਐ ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਲਖਿ ਲੇਹੁ। ੩੦੯।","roman":"Aayudh bahuri bakhaaneeai naam paasi lakhi lehu | 309 |","meaning_en":"then speak 'ayudh', and recognise these as names of the noose. 309.","page":945,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਫਿਰ 'ਆਯੁਧ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਜੋੜ ਦਿਓ। (ਇਹ) ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਹੋ ਜਾਣਗੇ ॥੩੦੯॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[310],"number_text":"੩੧੦।","page":946,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਪ੍ਰਿਥਮ ਠਗਨ ਕੇ ਨਾਮ ਲੈ ਆਯੁਧ ਬਹੁਰਿ ਬਖਾਨ।","roman":"Pritham thagan ke naam lai aayudh bahuri bakhaan |","meaning_en":"First take the names of thugs (stranglers), then speak 'ayudh';","page":946,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"The thugs' weapon = the strangling noose.","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ ਠਗਾ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਲੈ ਕੇ, ਫਿਰ 'ਆਯੁਧ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਜੋੜ ਦਿਓ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਸਕਲ ਨਾਮ ਏ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਚਤੁਰ ਚਿਤ ਪਹਿਚਾਨ। ੩੧੦।","roman":"Sakal naam e paasi ke chatur chit pahichaan | 310 |","meaning_en":"O wise one, recognise in your mind all these as names of the noose. 310.","page":946,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਸਾਰੇ ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਹਨ। ਚਤੁਰ ਪੁਰਸ਼ ਮਨ ਵਿਚ ਵਿਚਾਰ ਲੈਣ ॥੩੧੦॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[311],"number_text":"੩੧੧।","page":946,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਬਾਟਿ ਆਦਿ ਪਦ ਉਚਰਿ ਕੈ ਹਾ ਪਦ ਅਸਤ੍ਰ ਬਖਾਨ।","roman":"Baati aadi pad uchri kai haa pad asatr bakhaan |","meaning_en":"Utter the word 'bat' (road) first, then speak 'ha' (destroyer) and 'astra';","page":946,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"Road-robber's weapon = the noose.","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਬਾਟਿ' ਪਦ ਦਾ ਉਚਾਰਨ ਕਰ ਕੇ, ਫਿਰ 'ਹਾ' ਅਤੇ 'ਅਸਤ੍ਰ' ਪਦ ਦਾ ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਹੋਤ ਹੈ ਚਤੁਰ ਲੀਜੀਅਹੁ ਜਾਨ। ੩੧੧।","roman":"Naam paasi ke hot hai chatur leejeeahu jaan | 311 |","meaning_en":"these become names of the noose; O wise one, know them. 311.","page":946,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਸਾਰੇ ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਹਨ। ਚਤੁਰ ਪੁਰਸ਼ੋ! ਮਨ ਵਿਚ ਜਾਣ ਲਵੋ ॥੩੧੧॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[312],"number_text":"੩੧੨।","page":946,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਮਗ ਪਦ ਆਦਿ ਬਖਾਨਿ ਕੈ ਛਿਦ ਪਦ ਅੰਤਿ ਬਖਾਨ।","roman":"Mag pad aadi bakhaani kai chhid pad anti bakhaan |","meaning_en":"Speak the word 'mag' (path) first, and speak the word 'chhid' (cutter) at the end;","page":946,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਮਗ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਹਿ ਕੇ, ਫਿਰ ਅੰਤ ਤੇ 'ਛਿਦ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਜੋੜ ਦਿਓ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਹੋਤ ਹੈ ਲੀਜੋ ਚਤੁਰ ਪਛਾਨ। ੩੧੨।","roman":"Naam paasi ke hot hai leejo chatur pachhaan | 312 |","meaning_en":"these become names of the noose; O wise one, recognise them. 312.","page":946,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਸਾਰੇ ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਹਨ। ਚਤੁਰ ਪੁਰਸ਼ ਸਮਝ ਲੈਣ ॥੩੧੨॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[313],"number_text":"੩੧੩।","page":946,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਮਾਰਗ ਆਦਿ ਬਖਾਨਿ ਕੈ ਮਾਰ ਬਖਾਨਹੁ ਅੰਤਿ।","roman":"Maarag aadi bakhaani kai maar bakhaanhu anti |","meaning_en":"Speak 'marag' (path) first, and speak 'mar' (killer) at the end;","page":946,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਮਾਰਗ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਪਹਿਲਾ ਕਹਿ ਕੇ, (ਪਿਛੋਂ) 'ਮਾਰ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਅੰਤ ਤੇ ਜੋੜ ਦਿਓ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੋ ਹੋਤ ਹੈ ਨਿਕਸਤ ਚਲੈ ਬਿਅੰਤ। ੩੧੩।","roman":"Naam paasi ko hot hai niksat chalai biant | 313 |","meaning_en":"it becomes a name of the noose; endless names come forth. 313.","page":946,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਸ ਤਰ੍ਰਹਾ) ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਬੇਅੰਤ ਨਾਮ ਬਣਦੇ ਜਾਣਗੇ ॥੩੧੩॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[314],"number_text":"੩੧੪।","page":946,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਪੰਥ ਆਦਿ ਪਦ ਉਚਰਿ ਕੈ ਕਰਖਣ ਪੁਨਿ ਪਦ ਦੇਹੁ।","roman":"Panth aadi pad uchri kai karkhan puni pad dehu |","meaning_en":"Utter the word 'panth' (path) first, then add the word 'karkhan' (dragger);","page":946,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਪੰਥ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਉਚਾਰ ਕੇ ਫਿਰ 'ਕਰਖਣ' ਪਦ ਕਹੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਆਯੁਧ ਬਹੁਰਿ ਬਖਾਨੀਐ ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਲਖਿ ਲੇਹੁ। ੩੧੪।","roman":"Aayudh bahuri bakhaaneeai naam paasi lakhi lehu | 314 |","meaning_en":"then speak 'ayudh', and recognise these as names of the noose. 314.","page":946,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਫਿਰ 'ਆਯੁਧ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਜੋੜੋ। (ਇਹ) ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਜਾਣ ਲਵੋ ॥੩੧੪॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[315],"number_text":"੩੧੫।","page":946,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਬਾਟ ਆਦਿ ਸਬਦ ਉਚਾਰਿ ਕੈ ਹਾ ਅਸਤ੍ਰਾਂਤਿ ਬਖਾਨ।","roman":"Baat aadi sabad uchaari kai haa astraanti bakhaan |","meaning_en":"Uttering the word 'bat' first, speak 'ha' and 'astra' at the end;","page":946,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੋ ਹੋਤ ਹੈ ਚੀਨੀਅਹੁ ਗੁਨਨ ਨਿਧਾਨ। ੩੧੫।","roman":"Naam paasi ko hot hai cheeneeahu gunan nidhaan | 315 |","meaning_en":"it becomes a name of the noose; O treasury of virtues, recognise it. 315.","page":946,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਬਾਟ' ਪਦ ਉਚਾਰ ਕੇ, ਫਿਰ ਅੰਤ ਤੇ 'ਅਸਤ੍ਰ' (ਸ਼ਬਦ) ਦਾ ਬਖਾਨ ਕਰੋ। (ਇਹ) ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਹਨ। ਬੁੱਧੀਮਾਨ ਵਿਚਾਰ ਲੈਣ ॥੩੧੫॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB","note_pa":"ਇਹ ਅਰਥ ਇਸ ਪੰਕਤੀ ਸਮੇਤ ਉੱਪਰਲੀਆਂ 2 ਪੰਕਤੀਆਂ ਦਾ ਇਕੱਠਾ ਹੈ।"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[316],"number_text":"੩੧੬।","page":946,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਰਾਹ ਆਦਿ ਪਦ ਉਚਰੀਐ ਰਿਪੁ ਕਹਿ ਅਸਤ੍ਰ ਬਖਾਨ।","roman":"Raah aadi pad uchreeai ripu kahi asatr bakhaan |","meaning_en":"Utter the word 'rah' (road) first, say 'ripu', and speak 'astra';","page":946,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਰਾਹ' ਪਦ ਦਾ ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ, (ਫਿਰ) 'ਰਿਪੁ' ਅਤੇ 'ਅਸਤ੍ਰ' ਪਦ ਦਾ ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਹੋਤ ਹੈ ਚਤੁਰ ਲੀਜੀਅਹੁ ਜਾਨ। ੩੧੬।","roman":"Naam paasi ke hot hai chatur leejeeahu jaan | 316 |","meaning_en":"these become names of the noose; O wise one, know them. 316.","page":946,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਬਣਦੇ ਹਨ। ਸੂਝਵਾਨ ਸੋਚ ਕਰ ਲੈਣ ॥੩੧੬॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[317],"number_text":"੩੧੭।","page":946,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਪ੍ਰਿਥਮੈ ਧਨ ਸਬਦੋ ਉਚਰਿ ਹਰਤਾ ਆਯੁਧ ਦੀਨ।","roman":"Prithmai dhan sabdo uchri hartaa aayudh deen |","meaning_en":"First utter the word 'dhan' (wealth), and give 'harta' (robber) and 'ayudh';","page":946,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਧਨ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਦਾ ਉਚਾਰਨ ਕਰੋ, ਫਿਰ 'ਹਰਤਾ' ਅਤੇ 'ਆਯੁਧ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਜੋੜੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਹੋਤ ਹੈ ਚਤੁਰ ਲੀਜੀਅਹੁ ਚੀਨ। ੩੧੭।","roman":"Naam paasi ke hot hai chatur leejeeahu cheen | 317 |","meaning_en":"these become names of the noose; O wise one, recognise them. 317.","page":946,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਇਹ ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਬਣਦੇ ਹਨ, ਸੂਝਵਾਨ ਸਮਝ ਲੈਣ ॥੩੧੭॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[318],"number_text":"੩੧੮।","page":946,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਮਾਲ ਆਦਿ ਸਬਦੋਚਰਿ ਕੈ ਕਾਲ ਜਾਲ ਕਹਿ ਅੰਤਿ।","roman":"Maal aadi sabdochri kai kaal jaal kahi anti |","meaning_en":"Uttering the word 'mal' (goods) first, say 'kal jal' (deadly net) at the end;","page":946,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਕਾਲ ਜਾਲ: perhaps 'kal' = taker; uncertain.","meaning_pa":"ਮਾਲ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਪਹਿਲਾ ਉਚਾਰ ਕੇ (ਫਿਰ) 'ਕਾਲ ਜਾਲ' ਅੰਤ ਉਤੇ ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਸਕਲ ਨਾਮ ਇਹ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਚੀਨੀਅਹੁ ਪ੍ਰਗ੍ਯਾਵੰਤ। ੩੧੮।","roman":"Sakal naam ih paasi ke cheeneeahu pragyaavant | 318 |","meaning_en":"O men of understanding, recognise all these as names of the noose. 318.","page":946,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਸਾਰੇ ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਹਨ। ਬੁੱਧੀਮਾਨ ਸੋਚ ਲੈਣ ॥੩੧੮॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[319],"number_text":"੩੧੯।","page":946,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਮਾਯਾ ਹਰਨ ਉਚਾਰਿ ਕੈ ਆਯੁਧ ਬਹੁਰਿ ਬਖਾਨ।","roman":"Maayaa haran uchaari kai aayudh bahuri bakhaan |","meaning_en":"Uttering 'maya haran' (robber of wealth), then speak 'ayudh';","page":946,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਪਹਿਲਾ) 'ਮਾਯਾ ਹਰਨ' ਪਦ ਦਾ ਕਥਨ ਕਰ ਕੇ, ਫਿਰ 'ਆਯੁਧ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਹਿ ਦਿਓ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਸਕਲ ਨਾਮ ਏ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਚਤੁਰ ਚਿਤ ਮਹਿ ਜਾਨ। ੩੧੯।","roman":"Sakal naam e paasi ke chatur chit mahi jaan | 319 |","meaning_en":"O wise one, know in your mind all these as names of the noose. 319.","page":946,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਸਾਰੇ 'ਪਾਸ' ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਹਨ। ਸੂਝਵਾਨ ਮਨ ਵਿਚ ਜਾਣ ਲੈਣ ॥੩੧੯॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[320],"number_text":"੩੨੦।","page":946,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਮਗਹਾ ਪਥਹਾ ਪੈਂਡਹਾ ਧਨਹਾ ਦ੍ਰਿਬਹਾ ਸੋਇ।","roman":"Maghaa pathhaa paindhaa dhanhaa dribhaa soi |","meaning_en":"Magha, pathha, painda-ha (road-robber), dhanha, dribha (robber of wealth) is it;","page":946,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਮਗਹਾ', 'ਪਥਹਾ', 'ਪੈਂਡਹਾ', 'ਧਨਹਾ', 'ਦ੍ਰਿਬਹਾ' (ਸਭ ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ) ਹਨ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਜਾ ਕੋ ਡਾਰਤ ਸੋ ਸਨੋ ਪਥਕ ਨ ਉਬਰ੍ਯੋ ਕੋਇ। ੩੨੦।","roman":"Jaa ko daarat so sano pathak na ubryo koi | 320 |","meaning_en":"listen: no traveller on whom it is thrown has escaped. 320.","page":946,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਸੋ ਸਨੋ: read as 'listen'; uncertain.","meaning_pa":"ਜਿਸ ਉਤੇ (ਠਗ) ਇਸ ਨੂੰ ਸੁਟਦਾ ਹੈ, ਉਹ (ਰਾਹੀ) ਬਚ ਨਹੀਂ ਸਕਦਾ ॥੩੨੦॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[321],"number_text":"੩੨੧।","page":946,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਬਿਖੀਆ ਆਦਿ ਬਖਾਨਿ ਕੈ ਆਯੁਧ ਅੰਤਿ ਉਚਾਰ।","roman":"Bikheeaa aadi bakhaani kai aayudh anti uchaar |","meaning_en":"Speak 'bikhia' (poison/worldly wealth) first, and utter 'ayudh' at the end;","page":946,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਬਿਖੀਆ: 'wealth' (maya) or 'poison'; uncertain.","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਬਿਖੀਆ' (ਸ਼ਬਦ) ਕਹਿ ਕੇ ਫਿਰ ਅੰਤ ਵਿਚ 'ਆਯੁਧ' ਉਚਾਰੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਹੋਤ ਹੈ ਲੀਜੀਅਹੁ ਚਤੁਰ ਸੁ ਧਾਰ। ੩੨੧।","roman":"Naam paasi ke hot hai leejeeahu chatur su dhaar | 321 |","meaning_en":"these become names of the noose; O wise one, take them, set right. 321.","page":946,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਹੁੰਦੇ ਹਨ। ਚਤੁਰ ਲੋਗ ਵਿਚਾਰ ਕਰ ਲੈਣ ॥੩੨੧॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[322],"number_text":"੩੨੨।","page":946,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਬਿਖ ਸਬਦਾਦਿ ਉਚਾਰਿ ਕੈ ਦਾਇਕ ਅਸਤ੍ਰ ਬਖਾਨ।","roman":"Bikh sabdaadi uchaari kai daaik asatr bakhaan |","meaning_en":"Uttering the word 'bikh' (poison) first, speak 'daik' (giver) and 'astra';","page":946,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"Poison-giver's weapon? Chain uncertain.","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਬਿਖ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਉਚਾਰ ਕੇ ਫਿਰ 'ਦਾਇਕ' ਅਤੇ 'ਅਸਤ੍ਰ' ਪਦ ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸ ਕੇ ਹੋਤ ਹੈ ਚਤੁਰ ਲੀਜੀਅਹੁ ਜਾਨ। ੩੨੨।","roman":"Naam paas ke hot hai chatur leejeeahu jaan | 322 |","meaning_en":"these become names of the noose; O wise one, know them. 322.","page":946,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਹੁੰਦੇ ਹਨ। ਸਿਆਣੇ ਲੋਗ ਜਾਣ ਲੈਣ ॥੩੨੨॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[323],"number_text":"੩੨੩।","page":946,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਚੰਦ੍ਰਭਗਾ ਕੇ ਨਾਮ ਲੈ ਪਤਿ ਕਹਿ ਅਸਤ੍ਰ ਬਖਾਨ।","roman":"Chandrabhgaa ke naam lai pati kahi asatr bakhaan |","meaning_en":"Take the names of the Chandrabhaga (Chenab), say 'pati', and speak 'astra';","page":946,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"Lord of rivers = the ocean/Varun; his weapon = the noose.","meaning_pa":"ਚੰਦ੍ਰਭਗਾ' ਦਾ ਨਾ ਪਹਿਲਾ ਲੈ ਕੇ ਫਿਰ 'ਪਤਿ' ਅਤੇ 'ਅਸਤ੍ਰ' ਦਾ ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਹੋਤ ਹੈ ਚੀਨੀਅਹੁ ਪ੍ਰਗ੍ਯਾਵਾਨ। ੩੨੩।","roman":"Naam paasi ke hot hai cheeneeahu pragyaavaan | 323 |","meaning_en":"these become names of the noose; O men of understanding, recognise them. 323.","page":946,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[324],"number_text":"੩੨੪।","page":946,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਸਤੁਦ੍ਰਵ ਨਾਥ ਬਖਾਨ ਕੈ ਪੁਨਿ ਕਹਿ ਅਸਤ੍ਰ ਬਿਸੇਖ।","roman":"Satudrav naath bakhaan kai puni kahi asatr bisekh |","meaning_en":"Speak 'Satudrav-nath' (lord of the Sutlej), then say 'astra' especially;","page":946,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਹਨ। ਵਿਦਵਾਨ ਲੋਗ ਸਮਝ ਲੈਣ ॥੩੨੩॥ (ਪਹਿਲਾ) 'ਸਤੁਦ੍ਰਵ ਨਾਥ' (ਸ਼ਬਦ) ਕਹਿ ਕੇ ਫਿਰ 'ਅਸਤ੍ਰ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB","note_pa":"ਇਹ ਅਰਥ ਇਸ ਪੰਕਤੀ ਸਮੇਤ ਉੱਪਰਲੀਆਂ 2 ਪੰਕਤੀਆਂ ਦਾ ਇਕੱਠਾ ਹੈ।"},{"gurmukhi":"ਸਕਲ ਨਾਮ ਏ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਨਿਕਸਤ ਚਲਤੁ ਅਸੇਖ। ੩੨੪।","roman":"Sakal naam e paasi ke niksat chaltu asekh | 324 |","meaning_en":"all these names of the noose come forth without end. 324.","page":946,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਸ ਤਰ੍ਰਹਾ) ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਅਨੰਤ ਨਾਮ ਬਣਦੇ ਜਾਣਗੇ ॥੩੨੪॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[325],"number_text":"੩੨੫।","page":946,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਸਤਲੁਜ ਸਬਦਾਦਿ ਬਖਾਨਿ ਕੈ ਏਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ ਕਹਿ ਅੰਤਿ।","roman":"Satluj sabdaadi bakhaani kai esraasatr kahi anti |","meaning_en":"Speak the word 'Satluj' first, and at the end say 'esarastra';","page":946,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਸਤਲੁਜ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਹਿ ਕੇ (ਮਗਰੋਂ) 'ਏਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ' ਕਹਿ ਦਿਓ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਸਕਲ ਹੈ ਪਾਸ ਕੇ ਚੀਨ ਲੇਹੁ ਬੁਧਿਵੰਤ। ੩੨੫।","roman":"Naam sakal hai paas ke cheen lehu budhivant | 325 |","meaning_en":"these are all names of the noose; O wise ones, recognise them. 325.","page":946,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਹਨ। ਸੂਝਵਾਨੋ! ਨਿਸਚੈ ਕਰ ਲਵੋ ॥੩੨੫॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[326],"number_text":"੩੨੬।","page":946,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਪ੍ਰਿਥਮ ਬਿਪਾਸਾ ਨਾਮ ਲੈ ਏਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ ਪੁਨਿ ਭਾਖੁ।","roman":"Pritham bipaasaa naam lai esraasatr puni bhaakhu |","meaning_en":"First take the name 'Bipasa' (the Beas), then speak 'esarastra';","page":946,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਬਿਪਾਸਾ' (ਬਿਆਸ) ਨਾਮ ਲੈ ਕੇ, ਫਿਰ 'ਏਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ' ਕਹਿ ਦਿਓ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਸਕਲ ਸ੍ਰੀ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਚੀਨ ਚਿਤ ਮੈ ਰਾਖੁ। ੩੨੬।","roman":"Naam sakal sree paasi ke cheen chit mai raakhu | 326 |","meaning_en":"recognise all these as names of the revered noose and keep them in mind. 326.","page":946,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਹਨ। ਚਤੁਰ ਲੋਗ ਨਿਸਚਾ ਕਰ ਲੈਣ ॥੩੨੬॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[327],"number_text":"੩੨੭।","page":947,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਰਾਵੀ ਸਾਵੀ ਆਦਿ ਕਹਿ ਆਯੁਧ ਏਸ ਬਖਾਨ।","roman":"Raavee saavee aadi kahi aayudh es bakhaan |","meaning_en":"Say 'Ravi', 'Savi' first, then speak 'ayudh' and 'es';","page":947,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਸਾਵੀ: obscure river name; uncertain.","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਰਾਵੀ' ਨਦੀ ('ਸਾਵੀ' ਸ੍ਰਾਵੀ) ਕਹਿ ਦਿਓ, ਫਿਰ 'ਏਸ ਆਯੁਧ' ਪਦ ਦਾ ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਹੋਤ ਹੈ ਚੀਨਹੁ ਪ੍ਰਗ੍ਯਾਵਾਨ। ੩੨੭।","roman":"Naam paasi ke hot hai cheenhu pragyaavaan | 327 |","meaning_en":"these become names of the noose; O men of understanding, recognise them. 327.","page":947,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[328],"number_text":"੩੨੮।","page":947,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਸਾਵੀ ਈਸ੍ਰਾਵੀ ਸਭਿਨ ਆਯੁਧ ਬਹੁਰਿ ਉਚਾਰ।","roman":"Saavee eesraavee sabhin aayudh bahuri uchaar |","meaning_en":"Say 'Savi', 'Isravi', all of these, then utter 'ayudh';","page":947,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਈਸ੍ਰਾਵੀ: perhaps Iravati (the Ravi); uncertain.","meaning_pa":"ਇਹ ਸਾਰੇ ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਹੋ ਜਾਦੇ ਹਨ। ਵਿਦਵਾਨ ਸਮਝ ਲੈਣ ॥੩੨੭॥ (ਪਹਿਲਾ) 'ਸਾਵੀ' ਅਤੇ 'ਈਸ੍ਰਾਵੀ' ਕਹਿ ਕੇ ਫਿਰ 'ਆਯੁਧ' ਪਦ ਜੋੜ ਦਿਓ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB","note_pa":"ਇਹ ਅਰਥ ਇਸ ਪੰਕਤੀ ਸਮੇਤ ਉੱਪਰਲੀਆਂ 2 ਪੰਕਤੀਆਂ ਦਾ ਇਕੱਠਾ ਹੈ।"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਹੋਤ ਹੈ ਲੀਜਹੁ ਸੁ ਕਬਿ ਸੁਧਾਰ। ੩੨੮।","roman":"Naam paasi ke hot hai leejhu su kabi sudhaar | 328 |","meaning_en":"these become names of the noose; good poets, take them, set right. 328.","page":947,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਸਾਰੇ ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਹੋ ਜਾਦੇ ਹਨ। ਵਿਦਵਾਨ ਵਿਚਾਰ ਕਰ ਲੈਣ ॥੩੨੮॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[329],"number_text":"੩੨੯।","page":947,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਜਲ ਸਿੰਧੁ ਏਸ ਬਖਾਨਿ ਕੈ ਆਯੁਧ ਅੰਤਿ ਬਖਾਨ।","roman":"Jal sindhu es bakhaani kai aayudh anti bakhaan |","meaning_en":"Speak 'jal' (water), 'Sindhu', 'es', and speak 'ayudh' at the end;","page":947,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਪਹਿਲਾ) 'ਜਲ ਸਿੰਧੁ' ਕਹਿ ਕੇ ਫਿਰ 'ਏਸ' ਅਤੇ 'ਆਯੁਧ' ਪਦ ਦਾ ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਹੋਤ ਹੈ ਚਤੁਰ ਚਿਤ ਮਹਿ ਜਾਨ। ੩੨੯।","roman":"Naam paasi ke hot hai chatur chit mahi jaan | 329 |","meaning_en":"these become names of the noose; O wise one, know them in your mind. 329.","page":947,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਸਾਰੇ ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਬਣਦੇ ਹਨ। ਸੂਝਵਾਨੋ! ਵਿਚਾਰ ਲਵੋ ॥੩੨੯॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[330],"number_text":"੩੩੦।","page":947,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਬਿਹਥਿ ਆਦਿ ਸਬਦੋਚਰਿ ਕੈ ਏਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ ਕਹੁ ਅੰਤਿ।","roman":"Bihthi aadi sabdochri kai esraasatr kahu anti |","meaning_en":"Uttering the word 'Bihath' (the Jhelum) first, say 'esarastra' at the end;","page":947,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਬਿਹਥਿ: the Vitasta (Jhelum).","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਬਿਹਥਿ' ਪਦ ਕਹਿ ਕੇ, ਫਿਰ 'ਏਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ' (ਸ਼ਬਦ) ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਸਕਲ ਨਾਮ ਏ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਚੀਨ ਲੇਹੁ ਮਤਿਵੰਤ। ੩੩੦।","roman":"Sakal naam e paasi ke cheen lehu mativant | 330 |","meaning_en":"these are all names of the noose; O wise ones, recognise them. 330.","page":947,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਹਨ। ਬੁੱਧੀਮਾਨ ਸਮਝ ਲੈਣ ॥੩੩੦॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[331],"number_text":"੩੩੧।","page":947,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਸਿੰਧੁ ਆਦਿ ਸਬਦ ਉਚਰਿ ਕੈ ਆਯੁਧ ਅੰਤਿ ਬਖਾਨ।","roman":"Sindhu aadi sabad uchri kai aayudh anti bakhaan |","meaning_en":"Uttering the word 'Sindhu' first, speak 'ayudh' at the end;","page":947,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਸਿੰਧੁ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਹਿ ਕੇ ਅੰਤ ਉਤੇ 'ਆਯੁਧ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਦਾ ਬਖਾਨ ਕਰੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਹੋਤ ਸਭ ਚੀਨਹੁ ਪ੍ਰਗ੍ਯਾਵਾਨ। ੩੩੧।","roman":"Naam paasi ke hot sabh cheenhu pragyaavaan | 331 |","meaning_en":"these all become names of the noose; O men of understanding, recognise them. 331.","page":947,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[332],"number_text":"੩੩੨।","page":947,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਨੀਲ ਆਦਿ ਸਬਦੁਚਰਿ ਕੈ ਏਸਰ ਅਸਤ੍ਰ ਬਖਾਨ।","roman":"Neel aadi sabduchri kai esar asatr bakhaan |","meaning_en":"Uttering the word 'Nil' (the Nile? or Nilab, the Indus) first, speak 'esar' and 'astra';","page":947,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਨੀਲ: river name; uncertain which.","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਹੋ ਜਾਦੇ ਹਨ। ਸੂਝਵਾਨ ਵਿਚਾਰ ਲੈਣ ॥੩੩੧॥ ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਨੀਲ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਉਚਾਰ ਕੇ, ਫਿਰ 'ਏਸਰ ਅਸਤ੍ਰ' ਦਾ ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB","note_pa":"ਇਹ ਅਰਥ ਇਸ ਪੰਕਤੀ ਸਮੇਤ ਉੱਪਰਲੀਆਂ 2 ਪੰਕਤੀਆਂ ਦਾ ਇਕੱਠਾ ਹੈ।"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਹੋਤ ਹੈ ਚੀਨ ਲੇਹੁ ਸੁਰ ਗਿਆਨ। ੩੩੨।","roman":"Naam paasi ke hot hai cheen lehu sur giaan | 332 |","meaning_en":"these become names of the noose; O knowing one, recognise them. 332.","page":947,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਪਾਸ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਹੋ ਜਾਦਾ ਹੈ। ਚਤੁਰ ਪੁਰਸ਼ ਵਿਚਾਰ ਕਰ ਲੈਣ ॥੩੩੨॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[333],"number_text":"੩੩੩।","page":947,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਅਸਿਤ ਬਾਰਿ ਸਬਦਾਦਿ ਕਹਿ ਪਤਿ ਅਸਤ੍ਰਾਂਤਿ ਬਖਾਨ।","roman":"Asit baari sabdaadi kahi pati astraanti bakhaan |","meaning_en":"Say the words 'asit bari' (dark water) first, and speak 'pati' and 'astra' at the end;","page":947,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"Dark water = the Yamuna? uncertain.","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਅਸਿਤ ਬਾਰਿ' ਪਦ ਕਹਿ ਕੇ ਫਿਰ 'ਪਤਿ' ਅਤੇ ਅੰਤ ਤੇ 'ਅਸਤ੍ਰ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਹੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸ ਕੇ ਹੋਤ ਹੈ ਚੀਨ ਲੇਹੁ ਮਤਿਵਾਨ। ੩੩੩।","roman":"Naam paas ke hot hai cheen lehu mativaan | 333 |","meaning_en":"these become names of the noose; O wise ones, recognise them. 333.","page":947,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਪਾਸ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਹੁੰਦਾ ਹੈ। ਗਿਆਨਵਾਨ ਸਮਝ ਲੈਣ ॥੩੩੩॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[334],"number_text":"੩੩੪।","page":947,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਕਿਸਨਾ ਆਦਿ ਉਚਾਰਿ ਕੈ ਆਯੁਧ ਏਸ ਬਖਾਨ।","roman":"Kisnaa aadi uchaari kai aayudh es bakhaan |","meaning_en":"Uttering 'Kisna' (the Krishna river) first, speak 'ayudh' and 'es';","page":947,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਕਿਸਨਾ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਉਚਾਰ ਕੇ ਮਗਰੋਂ) 'ਆਯੁਧ' ਅਤੇ 'ਏਸ' ਸ਼ਬਦਾ ਦਾ ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸ ਕੇ ਹੋਤ ਹੈ ਲੀਜਹੁ ਚਤੁਰ ਪਛਾਨ। ੩੩੪।","roman":"Naam paas ke hot hai leejhu chatur pachhaan | 334 |","meaning_en":"these become names of the noose; O wise one, recognise them. 334.","page":947,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਪਾਸ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਹੁੰਦਾ ਹੈ। ਸੂਝਵਾਨੋ! ਸਮਝ ਲਵੋ ॥੩੩੪॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[335],"number_text":"੩੩੫।","page":947,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਸਬਦ ਆਦਿ ਕਹਿ ਭੀਮਰਾ ਏਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ ਕਹਿ ਅੰਤ।","roman":"Sabad aadi kahi bheemraa esraasatr kahi ant |","meaning_en":"Say the word 'Bhimra' (the Bhima river) first, and say 'esarastra' at the end;","page":947,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਸ਼ੁਰੂ ਵਿਚ 'ਭੀਮਰਾ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਹਿ ਕੇ, ਫਿਰ 'ਏਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ' ਦਾ ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸ ਕੇ ਹੋਤ ਹੈ ਚੀਨ ਲੇਹੁ ਮਤਿਵੰਤ। ੩੩੫।","roman":"Naam paas ke hot hai cheen lehu mativant | 335 |","meaning_en":"these become names of the noose; O wise ones, recognise them. 335.","page":947,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਹੋ ਜਾਦੇ ਹਨ। ਬੁੱਧੀਮਾਨੋ! ਸਮਝ ਲਵੋ ॥੩੩੫॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[336],"number_text":"੩੩੬।","page":947,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਤਪਤੀ ਆਦਿ ਉਚਾਰਿ ਕੈ ਆਯੁਧ ਏਸ ਬਖਾਨ।","roman":"Taptee aadi uchaari kai aayudh es bakhaan |","meaning_en":"Uttering 'Tapti' first, speak 'ayudh' and 'es';","page":947,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਤਪਤੀ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਦਾ ਉਚਾਰਨ ਕਰੋ, ਫਿਰ 'ਏਸ ਆਯੁਧ' ਜੋੜੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸ ਕੇ ਹੋਤ ਹੈ ਸੁ ਜਨਿ ਸਤਿ ਕਰਿ ਜਾਨ। ੩੩੬।","roman":"Naam paas ke hot hai su jani sati kari jaan | 336 |","meaning_en":"these become names of the noose; good people, know this as true. 336.","page":947,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਪਾਸ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਹੁੰਦਾ ਹੈ। ਸਜਣੋ! ਸਚ ਕਰ ਕੇ ਮੰਨੋ ॥੩੩੬॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[337],"number_text":"੩੩੭।","page":947,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਬਾਰਿ ਰਾਜ ਸਮੁੰਦੇਸ ਭਨਿ ਸਰਿਤ ਸਰਿਧ ਪਤਿ ਭਾਖੁ।","roman":"Baari raaj samundes bhani sarit saridh pati bhaakhu |","meaning_en":"Say 'Bari-raj' (king of waters), 'Samundes' (lord of the sea), and speak 'sarit-sarid-pati' (lord of rivers);","page":947,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਬਾਰਿ ਰਾਜ, ਸਮੁੰਦੇਸ, ਸਰਿਤ, ਸਰਿਧ (ਤੋਂ ਬਾਦ) 'ਪਤਿ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਲਗਾ ਕੇ,","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਆਯੁਧ ਪੁਨਿ ਕਹਿ ਪਾਸ ਕੇ ਚੀਨ ਨਾਮ ਚਿਤਿ ਰਾਖੁ। ੩੩੭।","roman":"Aayudh puni kahi paas ke cheen naam chiti raakhu | 337 |","meaning_en":"then say 'ayudh', and keep these in mind as names of the noose. 337.","page":947,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਫਿਰ 'ਆਯੁਧ' ਕਹਿ ਦਿਓ। (ਇਹ) ਸਾਰੇ ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਹਨ, (ਇਨ੍ਰਹਾ ਨੂੰ) ਚਿਤ ਵਿਚ ਯਾਦ ਰਖੋ ॥੩੩੭॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[338],"number_text":"੩੩੮।","page":947,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਬਰੁਣ ਬੀਰਹਾ ਆਦਿ ਕਹਿ ਆਯੁਧ ਪੁਨਿ ਪਦ ਦੇਹੁ।","roman":"Barun beerhaa aadi kahi aayudh puni pad dehu |","meaning_en":"Say 'Barun', 'Birha' first, then add the word 'ayudh';","page":947,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਬੀਰਹਾ: perhaps 'slayer of heroes'; uncertain.","meaning_pa":"ਬਰੁਣ' ਜਾ 'ਬੀਰਹਾ' ਪਦ ਪਹਿਲਾ ਕਹਿ ਕੇ ਫਿਰ 'ਆਯੁਧ' ਪਦ ਜੋੜੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸ ਕੇ ਹੋਤ ਹੈ ਚੀਨ ਚਤੁਰ ਚਿਤਿ ਲੇਹੁ। ੩੩੮।","roman":"Naam paas ke hot hai cheen chatur chiti lehu | 338 |","meaning_en":"these become names of the noose; O wise one, recognise them in your mind. 338.","page":947,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਹੁੰਦੇ ਹਨ। ਸਮਝਦਾਰ ਚਿਤ ਵਿਚ ਵਿਚਾਰ ਕਰ ਲੈਣ ॥੩੩੮॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[339],"number_text":"੩੩੯।","page":947,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਨਦੀ ਰਾਜ ਸਰਿਤੀਸ ਭਨਿ ਸਮੁੰਦਰਾਟ ਪੁਨਿ ਭਾਖੁ।","roman":"Nadee raaj saritees bhani samundraat puni bhaakhu |","meaning_en":"Say 'Nadi-raj', 'Saritis' (lord of rivers), then speak 'Samundrat' (king of the sea);","page":947,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਨਦੀ-ਰਾਜ', 'ਸਰਿਤੀਸ' ਅਤੇ 'ਸਮੁੰਦ-ਰਾਟ' ਕਹਿ ਕੇ,","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਆਯੁਧ ਅੰਤਿ ਬਖਾਨੀਐ ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਲਖਿ ਰਾਖੁ। ੩੩੯।","roman":"Aayudh anti bakhaaneeai naam paasi lakhi raakhu | 339 |","meaning_en":"speak 'ayudh' at the end, and keep these in mind as names of the noose. 339.","page":947,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਬਾਦ ਵਿਚ ਅੰਤ ਤੇ 'ਆਯੁਧ' ਕਹਿ ਦਿਓ। ਇਹ ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਸਮਝ ਲਵੋ ॥੩੩੯॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[340],"number_text":"੩੪੦।","page":947,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਬ੍ਰਹਮ ਪੁਤ੍ਰ ਪਦ ਆਦਿ ਕਹਿ ਏਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ ਕਹਿ ਅੰਤਿ।","roman":"Braham putr pad aadi kahi esraasatr kahi anti |","meaning_en":"Say the word 'Brahmaputra' first, and say 'esarastra' at the end;","page":947,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਬ੍ਰਹਮ ਪੁਤ੍ਰ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਹਿ ਕੇ ਫਿਰ 'ਏਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਹਿ ਦਿਓ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਸਕਲ ਹੀ ਚੀਨ ਲੇਹੁ ਮਤਿਵੰਤ। ੩੪੦।","roman":"Naam paasi ke sakal hee cheen lehu mativant | 340 |","meaning_en":"O wise ones, recognise all these as names of the noose. 340.","page":947,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਇਹ ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਹਨ। ਬੁੱਧੀਮਾਨੋ! ਸਮਝ ਲਵੋ ॥੩੪੦॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[341],"number_text":"੩੪੧।","page":947,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਬ੍ਰਹਮਾ ਆਦਿ ਬਖਾਨਿ ਕੈ ਅੰਤਿ ਪੁਤ੍ਰ ਪਦ ਦੇਹੁ।","roman":"Brahmaa aadi bakhaani kai anti putr pad dehu |","meaning_en":"Speak 'Brahma' first, and add the word 'putra' at the end;","page":947,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਬ੍ਰਹਮਾ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਹਿ ਕੇ, ਅੰਤ ਉਤੇ 'ਪੁਤ੍ਰ' ਪਦ ਰਖੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਆਯੁਧ ਏਸ ਬਖਾਨੀਐ ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਲਖਿ ਲੇਹੁ। ੩੪੧।","roman":"Aayudh es bakhaaneeai naam paasi lakhi lehu | 341 |","meaning_en":"speak 'ayudh' and 'es', and recognise these as names of the noose. 341.","page":947,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਫਿਰ) 'ਏਸ', 'ਆਯੁਧ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਜੋੜੋ। ਇਸ ਤਰ੍ਰਹਾ ਇਹ ਪਾਸ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਹੈ ॥੩੪੧॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[342],"number_text":"੩੪੨।","page":947,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਬ੍ਰਹਮਾ ਆਦਿ ਉਚਾਰਿ ਕੈ ਸੁਤ ਪਦ ਬਹੁਰਿ ਬਖਾਨ।","roman":"Brahmaa aadi uchaari kai sut pad bahuri bakhaan |","meaning_en":"Uttering 'Brahma' first, then speak the word 'sut' (son);","page":947,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਬ੍ਰਹਮਾ' ਪਦ ਕਹਿ ਕੇ ਫਿਰ 'ਸੁਤ'","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਏਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ ਪੁਨਿ ਭਾਖੀਐ ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਪਹਿਚਾਨ। ੩੪੨।","roman":"Esraasatr puni bhaakheeai naam paasi pahichaan | 342 |","meaning_en":"then speak 'esarastra', and recognise these as names of the noose. 342.","page":947,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਅਤੇ 'ਏਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ। (ਇਹ) ਪਾਸ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਹੈ ॥੩੪੨॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[343],"number_text":"੩੪੩।","page":947,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਜਗਤ ਪਿਤਾ ਪਦ ਪ੍ਰਿਥਮ ਕਹਿ ਸੁਤ ਪਦ ਅੰਤਿ ਬਖਾਨ।","roman":"Jagat pitaa pad pritham kahi sut pad anti bakhaan |","meaning_en":"Say the word 'Jagat-pita' (father of the world, Brahma) first, and speak 'sut' at the end;","page":947,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"'esarastra' understood.","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਜਗਤ ਪਿਤਾ' ਪਦ ਕਹਿ ਕੇ ਅੰਤ ਉਤੇ 'ਸੁਤ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਹੋਤ ਹੈ ਚੀਨੀਅਹੁ ਪ੍ਰਗਿਆਵਾਨ। ੩੪੩।","roman":"Naam paasi ke hot hai cheeneeahu pragiaavaan | 343 |","meaning_en":"these become names of the noose; O men of understanding, recognise them. 343.","page":947,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਪਾਸ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਹੋ ਜਾਦਾ ਹੈ। ਬੁੱਧੀਮਾਨੋ! ਸਮਝ ਲਵੋ ॥੩੪੩॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[344],"number_text":"੩੪੪।","page":948,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਘਘਰ ਆਦਿ ਉਚਾਰਿ ਕੈ ਈਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ ਕਹਿ ਅੰਤਿ।","roman":"Ghaghar aadi uchaari kai eesraasatr kahi anti |","meaning_en":"Uttering 'Ghaghar' (the Ghaggar) first, say 'isarastra' at the end;","page":948,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਘਘਰ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਉਚਾਰ ਕੇ, (ਫਿਰ) ਅੰਤ ਤੇ 'ਈਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ' ਕਹਿ ਦਿਓ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸ ਕੇ ਹੋਤ ਹੈ ਚੀਨੀਅਹੁ ਪ੍ਰਗਿਆਵੰਤ। ੩੪੪।","roman":"Naam paas ke hot hai cheeneeahu pragiaavant | 344 |","meaning_en":"these become names of the noose; O men of understanding, recognise them. 344.","page":948,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਪਾਸ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਹੈ। ਚਤੁਰ ਲੋਗੋ! ਸਮਝ ਲਵੋ ॥੩੪੪॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[345],"number_text":"੩੪੫।","page":948,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਆਦਿ ਸੁਰਸਤੀ ਉਚਰਿ ਕੈ ਏਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ ਕਹਿ ਅੰਤਿ।","roman":"Aadi surastee uchri kai esraasatr kahi anti |","meaning_en":"Uttering 'Sursati' (the Saraswati) first, say 'esarastra' at the end;","page":948,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਸੁਰਸਤੀ' ਪਦਾ ਦਾ ਉਚਾਰਨ ਕਰ ਕੇ (ਫਿਰ) ਅੰਤ ਤੇ 'ਈਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਹਿ ਦਿਓ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸ ਕੇ ਸਕਲ ਹੀ ਚੀਨ ਲੇਹੁ ਮਤਿਵੰਤ। ੩੪੫।","roman":"Naam paas ke sakal hee cheen lehu mativant | 345 |","meaning_en":"O wise ones, recognise all these as names of the noose. 345.","page":948,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਇਸ ਸਾਰੇ ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਹੋ ਜਾਦੇ ਹਨ। ਬੁੱਧੀਮਾਨੋ! ਵਿਚਾਰ ਕਰ ਲਵੋ ॥੩੪੫॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[346],"number_text":"੩੪੬।","page":948,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਆਮੂ ਆਦਿ ਬਖਾਨਿ ਕੈ ਈਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ ਕਹਿ ਅੰਤਿ।","roman":"Aamoo aadi bakhaani kai eesraasatr kahi anti |","meaning_en":"Speak 'Amu' (the Oxus) first, and say 'isarastra' at the end;","page":948,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਆਮੂ' (ਇਕ ਨਦੀ ਵਿਸ਼ੇਸ਼) ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਹਿ ਕੇ ਫਿਰ 'ਈਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ' ਅੰਤ ਉਤੇ ਕਹੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਸਕਲ ਸ੍ਰੀ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਨਿਕਸਤ ਚਲਤ ਬਿਅੰਤ। ੩੪੬।","roman":"Naam sakal sree paasi ke niksat chalat biant | 346 |","meaning_en":"endless names of the revered noose come forth. 346.","page":948,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਸ ਤਰ੍ਰਹਾ) ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਬੇਅੰਤ ਨਾਮ ਬਣਦੇ ਜਾਣਗੇ ॥੩੪੬॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[347],"number_text":"੩੪੭।","page":948,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਸਮੁੰਦ ਗਾਮਨੀ ਜੇ ਨਦੀ ਤਿਨ ਕੇ ਨਾਮ ਬਖਾਨਿ।","roman":"Samund gaamnee je nadee tin ke naam bakhaani |","meaning_en":"Speak the names of the rivers that flow to the ocean;","page":948,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਸਮੁੰਦਰ ਵਲ ਜਾਣ ਵਾਲੀਆਂ ਜੋ ਨਦੀਆਂ ਹਨ, ਉਨ੍ਰਹਾ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਈਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ ਪੁਨਿ ਉਚਾਰੀਐ ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਪਹਿਚਾਨ। ੩੪੭।","roman":"Eesraasatr puni uchaareeai naam paasi pahichaan | 347 |","meaning_en":"then utter 'isarastra', and recognise these as names of the noose. 347.","page":948,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਮਗਰੋਂ) 'ਈਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਹਿ ਦਿਓ। (ਇਹ) ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਬਣ ਜਾਣਗੇ ॥੩੪੭॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[348],"number_text":"੩੪੮।","page":948,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਸਕਲ ਕਾਲ ਕੇ ਨਾਮ ਲੈ ਆਯੁਧ ਬਹੁਰਿ ਬਖਾਨ।","roman":"Sakal kaal ke naam lai aayudh bahuri bakhaan |","meaning_en":"Take all the names of Kal (Death), then speak 'ayudh';","page":948,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਪਹਿਲਾ) ਸਾਰੇ ਕਾਲ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਲੈ ਕੇ, ਫਿਰ 'ਆਯੁਧ' ਪਦ ਦਾ ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਹੋਤ ਹੈ ਚੀਨ ਲੇਹੁ ਮਤਿਵਾਨ। ੩੪੮।","roman":"Naam paasi ke hot hai cheen lehu mativaan | 348 |","meaning_en":"these become names of the noose; O wise ones, recognise them. 348.","page":948,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਬਣਦੇ ਜਾਦੇ ਹਨ। ਬੁੱਧੀਮਾਨੋ! ਮਨ ਵਿਚ ਵਿਚਾਰ ਕਰ ਲਵੋ ॥੩੪੮॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[349],"number_text":"੩੪੯।","page":948,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਦੁਘਧ ਸਬਦ ਪ੍ਰਿਥਮੈ ਉਚਰਿ ਨਿਧਿ ਕਹਿ ਈਸ ਬਖਾਨ।","roman":"Dughadh sabad prithmai uchri nidhi kahi ees bakhaan |","meaning_en":"First utter the word 'dughadh' (milk), say 'nidhi' (store), and speak 'is';","page":948,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"Store of milk = the ocean of milk; its lord Varun.","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਦੁਘਧ' (ਖੀਰ) ਸ਼ਬਦ ਉਚਾਰ ਕੇ ਫਿਰ 'ਨਿਧ' ਅਤੇ 'ਈਸ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਜੋੜੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਆਯੁਧ ਬਹੁਰਿ ਬਖਾਨੀਐ ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਪਹਿਚਾਨ। ੩੪੯।","roman":"Aayudh bahuri bakhaaneeai naam paasi pahichaan | 349 |","meaning_en":"then speak 'ayudh', and recognise these as names of the noose. 349.","page":948,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਫਿਰ 'ਆਯੁਧ' ਕਹਿ ਦਿਓ। (ਇਹ) ਪਾਸ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਬਣਦਾ ਹੈ ॥੩੪੯॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[350],"number_text":"੩੫੦।","page":948,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਪਾਨਿਧਿ ਪ੍ਰਿਥਮ ਬਖਾਨਿ ਕੈ ਈਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ ਕਹਿ ਅੰਤਿ।","roman":"Paanidhi pritham bakhaani kai eesraasatr kahi anti |","meaning_en":"Speak 'panidhi' (store of water) first, and say 'isarastra' at the end;","page":948,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਪਾਨਿਧਿ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਹਿ ਕੇ (ਫਿਰ) ਅੰਤ ਤੇ 'ਈਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ' ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਸਕਲ ਸ੍ਰੀ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਚੀਨਤ ਚਲੈ ਅਨੰਤ। ੩੫੦।","roman":"Naam sakal sree paasi ke cheenat chalai anant | 350 |","meaning_en":"endless names of the revered noose are recognised. 350.","page":948,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਸ ਤਰ੍ਰਹਾ) ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਅਨੰਤ ਨਾਮ ਬਣਦੇ ਜਾਣਗੇ ॥੩੫੦॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[351],"number_text":"੩੫੧।","page":948,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਸ੍ਰੋਨਜ ਆਦਿ ਉਚਾਰਿ ਕੈ ਨਿਧਿ ਕਹਿ ਈਸ ਬਖਾਨ।","roman":"Sronaj aadi uchaari kai nidhi kahi ees bakhaan |","meaning_en":"Uttering 'Sronaj' (blood-born?) first, say 'nidhi' and speak 'is';","page":948,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਸ੍ਰੋਨਜ: perhaps 'born of blood' = milk; uncertain.","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਸ੍ਰੋਨਜ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਹਿ ਕੇ, ਫਿਰ 'ਨਿਧਿ' ਅਤੇ 'ਈਸ' ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਆਯੁਧ ਭਾਖੋ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੋ ਨਿਕਸਤ ਨਾਮ ਪ੍ਰਮਾਨ। ੩੫੧।","roman":"Aayudh bhaakho paasi ko niksat naam pramaan | 351 |","meaning_en":"speak 'ayudh', and names of the noose come forth, as is proven. 351.","page":948,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਫਿਰ) 'ਆਯੁਧ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਹੋ। (ਇਸ ਤਰ੍ਰਹਾ) ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਨਿਕਲਦੇ ਆਣਗੇ ॥੩੫੧॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[352],"number_text":"੩੫੨।","page":948,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਛਿਤਜਜ ਆਦਿ ਬਖਾਨਿ ਕੈ ਈਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ ਕਹਿ ਅੰਤਿ।","roman":"Chhitjaj aadi bakhaani kai eesraasatr kahi anti |","meaning_en":"Speak 'Chhitijaj' (?) first, and say 'isarastra' at the end;","page":948,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਛਿਤਜਜ: perhaps 'earth-born' ... ; uncertain.","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਛਿਤਜਜ' ਪਦ ਕਹਿ ਕੇ (ਫਿਰ) ਅੰਤ ਤੇ 'ਈਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ' ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਸਕਲ ਨਾਮ ਸ੍ਰੀ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਚੀਨਹੁ ਪ੍ਰਗ੍ਯਾਵੰਤ। ੩੫੨।","roman":"Sakal naam sree paasi ke cheenhu pragyaavant | 352 |","meaning_en":"O men of understanding, recognise all these as names of the revered noose. 352.","page":948,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਸਾਰੇ ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਹਨ। ਬੁੱਧੀਮਾਨ ਲੋਗ ਜਾਣ ਲੈਣ ॥੩੫੨॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[353],"number_text":"੩੫੩।","page":948,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਇਸਤ੍ਰਿਨ ਆਦਿ ਬਖਾਨਿ ਕੈ ਰਜ ਪਦ ਅੰਤਿ ਉਚਾਰਿ।","roman":"Istrin aadi bakhaani kai raj pad anti uchaari |","meaning_en":"Speak 'istrin' (women) first, and utter the word 'raj' (?) at the end;","page":948,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"Chain through women (their milk?) to the ocean; uncertain.","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਇਸਤ੍ਰਿਨ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਹਿ ਕੇ, (ਫਿਰ) ਅੰਤ ਉਤੇ 'ਰਜ' ਪਦ ਦਾ ਉਚਾਰਨ ਕਰੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਈਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ ਕਹਿ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਲੀਜੀਐ ਨਾਮ ਸੁ ਧਾਰ। ੩੫੩।","roman":"Eesraasatr kahi paasi ke leejeeai naam su dhaar | 353 |","meaning_en":"saying 'isarastra', take these, set right, as names of the noose. 353.","page":948,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਫਿਰ) ਈਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ ਕਹਿ ਦਿਓ। ਇਹ ਪਾਸ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਸਮਝ ਲਵੋ ॥੩੫੩॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[354],"number_text":"੩੫੪।","page":948,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਰਿਜ ਆਦਿ ਉਚਾਰਿ ਕੈ ਈਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ ਪਦ ਦੇਹੁ।","roman":"Naarij aadi uchaari kai eesraasatr pad dehu |","meaning_en":"Uttering 'narij' (woman-born) first, add the word 'isarastra';","page":948,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"Woman-born = milk? uncertain.","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਨਾਰਿਜ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਉਚਾਰਨ ਕਰ ਕੇ, (ਮਗਰੋਂ) 'ਈਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ' ਪਦ ਜੋੜੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਸਕਲ ਸ੍ਰੀ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਚੀਨ ਚਤੁਰ ਚਿਤਿ ਲੇਹੁ। ੩੫੪।","roman":"Naam sakal sree paasi ke cheen chatur chiti lehu | 354 |","meaning_en":"O wise one, recognise in your mind all these as names of the revered noose. 354.","page":948,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸ ਦਾ ਹੈ। ਬੁੱਧੀਮਾਨੋ! ਵਿਚਾਰ ਕਰ ਲਵੋ ॥੩੫੪॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[355],"number_text":"੩੫੫।","page":948,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਚੰਚਲਾਨ ਕੇ ਨਾਮ ਲੈ ਜਾ ਕਹਿ ਨਿਧਹਿ ਬਖਾਨਿ।","roman":"Chanchlaan ke naam lai jaa kahi nidhhi bakhaani |","meaning_en":"Take the names of 'chanchala' (women), say 'ja', and speak 'nidhi';","page":948,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"Woman-born (milk), its store (the milk-ocean), its lord Varun; uncertain.","meaning_pa":"(ਪਹਿਲਾ) ਚੰਚਲਾਨ (ਇਸਤਰੀਆਂ) ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਲੈ ਕੇ, (ਫਿਰ) 'ਜਾ' ਅਤੇ 'ਨਿਧਿ' ਕਹਿ ਦਿਓ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਈਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ ਪੁਨਿ ਉਚਰੀਐ ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਪਹਿਚਾਨ। ੩੫੫।","roman":"Eesraasatr puni uchreeai naam paasi pahichaan | 355 |","meaning_en":"then utter 'isarastra', and recognise these as names of the noose. 355.","page":948,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਫਿਰ 'ਈਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ' ਸਬਦ ਦਾ ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ। (ਇਹ) ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਸਮਝ ਲਵੋ ॥੩੫੫॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[356],"number_text":"੩੫੬।","page":948,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਆਦਿ ਨਾਮ ਨਾਰੀਨ ਕੇ ਲੈ ਜਾ ਅੰਤਿ ਬਖਾਨ।","roman":"Aadi naam naareen ke lai jaa anti bakhaan |","meaning_en":"Take the names of women first, and speak 'ja' at the end;","page":948,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ ਨਾਰੀਨ (ਇਸਤਰੀਆਂ) ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਲੈ ਕੇ ਅੰਤ ਉਤੇ 'ਜਾ'","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਿਧਿ ਕਹਿ ਈਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ ਕਹਿ ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਪਹਿਚਾਨ। ੩੫੬।","roman":"Nidhi kahi eesraasatr kahi naam paasi pahichaan | 356 |","meaning_en":"saying 'nidhi' and 'isarastra', recognise these as names of the noose. 356.","page":948,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਅਤੇ 'ਨਿਧਿ' ਕਹਿ ਕੇ 'ਈਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ' ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ। (ਇਹ) ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਸਮਝ ਲਵੋ ॥੩੫੬॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[357],"number_text":"੩੫੭।","page":948,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਬਨਿਤਾ ਆਦਿ ਬਖਾਨਿ ਕੈ ਜਾ ਕਹਿ ਨਿਧਹਿ ਬਖਾਨਿ।","roman":"Banitaa aadi bakhaani kai jaa kahi nidhhi bakhaani |","meaning_en":"Speak 'banita' (woman) first, say 'ja', and speak 'nidhi';","page":948,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਬਨਿਤਾ' ਪਦ ਕਹਿ ਕੇ (ਫਿਰ) 'ਜਾ' ਅਤੇ 'ਨਿਧਿ'","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਈਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ ਪੁਨਿ ਭਾਖੀਐ ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਪਹਿਚਾਨ। ੩੫੭।","roman":"Eesraasatr puni bhaakheeai naam paasi pahichaan | 357 |","meaning_en":"then speak 'isarastra', and recognise these as names of the noose. 357.","page":948,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਅਤੇ ਫਿਰ 'ਈਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ' ਪਦ ਜੋੜੋ। (ਇਨ੍ਰਹਾ ਨੂੰ) ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਪਛਾਣ ਲਵੋ ॥੩੫੭॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[358],"number_text":"੩੫੮।","page":948,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਇਸਤ੍ਰਿਜ ਆਦਿ ਉਚਾਰਿ ਕੈ ਨਿਧਿ ਕਹਿ ਈਸ ਬਖਾਨਿ।","roman":"Istrij aadi uchaari kai nidhi kahi ees bakhaani |","meaning_en":"Uttering 'istrij' (woman-born) first, say 'nidhi' and speak 'is';","page":948,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਇਸਤ੍ਰਿਜ' (ਇਸਤਰੀਰਜ) ਸ਼ਬਦ ਉਚਾਰ ਕੇ, (ਫਿਰ) 'ਨਿਧਿ' ਤੇ 'ਈਸ' ਪਦ ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਈਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ ਕਹਿ ਫਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਜਾਨੀਅਹੁ ਨਾਮ ਸੁਜਾਨ। ੩੫੮।","roman":"Eesraasatr kahi phaasi ke jaaneeahu naam sujaan | 358 |","meaning_en":"saying 'isarastra', O knowing ones, know these as names of the phasi (noose). 358.","page":948,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਮਗਰੋਂ) 'ਈਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ' ਕਹਿ ਦਿਓ। (ਇਨ੍ਰਹਾ ਨੂੰ) ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਸਮਝ ਲਵੋ ॥੩੫੮॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[359],"number_text":"੩੫੯।","page":948,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਬਨਿਤਾ ਆਦਿ ਬਖਾਨਿ ਕੈ ਨਿਧਿ ਕਹਿ ਈਸ ਬਖਾਨਿ।","roman":"Banitaa aadi bakhaani kai nidhi kahi ees bakhaani |","meaning_en":"Speak 'banita' first, say 'nidhi', and speak 'is';","page":948,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਬਨਿਤਾ' ਕਹੋ, ਫਿਰ 'ਨਿਧਿ' ਅਤੇ 'ਈਸ' ਦਾ ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਆਯੁਧ ਬਹੁਰਿ ਬਖਾਨੀਐ ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਪਹਿਚਾਨ। ੩੫੯।","roman":"Aayudh bahuri bakhaaneeai naam paasi pahichaan | 359 |","meaning_en":"then speak 'ayudh', and recognise these as names of the noose. 359.","page":948,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਮਗਰੋਂ 'ਆਯੁਧ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਜੋੜੋ। (ਇਸ ਨੂੰ) ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਸਮਝ ਲਵੋ ॥੩੫੯॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[360],"number_text":"੩੬੦।","page":948,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਅੰਜਨਾਨ ਕੇ ਨਾਮ ਲੈ ਜਾ ਕਹਿ ਨਿਧਹਿ ਉਚਾਰਿ।","roman":"Anjnaan ke naam lai jaa kahi nidhhi uchaari |","meaning_en":"Take the names of 'anjana' (women), say 'ja', and utter 'nidhi';","page":948,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਅੰਜਨਾ: 'women (who wear collyrium)'; uncertain.","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਅੰਜਨਾਨ' (ਅੰਜਨ ਨਾਲ ਸ਼ਿੰਗਾਰ ਕਰਨ ਵਾਲੀਆਂ, ਇਸਤਰੀਆਂ) ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਲੈ ਕੇ, ਫਿਰ 'ਜਾ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਹਿ ਕੇ 'ਨਿਧ' ਪਦ ਜੋੜ ਦਿਓ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਈਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ ਕਹਿ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਲੀਜਹੁ ਨਾਮ ਸੁ ਧਾਰ। ੩੬੦।","roman":"Eesraasatr kahi paasi ke leejhu naam su dhaar | 360 |","meaning_en":"saying 'isarastra', take these, set right, as names of the noose. 360.","page":948,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਫਿਰ 'ਈਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ' ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ। (ਇਹ) ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਸਮਝ ਲਵੋ ॥੩੬੦॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[361],"number_text":"੩੬੧।","page":949,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਬਾਲਾ ਆਦਿ ਬਖਾਨਿ ਕੈ ਨਿਧਿ ਕਹਿ ਈਸ ਬਖਾਨ।","roman":"Baalaa aadi bakhaani kai nidhi kahi ees bakhaan |","meaning_en":"Speak 'bala' (young woman) first, say 'nidhi', and speak 'is';","page":949,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਬਾਲਾ' ਪਦ ਕਹਿ ਕੇ ਫਿਰ 'ਨਿਧਿ' ਅਤੇ 'ਈਸ' ਦਾ ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਹੋਤ ਹੈ ਚਤੁਰ ਲੀਜੀਅਹੁ ਜਾਨ। ੩੬੧।","roman":"Naam paasi ke hot hai chatur leejeeahu jaan | 361 |","meaning_en":"these become names of the noose; O wise one, know them. 361.","page":949,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਪਾਸ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਬਣਦਾ ਹੈ। ਬੁੱਧੀਮਾਨੋ! ਚੰਗੀ ਤਰ੍ਰਹਾ ਸਮਝ ਲਵੋ ॥੩੬੧॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[362],"number_text":"੩੬੨।","page":949,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਅੰਜਨੀਨ ਕੇ ਨਾਮ ਲੈ ਜਾ ਕਹਿ ਨਿਧਹਿ ਬਖਾਨਿ।","roman":"Anjneen ke naam lai jaa kahi nidhhi bakhaani |","meaning_en":"Take the names of 'anjani' (women), say 'ja', and speak 'nidhi';","page":949,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਪਹਿਲਾ) 'ਅੰਜਨੀਨ' (ਇਸਤਰੀਆਂ) ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਲੈ ਕੇ (ਫਿਰ) 'ਜਾ' ਅਤੇ 'ਨਿਧ' ਪਦ ਜੋੜੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਈਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ ਪੁਨਿ ਉਚਰੀਐ ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਪਹਿਚਾਨ। ੩੬੨।","roman":"Eesraasatr puni uchreeai naam paasi pahichaan | 362 |","meaning_en":"then utter 'isarastra', and recognise these as names of the noose. 362.","page":949,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਮਗਰੋਂ 'ਈਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ' ਪਦ ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ। (ਇਸ ਤਰ੍ਰਹਾ) ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਜਾਣ ਲਵੋ ॥੩੬੨॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[363],"number_text":"੩੬੩।","page":949,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਅਬਲਾ ਆਦਿ ਉਚਾਰਿ ਕੈ ਨਿਧਿ ਕਹਿ ਈਸ ਬਖਾਨਿ।","roman":"Ablaa aadi uchaari kai nidhi kahi ees bakhaani |","meaning_en":"Uttering 'abla' (woman) first, say 'nidhi', and speak 'is';","page":949,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਅਬਲਾ' ਕਹਿ ਕੇ, ਫਿਰ 'ਨਿਧ' ਅਤੇ 'ਈਸ' ਪਦ ਜੋੜੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਆਯੁਧ ਬਹੁਰਿ ਬਖਾਨੀਐ ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਪਹਿਚਾਨ। ੩੬੩।","roman":"Aayudh bahuri bakhaaneeai naam paasi pahichaan | 363 |","meaning_en":"then speak 'ayudh', and recognise these as names of the noose. 363.","page":949,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਮਗਰੋਂ 'ਆਯੁਧ' ਦਾ ਬਖਾਨ ਕਰੋ। (ਇਨ੍ਰਹਾ ਨੂੰ) ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਸਮਝ ਲਵੋ ॥੩੬੩॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[364],"number_text":"੩੬੪।","page":949,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਨਰਜਾ ਆਦਿ ਉਚਾਰਿ ਕੈ ਜਾ ਨਿਧਿ ਈਸ ਬਖਾਨ।","roman":"Narjaa aadi uchaari kai jaa nidhi ees bakhaan |","meaning_en":"Uttering 'narja' (woman) first, speak 'ja', 'nidhi', 'is';","page":949,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਨਰਜਾ' ਕਹਿ ਕੇ, (ਫਿਰ) 'ਜਾ ਨਿਧਿ' ਅਤੇ 'ਈਸ' ਪਦ ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਆਯੁਧ ਬਹੁਰਿ ਬਖਾਨੀਐ ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਪਹਿਚਾਨ। ੩੬੪।","roman":"Aayudh bahuri bakhaaneeai naam paasi pahichaan | 364 |","meaning_en":"then speak 'ayudh', and recognise these as names of the noose. 364.","page":949,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਮਗਰੋਂ 'ਆਯੁਧ' ਦਾ ਬਖਾਨ ਕਰੋ। (ਇਨ੍ਰਹਾ ਨੂੰ) ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਸਮਝ ਲਵੋ ॥੩੬੩॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[365],"number_text":"੩੬੫।","page":949,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਨਰੀ ਆਸੁਰੀ ਕਿੰਨ੍ਰਨੀ ਸੁਰੀ ਭਾਖਿ ਜਾ ਭਾਖਿ।","roman":"Naree aasuree kinnranee suree bhaakhi jaa bhaakhi |","meaning_en":"Speak 'nari', 'asuri', 'kinnarni', 'suri' (women human, demon, kinnar, divine), and speak 'ja';","page":949,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਪਹਿਲਾ) 'ਨਰੀ', 'ਆਸੁਰੀ', 'ਕਿੰਨ੍ਰਨੀ', 'ਸੁਰੀ' ਕਹਿ ਕੇ, ਫਿਰ 'ਜਾ' ਕਹੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਿਧਿਪਤਿ ਅਸਤ੍ਰ ਕਹਿ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਨਾਮ ਚੀਨਿ ਚਿਤਿ ਰਾਖਿ। ੩੬੫।","roman":"Nidhipti asatr kahi paasi ke naam cheeni chiti raakhi | 365 |","meaning_en":"saying 'nidhi-pati' and 'astra', keep these in mind as names of the noose. 365.","page":949,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਮਗਰੋਂ) 'ਨਿਧ ਪਤਿ ਅਸਤ੍ਰ' ਕਹਿ ਦਿਓ। (ਇਹ) ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਮਨ ਵਿਚ ਰਖ ਲਵੋ ॥੩੬੫॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[366],"number_text":"੩੬੬।","page":949,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਫਨਿਜਾ ਆਦਿ ਉਚਾਰਿ ਕੈ ਜਾ ਕਹਿ ਨਿਧਹਿ ਬਖਾਨ।","roman":"Phanijaa aadi uchaari kai jaa kahi nidhhi bakhaan |","meaning_en":"Uttering 'phanija' (serpent-woman) first, say 'ja' and speak 'nidhi';","page":949,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਫਨਿਜਾ' ਪਦ ਕਹਿ ਕੇ, (ਫਿਰ) 'ਜਾ' ਅਤੇ 'ਨਿਧ' ਦਾ ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਈਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ ਕਹਿ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਚੀਨੀਅਹੁ ਨਾਮ ਸੁਜਾਨ। ੩੬੬।","roman":"Eesraasatr kahi paasi ke cheeneeahu naam sujaan | 366 |","meaning_en":"saying 'isarastra', O knowing ones, recognise these as names of the noose. 366.","page":949,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਸ ਪਿਛੋਂ) 'ਈਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ' (ਪਦ) ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ। (ਇਨ੍ਰਹਾ ਨੂੰ) ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ, ਸੁਜਾਨ ਪੁਰਸ਼ੋ! ਮੰਨ ਲਵੋ ॥੩੬੬॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[367],"number_text":"੩੬੭।","page":949,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਅਬਲਾ ਬਾਲਾ ਮਾਨਜਾ ਤ੍ਰਿਯ ਜਾ ਨਿਧਹਿ ਬਖਾਨ।","roman":"Ablaa baalaa maanjaa triy jaa nidhhi bakhaan |","meaning_en":"Speak 'abla', 'bala', 'manja', 'triya' (women), with 'ja' and 'nidhi';","page":949,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਅਬਲਾ', 'ਬਾਲਾ', 'ਮਾਨਜਾ', 'ਤ੍ਰਿਯ' (ਇਸਤਰੀਆਂ ਦੇ ਨਾਵਾ ਅਗੇ) 'ਜਾ' ਅਤੇ 'ਨਿਧ' ਪਦ ਦਾ ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਈਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ ਕਹਿ ਪਾਸ ਕੇ ਚੀਨੀਅਹੁ ਨਾਮ ਸੁਜਾਨ। ੩੬੭।","roman":"Eesraasatr kahi paas ke cheeneeahu naam sujaan | 367 |","meaning_en":"saying 'isarastra', O knowing ones, recognise these as names of the noose. 367.","page":949,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਫਿਰ ਅੰਤ ਵਿਚ) 'ਈਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਜੋੜੋ। ਹੇ ਸੁਜਾਨੋ! ਇਨ੍ਰਹਾ ਨੂੰ ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਸਮਝ ਲਵੋ ॥੩੬੭॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[368],"number_text":"੩੬੮।","page":949,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਸਮੁਦ ਗਾਮਨੀ ਜੇ ਨਦੀ ਤਿਨ ਕੇ ਨਾਮ ਬਖਾਨ।","roman":"Samud gaamnee je nadee tin ke naam bakhaan |","meaning_en":"Speak the names of the rivers that flow to the ocean;","page":949,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਸਮੁੰਦਰ ਵਲ ਜਾਣ ਵਾਲੀਆਂ ਜੋ ਨਦੀਆਂ ਹਨ, ਉਨ੍ਰਹਾ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਈਸ ਏਸ ਕਹਿ ਅਸਤ੍ਰ ਕਹਿ ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਪਹਿਚਾਨ। ੩੬੮।","roman":"Ees es kahi asatr kahi naam paasi pahichaan | 368 |","meaning_en":"saying 'is', 'es', and 'astra', recognise these as names of the noose. 368.","page":949,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਮਗਰੋਂ) 'ਈਸ ਏਸ' ਕਹਿ ਕੇ 'ਅਸਤ੍ਰ' ਕਹਿ ਦਿਓ। (ਇਹ) ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਸਮਝੇ ਜਾਣ ॥੩੬੮॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[369],"number_text":"੩੬੯।","page":949,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਪੈ ਪਦ ਪ੍ਰਿਥਮ ਬਖਾਨਿ ਕੈ ਈਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ ਕਹਿ ਅੰਤਿ।","roman":"Pai pad pritham bakhaani kai eesraasatr kahi anti |","meaning_en":"Speak the word 'pai' (milk/water) first, and say 'isarastra' at the end;","page":949,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਪੈ' ਪਦ ਕਹਿ ਕੇ, (ਫਿਰ) ਅੰਤ ਉਤੇ 'ਈਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਹਿ ਦਿਓ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਸਕਲ ਨਾਮ ਸ੍ਰੀ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਨਿਕਸਤ ਚਲੈ ਬਿਅੰਤ। ੩੬੯।","roman":"Sakal naam sree paasi ke niksat chalai biant | 369 |","meaning_en":"endless names of the revered noose come forth. 369.","page":949,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਸ ਤੋਂ) ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਬੇਅੰਤ ਨਾਮ ਬਣਦੇ ਜਾਣਗੇ ॥੩੬੯॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[370],"number_text":"੩੭੦।","page":949,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਪ੍ਰਿਥਮੈ ਭਾਖਿ ਤੜਾਗ ਪਦ ਈਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ ਪੁਨਿ ਭਾਖੁ।","roman":"Prithmai bhaakhi taraag pad eesraasatr puni bhaakhu |","meaning_en":"First speak the word 'tadag' (pond), then speak 'isarastra';","page":949,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਤੜਾਗ' ਪਦ ਕਹਿ ਕੇ, ਮਗਰੋਂ 'ਈਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ' ਪਦ ਜੋੜ ਦਿਓ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਹੋਤ ਹੈ ਚੀਨਿ ਚਤੁਰ ਚਿਤਿ ਰਾਖੁ। ੩੭੦।","roman":"Naam paasi ke hot hai cheeni chatur chiti raakhu | 370 |","meaning_en":"these become names of the noose; O wise one, keep them in mind. 370.","page":949,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਪਾਸ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਬਣ ਜਾਦਾ ਹੈ। ਸੂਝਵਾਨ ਇਹ ਮਨ ਵਿਚ ਧਾਰਨ ਕਰ ਲੈਣ ॥੩੭੦॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[371],"number_text":"੩੭੧।","page":949,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਪ੍ਰਿਥਮ ਸਰੋਵਰ ਸਬਦ ਕਹਿ ਈਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ ਕਹਿ ਅੰਤਿ।","roman":"Pritham sarovar sabad kahi eesraasatr kahi anti |","meaning_en":"First say the word 'sarovar' (lake), and say 'isarastra' at the end;","page":949,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਸਰੋਵਰ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਹਿ ਕੇ, ਫਿਰ ਅੰਤ ਉਤੇ 'ਈਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ' ਕਹਿ ਦਿਓ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਸਕਲ ਨਾਮ ਸ੍ਰੀ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਚੀਨ ਲੇਹੁ ਮਤਿਵੰਤ। ੩੭੧।","roman":"Sakal naam sree paasi ke cheen lehu mativant | 371 |","meaning_en":"O wise ones, recognise all these as names of the revered noose. 371.","page":949,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਸਾਰੇ ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਹਨ। ਸੂਝਵਾਨੋ! ਸਮਝ ਲਵੋ ॥੩੭੧॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[372],"number_text":"੩੭੨।","page":949,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਜਲਧਰ ਆਦਿ ਬਖਾਨਿ ਕੈ ਈਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ ਪਦ ਭਾਖੁ।","roman":"Jaldhar aadi bakhaani kai eesraasatr pad bhaakhu |","meaning_en":"Speak 'jaldhar' (holder of water) first, then speak the word 'isarastra';","page":949,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਜਲਧਰ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਹਿ ਕੇ, ਫਿਰ 'ਈਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ' ਪਦ ਜੋੜੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਹੋਤ ਹੈ ਚੀਨਿ ਚਤੁਰ ਚਿਤਿ ਰਾਖੁ। ੩੭੨।","roman":"Naam paasi ke hot hai cheeni chatur chiti raakhu | 372 |","meaning_en":"these become names of the noose; O wise one, keep them in mind. 372.","page":949,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਬਣਦੇ ਹਨ। ਬੁੱਧੀਮਾਨੋ! ਸਮਝ ਲਵੋ ॥੩੭੨॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[373],"number_text":"੩੭੩।","page":949,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਮਘਜਾ ਆਦਿ ਉਚਾਰਿ ਕੈ ਧਰ ਪਦ ਬਹੁਰਿ ਬਖਾਨਿ।","roman":"Maghjaa aadi uchaari kai dhar pad bahuri bakhaani |","meaning_en":"Uttering 'maghja' (cloud-born, water) first, then speak the word 'dhar';","page":949,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਮਘਜਾ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਹਿ ਕੇ, ਫਿਰ 'ਧਰ' ਪਦ ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਈਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ ਕਹਿ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਲੀਜਹੁ ਨਾਮ ਪਛਾਨ। ੩੭੩।","roman":"Eesraasatr kahi paasi ke leejhu naam pachhaan | 373 |","meaning_en":"saying 'isarastra', recognise these as names of the noose. 373.","page":949,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਫਿਰ) 'ਈਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ' ਪਦ ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ। (ਇਹ) ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਹਨ, ਪਛਾਣ ਲਵੋ ॥੩੭੩॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[374],"number_text":"੩੭੪।","page":949,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਆਦਿ ਬਾਰਿ ਧਰ ਉਚਰਿ ਕੈ ਈਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ ਕਹਿ ਅੰਤਿ।","roman":"Aadi baari dhar uchri kai eesraasatr kahi anti |","meaning_en":"Uttering 'bari-dhar' (holder of water) first, say 'isarastra' at the end;","page":949,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਬਾਰਿ ਧਰ' ਉਚਾਰ ਕੇ, ਫਿਰ 'ਈਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ' ਅੰਤ ਉਤੇ ਕਹੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਹੋਤ ਹੈ ਚੀਨ ਲੇਹੁ ਮਤਿਵੰਤ। ੩੭੪।","roman":"Naam paasi ke hot hai cheen lehu mativant | 374 |","meaning_en":"these become names of the noose; O wise ones, recognise them. 374.","page":949,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਸ ਤਰ੍ਰਹਾ) ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਬਣਦੇ ਹਨ। ਬੁੱਧੀਮਾਨ ਸਮਝ ਲੈਣ ॥੩੭੪॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[375],"number_text":"੩੭੫।","page":949,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਘਨਜ ਧਰਨ ਪਦ ਪ੍ਰਿਥਮ ਕਹਿ ਈਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ ਕਹਿ ਅੰਤਿ।","roman":"Ghanaj dharan pad pritham kahi eesraasatr kahi anti |","meaning_en":"Say the words 'ghanaj dharan' (holder of cloud-born water) first, and 'isarastra' at the end;","page":949,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਘਨਜ' ਪਦ ਕਹਿ ਕੇ, ਫਿਰ 'ਧਰਨ' ਅਤੇ 'ਈਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ' ਕਹੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਸਕਲ ਨਾਮ ਸ੍ਰੀ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਚੀਨ ਲੇਹੁ ਮਤਿਵੰਤ। ੩੭੫।","roman":"Sakal naam sree paasi ke cheen lehu mativant | 375 |","meaning_en":"O wise ones, recognise all these as names of the revered noose. 375.","page":949,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਸਾਰੇ ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਬਣ ਜਾਣਗੇ। ਬੁੱਧੀਮਾਨ ਬੁਝ ਲੈਣ ॥੩੭੫॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[376],"number_text":"੩੭੬।","page":949,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਮਘਜਾ ਧਰ ਪਦ ਪ੍ਰਿਥਮ ਕਹਿ ਈਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ ਕਹਿ ਅੰਤਿ।","roman":"Maghjaa dhar pad pritham kahi eesraasatr kahi anti |","meaning_en":"Say the words 'maghja dhar' first, and 'isarastra' at the end;","page":949,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਮਘਜਾ ਧਰ' ਪਦ ਕਹਿ ਕੇ (ਫਿਰ) 'ਈਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਅੰਤ ਉਤੇ ਕਹੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸ ਕੇ ਹੋਤ ਹੈ ਚੀਨ ਲੇਹੁ ਮਤਿਵੰਤ। ੩੭੬।","roman":"Naam paas ke hot hai cheen lehu mativant | 376 |","meaning_en":"these become names of the noose; O wise ones, recognise them. 376.","page":949,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਬਣਦੇ ਹਨ। ਸੂਝਵਾਨ ਜਾਣ ਲੈਣ ॥੩੭੬॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[377],"number_text":"੩੭੭।","page":950,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਅੰਬੁਦਜਾ ਧਰ ਆਦਿ ਕਹਿ ਈਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ ਕਹਿ ਅੰਤਿ।","roman":"Anbudjaa dhar aadi kahi eesraasatr kahi anti |","meaning_en":"Say 'ambudja dhar' (holder of cloud-born water) first, and 'isarastra' at the end;","page":950,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਅੰਬੁਦਜਾ ਧਰ' ਪਹਿਲਾ ਕਹਿ ਕੇ, ਮਗਰੋਂ 'ਈਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ' ਪਦ ਕਹੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਹੋਤ ਹੈ ਚੀਨ ਲੇਹੁ ਮਤਵੰਤ। ੩੭੭।","roman":"Naam paasi ke hot hai cheen lehu matvant | 377 |","meaning_en":"these become names of the noose; O wise ones, recognise them. 377.","page":950,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਪਾਸ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਬਣਦਾ ਹੈ। ਬੁੱਧੀਮਾਨ ਸਮਝ ਲੈਣ ॥੩੭੭॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[378],"number_text":"੩੭੮।","page":950,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਅੰਬੁਦਜਾ ਧਰ ਪ੍ਰਿਥਮ ਕਹਿ ਈਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ ਪਦ ਦੀਨ।","roman":"Anbudjaa dhar pritham kahi eesraasatr pad deen |","meaning_en":"Say 'ambudja dhar' first, and give the word 'isarastra';","page":950,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਅੰਬੁਦਜਾ ਧਰ' ਪਦ ਪਹਿਲਾ ਕਹੋ, ਫਿਰ 'ਈਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਜੋੜੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸ ਕੇ ਹੋਤ ਹੈ ਲੀਜੀਅਹੁ ਜਾਨ ਪ੍ਰਬੀਨ। ੩੭੮।","roman":"Naam paas ke hot hai leejeeahu jaan prabeen | 378 |","meaning_en":"these become names of the noose; O skilled one, know them. 378.","page":950,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਪਾਸ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਹੈ। ਸੂਝਵਾਨ ਸਮਝ ਲੈਣ ॥੩੭੮॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[379],"number_text":"੩੭੯।","page":950,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਬਾਰਿਦ ਆਦਿ ਉਚਾਰਿ ਕੈ ਜਾ ਨਿਧਿ ਈਸ ਬਖਾਨ।","roman":"Baarid aadi uchaari kai jaa nidhi ees bakhaan |","meaning_en":"Uttering 'barid' (cloud) first, speak 'ja', 'nidhi', 'is';","page":950,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਬਾਰਿਦ' ਪਦ ਕਹਿ ਕੇ, ਫਿਰ 'ਜਾ ਨਿਧਿ ਈਸ' ਪਦ ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਅਸਤ੍ਰ ਉਚਰਿ ਸਭ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਲੀਜੀਅਹੁ ਨਾਮ ਪਛਾਨ। ੩੭੯।","roman":"Asatr uchri sabh paasi ke leejeeahu naam pachhaan | 379 |","meaning_en":"uttering 'astra', recognise all these as names of the noose. 379.","page":950,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਫਿਰ 'ਅਸਤ੍ਰ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਦਾ ਉਚਾਰਨ ਕਰੋ। (ਇਹ) ਸਾਰੇ ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਸਮਝ ਲਵੋ ॥੩੭੯॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[380],"number_text":"੩੮੦।","page":950,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਪ੍ਰਿਥਮ ਉਚਰਿ ਪਦ ਨੀਰ ਧਰ ਈਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ ਕਹਿ ਅੰਤ।","roman":"Pritham uchri pad neer dhar eesraasatr kahi ant |","meaning_en":"First utter the words 'nir dhar' (water-holder), and say 'isarastra' at the end;","page":950,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਨੀਰ ਧਰ' ਪਦ ਕਹਿ ਕੇ, (ਫਿਰ) ਅੰਤ ਉਤੇ 'ਈਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਹੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਸਕਲ ਨਾਮ ਸ੍ਰੀ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਨਿਕਸਤ ਚਲੈ ਬਿਅੰਤ। ੩੮੦।","roman":"Sakal naam sree paasi ke niksat chalai biant | 380 |","meaning_en":"endless names of the revered noose come forth. 380.","page":950,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਸ ਤਰ੍ਰਹਾ) ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਅਨੰਤ ਨਾਮ ਬਣ ਸਕਦੇ ਹਨ ॥੩੮੦॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[381],"number_text":"੩੮੧।","page":950,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਰਿਦ ਪਦ ਆਦਿ ਬਖਾਨਿ ਕੈ ਈਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ ਕਹਿ ਦੀਨ।","roman":"Rid pad aadi bakhaani kai eesraasatr kahi deen |","meaning_en":"Speak the word 'rid' first, and give 'isarastra';","page":950,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਰਿਦ: printed so; perhaps a shortened form of 'barid' (cloud) or 'hrid' (lake); uncertain.","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਰਿਦ' ਫਿਰ 'ਈਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ' ਪਦ ਦਾ ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਹੋਤ ਹੈ ਚਤੁਰ ਲੀਜੀਅਹੁ ਚੀਨ। ੩੮੧।","roman":"Naam paasi ke hot hai chatur leejeeahu cheen | 381 |","meaning_en":"these become names of the noose; O wise one, recognise them. 381.","page":950,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਪਾਸ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਹੁੰਦਾ ਹੈ। ਚਤੁਰ ਪੁਰਸ਼ੋ! ਸਮਝ ਲਵੋ ॥੩੮੧॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[382],"number_text":"੩੮੨।","page":950,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਹਰ ਧਰ ਆਦਿ ਬਖਾਨਿ ਕੈ ਈਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ ਕਹਿ ਅੰਤਿ।","roman":"Har dhar aadi bakhaani kai eesraasatr kahi anti |","meaning_en":"Speak 'har dhar' (water-holder?) first, and say 'isarastra' at the end;","page":950,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਹਰ: read as 'water' (har); uncertain.","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਹਰ ਧਰ' ਕਹਿ ਕੇ ਫਿਰ 'ਈਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਸਕਲ ਨਾਮ ਸ੍ਰੀ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਨਿਕਸਤ ਚਲਤ ਬਿਅੰਤ। ੩੮੨।","roman":"Sakal naam sree paasi ke niksat chalat biant | 382 |","meaning_en":"endless names of the revered noose come forth. 382.","page":950,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਸ ਤਰ੍ਰਹਾ) ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਬੇਅੰਤ ਨਾਮ ਬਣਦੇ ਜਾਦੇ ਹਨ ॥੩੮੨॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[383],"number_text":"੩੮੩।","page":950,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਜਲਜ ਤ੍ਰਾਣਿ ਸਬਦੋਚਰਿ ਕੈ ਈਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ ਕਹਿ ਦੀਨ।","roman":"Jalaj traani sabdochri kai eesraasatr kahi deen |","meaning_en":"Uttering the words 'jalaj tran' (?), give 'isarastra';","page":950,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਜਲਜ ਤ੍ਰਾਣਿ: obscure; uncertain.","meaning_pa":"ਜਲਜ ਤ੍ਰਾਣਿ' ਪਦ (ਪਹਿਲਾ) ਕਹਿ ਕੇ (ਫਿਰ) 'ਈਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ' (ਸਬਦ ਦਾ) ਉਚਾਰਨ ਕਰੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਹੋਤ ਹੈ ਲੀਜਹੁ ਚੀਨ ਪ੍ਰਬੀਨ। ੩੮੩।","roman":"Naam paasi ke hot hai leejhu cheen prabeen | 383 |","meaning_en":"these become names of the noose; O skilled one, recognise them. 383.","page":950,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਪਾਸ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਬਣਦਾ ਹੈ। ਪ੍ਰਬੀਨੋ! ਵਿਚਾਰ ਲਵੋ ॥੩੮੩॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[384],"number_text":"੩੮੪।","page":950,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਹਰਧ੍ਰਦ ਜਲਧ੍ਰਦ ਬਾਰਿਧ੍ਰਦ ਨਿਧਿ ਪਤਿ ਅਸਤ੍ਰ ਬਖਾਨ।","roman":"Hardhrad jaldhrad baaridhrad nidhi pati asatr bakhaan |","meaning_en":"Speak 'hardhrad', 'jaldhrad', 'baridhrad' (lake/store of water), 'nidhi', 'pati', 'astra';","page":950,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਧ੍ਰਦ: read as 'hrad' (deep pool); uncertain.","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਹਰਧ੍ਰਦ', 'ਜਲਧ੍ਰਦ', 'ਬਾਰਿਧ੍ਰਦ' ਕਹਿ ਕੇ (ਫਿਰ) 'ਨਿਧਿ ਪਤਿ' ਅਤੇ 'ਅਸਤ੍ਰ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਜੋੜੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਹੋਤ ਹੈ ਲੀਜਹੁ ਚਤੁਰ ਪਛਾਨ। ੩੮੪।","roman":"Naam paasi ke hot hai leejhu chatur pachhaan | 384 |","meaning_en":"these become names of the noose; O wise one, recognise them. 384.","page":950,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ ਸਾਰੇ) ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਬਣ ਜਾਦੇ ਹਨ। ਸੂਝਵਾਨੋ! ਸਮਝ ਲਵੋ ॥੩੮੪॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[385],"number_text":"੩੮੫।","page":950,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਨੀਰਧਿ ਆਦਿ ੳਚਾਰਿ ਕੈ ਈਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ ਕਹਿ ਅੰਤਿ।","roman":"Neerdhi aadi uchaari kai eesraasatr kahi anti |","meaning_en":"Uttering 'nirdhi' (ocean) first, say 'isarastra' at the end;","page":950,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ੳਚਾਰਿ: printed so; read as ਉਚਾਰਿ."},{"gurmukhi":"ਸਕਲ ਨਾਮ ਸ੍ਰੀ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਨਿਕਸਤ ਚਲੈ ਬਿਅੰਤ।੩੮੫।","roman":"Sakal naam sree paasi ke niksat chalai biant | 385 |","meaning_en":"endless names of the revered noose come forth. 385.","page":950,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਨੀਰਧਿ' ਪਦ ਉਚਾਰ ਕੇ, (ਪਿਛੋਂ) 'ਈਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ' ਅੰਤ ਉਤੇ ਕਹੋ। (ਇਸ ਤੋਂ) ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਬੇਅੰਤ ਨਾਮ ਬਣਦੇ ਜਾਣਗੇ ॥੩੮੫॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB","note_pa":"ਇਹ ਅਰਥ ਇਸ ਪੰਕਤੀ ਸਮੇਤ ਉੱਪਰਲੀਆਂ 2 ਪੰਕਤੀਆਂ ਦਾ ਇਕੱਠਾ ਹੈ।"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[386],"number_text":"੩੮੬।","page":950,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਅੰਬੁਦਜਾ ਧਰ ਨਿਧਿ ਉਚਰਿ ਈਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ ਕਹਿ ਅੰਤਿ।","roman":"Anbudjaa dhar nidhi uchri eesraasatr kahi anti |","meaning_en":"Utter 'ambudja dhar nidhi', and say 'isarastra' at the end;","page":950,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਅੰਬੁਦਜਾ ਧਰ ਨਿਧਿ' ਕਹਿ ਕੇ, (ਫਿਰ) ਅੰਤ ਉਤੇ 'ਈਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ' ਕਹਿ ਦਿਓ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਸਕਲ ਹੀ ਚੀਨਹੁ ਚਤੁਰ ਬਿਅੰਤ। ੩੮੬।","roman":"Naam paasi ke sakal hee cheenhu chatur biant | 386 |","meaning_en":"O wise ones, recognise all these countless names of the noose. 386.","page":950,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਬਣ ਜਾਣਗੇ। ਵਿਦਵਾਨੋ! ਸਮਝ ਲਵੋ ॥੩੮੬॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[387],"number_text":"੩੮੭।","page":950,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਧਾਰਾਧਰਜ ਉਚਾਰਿ ਕੈ ਨਿਧਿ ਪਤਿ ਏਸ ਬਖਾਨਿ।","roman":"Dhaaraadhraj uchaari kai nidhi pati es bakhaani |","meaning_en":"Uttering 'dharadharaj' (cloud-born), speak 'nidhi', 'pati', 'es';","page":950,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਪਹਿਲਾ) 'ਧਾਰਾਧਰਜ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਉਚਾਰ ਕੇ ਫਿਰ 'ਨਿਧਿ ਪਤਿ' ਅਤੇ 'ਏਸ' ਦਾ ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਸਸਤ੍ਰ ਉਚਰਿ ਸਭ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਲੀਜਹੁ ਨਾਮ ਪਛਾਨ। ੩੮੭।","roman":"Sasatr uchri sabh paasi ke leejhu naam pachhaan | 387 |","meaning_en":"uttering 'sastra', recognise all these as names of the noose. 387.","page":950,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਅਤੇ ਅੰਤ ਉਤੇ 'ਸਸਤ੍ਰ' ਜੋੜੋ। (ਇਨ੍ਰਹਾ ਨੂੰ) ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਪਛਾਣ ਲਵੋ ॥੩੮੭॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[388],"number_text":"੩੮੮।","page":950,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਧਾਰਾਧਰ ਧ੍ਰਦ ਈਸ ਕਹਿ ਅਸਤ੍ਰ ਬਹੁਰਿ ਪਦ ਦੀਨ।","roman":"Dhaaraadhar dhrad ees kahi asatr bahuri pad deen |","meaning_en":"Say 'dharadhar dhrad is', then give the word 'astra';","page":950,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਪਹਿਲਾ) 'ਧਾਰਾਧਰ ਧ੍ਰਦ ਈਸ' ਕਹਿ ਕੇ, ਫਿਰ 'ਅਸਤ੍ਰ' ਪਦ ਕਹੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਹੋਤ ਹੈ ਚਤੁਰ ਲੀਜੀਅਹੁ ਚੀਨ। ੩੮੮।","roman":"Naam paasi ke hot hai chatur leejeeahu cheen | 388 |","meaning_en":"these become names of the noose; O wise one, recognise them. 388.","page":950,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਪਾਸ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਹੋ ਜਾਦਾ ਹੈ। ਬੁੱਧੀਮਾਨੋ! ਵਿਚਾਰ ਕਰ ਲਵੋ ॥੩੮੮॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[389],"number_text":"੩੮੯।","page":950,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਪੈ ਪਦ ਪ੍ਰਿਥਮ ਉਚਾਰਿ ਕੈ ਨਿਧਿ ਕਹਿ ਈਸ ਬਖਾਨਿ।","roman":"Pai pad pritham uchaari kai nidhi kahi ees bakhaani |","meaning_en":"Uttering the word 'pai' (milk/water) first, say 'nidhi' and speak 'is';","page":950,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪੈ' ਪਦ ਪਹਿਲਾ ਉਚਾਰ ਕੇ, (ਫਿਰ) 'ਨਿਧਿ ਅਤੇ 'ਈਸ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਜੋੜੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਅਸਤ੍ਰ ਉਚਰਿ ਕਰਿ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਲੀਜਹੁ ਨਾਮ ਪਛਾਨ। ੩੮੯।","roman":"Asatr uchri kari paasi ke leejhu naam pachhaan | 389 |","meaning_en":"uttering 'astra', recognise these as names of the noose. 389.","page":950,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਫਿਰ 'ਅਸਤ੍ਰ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਥਨ ਕਰ ਕੇ ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਪਛਾਣ ਲਵੋ ॥੩੮੯॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[390],"number_text":"੩੯੦।","page":950,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਸਕਲ ਦੁਘਦ ਕੇ ਨਾਮ ਲੈ ਨਿਧਿ ਕਹਿ ਈਸ ਬਖਾਨ।","roman":"Sakal dughad ke naam lai nidhi kahi ees bakhaan |","meaning_en":"Take all the names of milk, say 'nidhi', and speak 'is';","page":950,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਦੁੱਧ ਦੇ ਸਾਰੇ ਨਾਮ ਲੈ ਕੇ (ਫਿਰ) ਅੰਤ ਉਤੇ 'ਨਿਧ', 'ਈਸ'","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਅਸਤ੍ਰ ਉਚਰਿ ਕਰਿ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਚੀਨੀਅਹੁ ਨਾਮ ਸੁਜਾਨ। ੩੯੦।","roman":"Asatr uchri kari paasi ke cheeneeahu naam sujaan | 390 |","meaning_en":"uttering 'astra', O knowing ones, recognise these as names of the noose. 390.","page":950,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਅਤੇ 'ਅਸਤ੍ਰ' ਪਦਾ ਨੂੰ ਜੋੜੋ। (ਇਹ) ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਬਣਦੇ ਹਨ। ਸੁਜਾਨੋ! ਸਮਝ ਲਵੋ ॥੩੯੦॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[391],"number_text":"੩੯੧।","page":950,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਸੁ ਬੀਰਨ ਕੇ ਸਭੈ ਮੁਖ ਤੇ ਪ੍ਰਿਥਮ ਉਚਾਰਿ।","roman":"Naam su beeran ke sabhai mukh te pritham uchaari |","meaning_en":"First utter from the mouth all the names of heroes,","page":950,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ ਸਾਰਿਆਂ ਬੀਰਾ (ਸੂਰਮਿਆਂ) ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਗ੍ਰਸਿਤਨਿ ਕਹਿ ਸਭ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਲੀਜਹੁ ਨਾਮ ਸੁ ਧਾਰਿ। ੩੯੧।","roman":"Grasitni kahi sabh paasi ke leejhu naam su dhaari | 391 |","meaning_en":"saying 'grasitani' (seizer), take these, set right, as all names of the noose. 391.","page":950,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਫਿਰ) 'ਗ੍ਰਸਿਤਨਿ' ਕਹਿ ਦਿਓ। (ਇਹ) ਸਭ ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਸਮਝ ਲਵੋ ॥੩੯੧॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[392],"number_text":"੩੯੨।","page":950,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਸਕਲ ਬਾਰਿ ਕੇ ਨਾਮ ਲੈ ਨਿਧਿ ਪਤਿ ਈਸ ਬਖਾਨਿ।","roman":"Sakal baari ke naam lai nidhi pati ees bakhaani |","meaning_en":"Take all the names of water, then speak 'nidhi', 'pati', 'is';","page":950,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਪਹਿਲਾ) ਪਾਣੀ ਦੇ ਸਾਰੇ ਨਾਮ ਲੈ ਕੇ, (ਫਿਰ) ਅੰਤ ਉਤੇ 'ਨਿਧਿ ਪਤਿ ਈਸ","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਅਸਤ੍ਰ ਉਚਰਿ ਕਰਿ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਲੀਜਹੁ ਨਾਮ ਸੁਜਾਨ। ੩੯੨।","roman":"Asatr uchri kari paasi ke leejhu naam sujaan | 392 |","meaning_en":"uttering 'astra', O knowing ones, take these as names of the noose. 392.","page":950,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਅਸਤ੍ਰ' ਕਹੋ। (ਇਹ) ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਹੋ ਜਾਦੇ ਹਨ। ਸੁਜਾਨੋ! ਵਿਚਾਰ ਕਰ ਲਵੋ ॥੩੯੨॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[393],"number_text":"੩੯੩।","page":950,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਸਕਲ ਨਾਮ ਲੈ ਧੂਰਿ ਕੇ ਧਰ ਨਿਧਿ ਈਸ ਬਖਾਨਿ।","roman":"Sakal naam lai dhoori ke dhar nidhi ees bakhaani |","meaning_en":"Take all the names of dust, then speak 'dhar', 'nidhi', 'is';","page":950,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"Dust-holder = earth? chain to the ocean uncertain.","meaning_pa":"(ਪਹਿਲਾ) 'ਧੂਰਿ' ਦੇ ਸਾਰੇ ਨਾਮ ਲੈ ਕੇ, (ਫਿਰ) 'ਧਰ ਨਿਧਿ' ਅਤੇ 'ਈਸ' ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਅਸਤ੍ਰ ਉਚਰਿ ਕਰਿ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਚੀਨੀਅਹੁ ਨਾਮ ਸੁਜਾਨ। ੩੯੩।","roman":"Asatr uchri kari paasi ke cheeneeahu naam sujaan | 393 |","meaning_en":"uttering 'astra', O knowing ones, recognise these as names of the noose. 393.","page":950,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਅਤੇ ਫਿਰ 'ਅਸਤ੍ਰ' ਪਦ ਜੋੜੋ। ਇਸ ਤਰ੍ਰਹਾ (ਇਨ੍ਰਹਾ ਨੂੰ) ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਵਿਚਾਰ ਲਵੋ ॥੩੯੩॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[394],"number_text":"੩੯੪।","page":951,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਬਾਰਿਦ ਅਰਿ ਪਦ ਪ੍ਰਿਥਮ ਕਹਿ ਈਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ ਕਹਿ ਅੰਤ।","roman":"Baarid ari pad pritham kahi eesraasatr kahi ant |","meaning_en":"Say the words 'barid ari' (foe of the cloud) first, and 'isarastra' at the end;","page":951,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"Chain uncertain.","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਬਾਰਿਦ ਅਰਿ' ਕਹਿ ਕੇ (ਫਿਰ) ਅੰਤ ਉਤੇ 'ਨਿਧਿ' ਅਤੇ 'ਈਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ' ਕਹਿ ਦਿਓ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਿਧਿ ਕਹਿ ਨਾਮ ਸ੍ਰੀ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਚੀਨਹੁ ਚਤੁਰ ਅਨੰਤ। ੩੯੪।","roman":"Nidhi kahi naam sree paasi ke cheenhu chatur anant | 394 |","meaning_en":"saying 'nidhi', O wise ones, recognise the endless names of the revered noose. 394.","page":951,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਸ ਤੋਂ) ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਅਨੰਤ ਨਾਮ ਬਣਦੇ ਜਾਣਗੇ ॥੩੯੪॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[395],"number_text":"੩੯੫।","page":951,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਤ੍ਰਾਤ੍ਰਾਂਤਕ ਪਦ ਪ੍ਰਿਥਮ ਕਹਿ ਨਿਧਿ ਏਸਾਸਤ੍ਰ ਬਖਾਨ।","roman":"Traatraantak pad pritham kahi nidhi esaasatr bakhaan |","meaning_en":"Say the word 'tratrantak' (?) first, then speak 'nidhi' and 'esastra';","page":951,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਤ੍ਰਾਤ੍ਰਾਂਤਕ: obscure; uncertain.","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਤ੍ਰਾਤ੍ਰਾਤਕ' (ਤ੍ਰਾਤ੍ਰਿ ਅੰਤਕ) ਪਦ ਕਹਿ ਕੇ ਮਗਰੋਂ 'ਏਸਾਸਤ੍ਰ' ਪਦ ਜੋੜੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਹੋਤ ਹੈ ਚਤੁਰ ਲੀਜੀਅਹੁ ਜਾਨ। ੩੯੫।","roman":"Naam paasi ke hot hai chatur leejeeahu jaan | 395 |","meaning_en":"these become names of the noose; O wise one, know them. 395.","page":951,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਹੇ ਵਿਦਵਾਨੋ! ਇਸ ਨੂੰ ਪਾਸ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਸਮਝ ਲਵੋ ॥੩੯੫॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[396],"number_text":"੩੯੬।","page":951,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਝਖੀ ਤ੍ਰਾਣਿ ਪਦ ਪ੍ਰਿਥਮੈ ਕਹਿ ਈਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ ਕਹਿ ਅੰਤਿ।","roman":"Jhakhee traani pad prithmai kahi eesraasatr kahi anti |","meaning_en":"Say the words 'jhakhi tran' (protector of fish, water) first, and 'isarastra' at the end;","page":951,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਝਖੀ ਤ੍ਰਾਣਿ' ਪਦ ਕਹਿ ਕੇ (ਫਿਰ) 'ਈਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ' ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਸਕਲ ਸ੍ਰੀ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਨਿਕਸਤ ਚਲਤ ਬਿਅੰਤ। ੩੯੬।","roman":"Naam sakal sree paasi ke niksat chalat biant | 396 |","meaning_en":"endless names of the revered noose come forth. 396.","page":951,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਸਾਰੇ ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਬੇਅੰਤ ਨਾਮ ਬਣਦੇ ਜਾਦੇ ਹਨ ॥੩੯੬॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[397],"number_text":"੩੯੭।","page":951,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਮਤਸ ਤ੍ਰਾਣਿ ਪ੍ਰਿਥਮੈ ਉਚਰਿ ਈਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ ਕੈ ਦੀਨ।","roman":"Matas traani prithmai uchri eesraasatr kai deen |","meaning_en":"Uttering 'mats tran' (protector of fish) first, give 'isarastra';","page":951,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਮਤਸ ਤ੍ਰਾਣਿ' ਕਹਿ ਕੇ, (ਫਿਰ) 'ਈਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ' ਕਹਿ ਦਿਓ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਹੋਤ ਹੈ ਚਤੁਰ ਲੀਜੀਅਹੁ ਚੀਨ। ੩੯੭।","roman":"Naam paasi ke hot hai chatur leejeeahu cheen | 397 |","meaning_en":"these become names of the noose; O wise one, recognise them. 397.","page":951,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਸ ਤਰ੍ਰਹਾ) ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਬਣਦੇ ਹਨ। ਚਤੁਰ ਲੋਗੋ! ਸਮਝ ਲਵੋ ॥੩੯੭॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[398],"number_text":"੩੯੮।","page":951,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਮੈਨ ਕੇਤੁ ਕਹਿ ਤ੍ਰਾਣਿ ਕਹਿ ਈਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ ਕੈ ਦੀਨ।","roman":"Main ketu kahi traani kahi eesraasatr kai deen |","meaning_en":"Saying 'Main-ketu' (Kamdev's banner, the fish), say 'tran', and give 'isarastra';","page":951,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਮੈਨ ਕੇਤੁ' ਕਹਿ ਕੇ ਫਿਰ 'ਤ੍ਰਾਣਿ' ਅਤੇ 'ਈਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ' ਕਹਿ ਦਿਓ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਹੋਤ ਹੈ ਚਤੁਰ ਲੀਜੀਅਹੁ ਚੀਨ। ੩੯੮।","roman":"Naam paasi ke hot hai chatur leejeeahu cheen | 398 |","meaning_en":"these become names of the noose; O wise one, recognise them. 398.","page":951,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਸ ਤਰ੍ਰਹਾ) ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਬਣਦੇ ਹਨ। ਚਤੁਰ ਲੋਗੋ! ਸਮਝ ਲਵੋ ॥੩੯੭॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[399],"number_text":"੩੯੯।","page":951,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਸਕਲ ਨਾਮ ਲੈ ਨੀਰ ਕੇ ਜਾ ਕਹਿ ਤ੍ਰਾਣਿ ਬਖਾਨ।","roman":"Sakal naam lai neer ke jaa kahi traani bakhaan |","meaning_en":"Take all the names of water, say 'ja' (born: the lotus), and speak 'tran';","page":951,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"Protector of the lotus = water; uncertain.","meaning_pa":"ਨੀਰ (ਜਲ) ਦੇ ਸਾਰੇ ਨਾਮ (ਪਹਿਲਾ) ਲੈ ਕੇ ਫਿਰ 'ਜਾ' ਅਤੇ 'ਤ੍ਰਾਣਿ' ਪਦ ਜੋੜੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਈਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ ਕਹਿ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਚੀਨਹੁ ਨਾਮ ਅਪ੍ਰਮਾਨ। ੩੯੯।","roman":"Eesraasatr kahi paasi ke cheenhu naam apramaan | 399 |","meaning_en":"saying 'isarastra', recognise the innumerable names of the noose. 399.","page":951,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਫਿਰ) 'ਈਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ' ਕਹਿ ਕੇ ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਪਛਾਣ ਲਵੋ ॥੩੯੯॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[400],"number_text":"੪੦੦।","page":951,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਬਾਰਿਜ ਤ੍ਰਾਣਿ ਬਖਾਨਿ ਕੈ ਈਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ ਕੈ ਦੀਨ।","roman":"Baarij traani bakhaani kai eesraasatr kai deen |","meaning_en":"Speaking 'barij tran' (protector of the lotus), give 'isarastra';","page":951,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਪਹਿਲਾ) 'ਬਾਰਿਜ ਤ੍ਰਾਣਿ' ਕਹਿ ਕੇ (ਫਿਰ) 'ਈਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ' ਪਦ ਕਹਿ ਦਿਓ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਹੋਤ ਹੈ ਚਤੁਰ ਲੀਜੀਅਹੁ ਚੀਨ। ੪੦੦।","roman":"Naam paasi ke hot hai chatur leejeeahu cheen | 400 |","meaning_en":"these become names of the noose; O wise one, recognise them. 400.","page":951,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਬਣਦੇ ਹਨ। ਸੂਝਵਾਨੋ! ਸਮਝ ਲਵੋ ॥੪੦੦॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[401],"number_text":"੪੦੧।","page":951,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਜਲਜ ਤ੍ਰਾਣਿ ਪਦ ਪ੍ਰਿਥਮ ਕਹਿ ਈਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ ਪੁਨਿ ਭਾਖੁ।","roman":"Jalaj traani pad pritham kahi eesraasatr puni bhaakhu |","meaning_en":"Say the words 'jalaj tran' first, then speak 'isarastra';","page":951,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਜਲਜ ਤ੍ਰਾਣਿ' ਪਦ ਕਹਿ ਕੇ, ਫਿਰ 'ਈਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ' ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਹੋਤ ਹੈ ਚਤੁਰ ਚੀਨ ਚਿਤ ਰਾਖੁ। ੪੦੧।","roman":"Naam paasi ke hot hai chatur cheen chit raakhu | 401 |","meaning_en":"these become names of the noose; O wise one, recognise them and keep them in mind. 401.","page":951,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਬਣਦੇ ਹਨ। ਸਮਝਦਾਰ ਲੋਗੋ! ਸਮਝ ਲਵੋ ॥੪੦੧॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[402],"number_text":"੪੦੨।","page":951,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਨੀਰਜ ਤ੍ਰਾਣਿ ਬਖਾਨਿ ਕੈ ਈਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ ਕਹਿ ਅੰਤਿ।","roman":"Neeraj traani bakhaani kai eesraasatr kahi anti |","meaning_en":"Speaking 'niraj tran', say 'isarastra' at the end;","page":951,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਨੀਰਜ ਤ੍ਰਾਣਿ' ਕਹਿ ਕੇ (ਫਿਰ) ਅੰਤ ਉਤੇ 'ਈਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ' ਕਹਿ ਦਿਓ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਸਕਲ ਨਾਮ ਸ੍ਰੀ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਨਿਕਸਤ ਚਲਤ ਅਨੰਤ। ੪੦੨।","roman":"Sakal naam sree paasi ke niksat chalat anant | 402 |","meaning_en":"endless names of the revered noose come forth. 402.","page":951,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਸ ਤਰ੍ਰਹਾ) ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਅਨੇਕ ਨਾਮ ਬਣਦੇ ਜਾਣਗੇ ॥੪੦੨॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[403],"number_text":"੪੦੩।","page":951,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਕਮਲ ਤ੍ਰਾਣਿ ਪਦ ਪ੍ਰਿਥਮ ਕਹਿ ਈਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ ਕੈ ਦੀਨ।","roman":"Kamal traani pad pritham kahi eesraasatr kai deen |","meaning_en":"Say the words 'kamal tran' (protector of the lotus) first, and give 'isarastra';","page":951,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਕਮਲ ਤ੍ਰਾਣਿ' ਪਦ ਕਹਿ ਕੇ 'ਈਸਰਾਸਤ੍ਰ' ਜੋੜ ਦਿਓ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਹੋਤ ਹੈ ਚਤੁਰ ਲੀਜੀਅਹੁ ਚੀਨ। ੪੦੩।","roman":"Naam paasi ke hot hai chatur leejeeahu cheen | 403 |","meaning_en":"these become names of the noose; O wise one, recognise them. 403.","page":951,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਸ ਤਰ੍ਰਹਾ) ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਹੋ ਜਾਦੇ ਹਨ। ਸੂਝਵਾਨ ਵਿਚਾਰ ਲੈਣ ॥੪੦੩॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[404],"number_text":"੪੦੪।","page":951,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਰਿਪੁ ਪਦ ਪ੍ਰਿਥਮ ਉਚਾਰਿ ਕੈ ਅੰਤਕ ਬਹੁਰਿ ਬਖਾਨ।","roman":"Ripu pad pritham uchaari kai antak bahuri bakhaan |","meaning_en":"Uttering the word 'ripu' (foe) first, then speak 'antak' (ender);","page":951,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਪਹਿਲਾ) 'ਰਿਪੁ' ਪਦ ਕਹਿ ਕੇ ਫਿਰ 'ਅੰਤਕ' (ਸ਼ਬਦ) ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਹੋਤ ਹੈ ਲੀਜੀਅਹੁ ਸਮਝ ਸੁਜਾਨ। ੪੦੪।","roman":"Naam paasi ke hot hai leejeeahu samajh sujaan | 404 |","meaning_en":"these become names of the noose; O knowing ones, understand them. 404.","page":951,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਬਣ ਜਾਦੇ ਹਨ। ਸੁਜਾਨੋ! ਸਮਝ ਲਵੋ ॥੪੦੪॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[405],"number_text":"੪੦੫।","page":951,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਸਤ੍ਰੁ ਆਦਿ ਸਬਦੁ ਉਚਰਿ ਕੈ ਅੰਤਕ ਪੁਨਿ ਪਦ ਦੇਹੁ।","roman":"Satru aadi sabdu uchri kai antak puni pad dehu |","meaning_en":"Uttering the word 'satru' first, then add the word 'antak';","page":951,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਸਤ੍ਰੁ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਉਚਾਰ ਕੇ ਫਿਰ 'ਅੰਤਕ' ਪਦ ਜੋੜੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਸਕਲ ਸ੍ਰੀ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਚੀਨ ਚਤੁਰ ਚਿਤਿ ਲੇਹੁ। ੪੦੫।","roman":"Naam sakal sree paasi ke cheen chatur chiti lehu | 405 |","meaning_en":"O wise one, recognise in your mind all these as names of the revered noose. 405.","page":951,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਸਾਰੇ ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਹਨ। ਵਿਦਵਾਨ ਲੋਗ ਮਨ ਵਿਚ ਵਿਚਾਰ ਲੈਣ ॥੪੦੫॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[406],"number_text":"੪੦੬।","page":951,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਆਦਿ ਖਲ ਸਬਦ ਉਚਰਿ ਕੈ ਅੰਤ੍ਯਾਂਤਕ ਕੈ ਦੀਨ।","roman":"Aadi khal sabad uchri kai antyaantak kai deen |","meaning_en":"Uttering the word 'khal' (wicked) first, give 'antyantak' (final ender);","page":951,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਅੰਤ੍ਯਾਂਤਕ: read as 'utter destroyer'; uncertain."},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸ ਕੇ ਹੋਤ ਹੈ ਚਤੁਰ ਲੀਜੀਅਹੁ ਚੀਨ। ੪੦੬।","roman":"Naam paas ke hot hai chatur leejeeahu cheen | 406 |","meaning_en":"these become names of the noose; O wise one, recognise them. 406.","page":951,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਖਲ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਉਚਾਰ ਕੇ ਫਿਰ ਅੰਤ ਉਤੇ 'ਅੰਤਕ' (ਪਦ) ਰਖੋ। (ਇਹ) ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਬਣ ਜਾਦੇ ਹਨ। ਚਤੁਰ ਲੋਗ ਵਿਚਾਰ ਲੈਣ ॥੪੦੬॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB","note_pa":"ਇਹ ਅਰਥ ਇਸ ਪੰਕਤੀ ਸਮੇਤ ਉੱਪਰਲੀਆਂ 2 ਪੰਕਤੀਆਂ ਦਾ ਇਕੱਠਾ ਹੈ।"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[407],"number_text":"੪੦੭।","page":951,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਦੁਸਟ ਆਦਿ ਸਬਦ ਉਚਰਿ ਕੈ ਅੰਤ੍ਯਾਂਤਕ ਕਹਿ ਭਾਖੁ।","roman":"Dusat aadi sabad uchri kai antyaantak kahi bhaakhu |","meaning_en":"Uttering the word 'dusht' (wicked) first, speak 'antyantak';","page":951,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਮੁਢ ਵਿਚ 'ਦੁਸਟ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਹਿ ਕੇ, ਅੰਤ ਵਿਚ 'ਅੰਤਕ' ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਸਕਲ ਸ੍ਰੀ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਚੀਨ ਚਤੁਰ ਚਿਤਿ ਰਾਖੁ। ੪੦੭।","roman":"Naam sakal sree paasi ke cheen chatur chiti raakhu | 407 |","meaning_en":"O wise one, recognise all these as names of the revered noose and keep them in mind. 407.","page":951,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਸਾਰੇ ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਹੋ ਜਾਣਗੇ, ਸੂਝਵਾਨ ਚਿਤ ਵਿਚ ਧਾਰ ਲੈਣ ॥੪੦੭॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[408],"number_text":"੪੦੮।","page":951,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਤਨ ਰਿਪੁ ਪ੍ਰਿਥਮ ਬਖਾਨਿ ਕੈ ਅੰਤ੍ਯਾਂਤਕ ਕੈ ਦੀਨ।","roman":"Tan ripu pritham bakhaani kai antyaantak kai deen |","meaning_en":"Speak 'tan ripu' (foe of the body) first, and give 'antyantak';","page":951,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਤਨ ਰਿਪੁ' (ਸ਼ਬਦ) ਕਹਿ ਕੇ (ਫਿਰ) ਅੰਤ ਉਤੇ 'ਅੰਤਕ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਜੋੜੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਹੋਤ ਹੈ ਚਤੁਰ ਲੀਜੀਅਹੁ ਚੀਨ। ੪੦੮।","roman":"Naam paasi ke hot hai chatur leejeeahu cheen | 408 |","meaning_en":"these become names of the noose; O wise one, recognise them. 408.","page":951,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਬਣ ਜਾਣਗੇ। ਸੂਝਵਾਨ ਵਿਚਾਰ ਲੈਣ ॥੪੦੮॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[409],"number_text":"੪੦੯।","page":951,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਅਸੁ ਅਰਿ ਆਦਿ ਬਖਾਨਿ ਕੈ ਅੰਤ੍ਯਾਂਤਕ ਕਹੁ ਭਾਖੁ।","roman":"Asu ari aadi bakhaani kai antyaantak kahu bhaakhu |","meaning_en":"Speak 'asu ari' (foe of life) first, and say 'antyantak';","page":951,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਅਸੁ' 'ਅਰਿ' (ਪ੍ਰਾਣ ਦਾ ਵੈਰੀ) ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਹਿ ਕੇ ਅੰਤ ਵਿਚ 'ਅੰਤਕ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਹੋਤ ਹੈ ਚੀਨਿ ਚਤੁਰ ਚਿਤਿ ਰਾਖੁ। ੪੦੯।","roman":"Naam paasi ke hot hai cheeni chatur chiti raakhu | 409 |","meaning_en":"these become names of the noose; O wise one, recognise them and keep them in mind. 409.","page":951,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਬਣ ਜਾਣਗੇ। ਚਤੁਰ ਲੋਗ ਚਿਤ ਵਿਚ ਧਾਰਨ ਕਰ ਲੈਣ ॥੪੦੯॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[410],"number_text":"੪੧੦।","page":951,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਦਲਹਾ ਪ੍ਰਿਥਮ ਬਖਾਨਿ ਕੈ ਅੰਤ੍ਯਾਂਤਕ ਕੌ ਦੇਹੁ।","roman":"Dalhaa pritham bakhaani kai antyaantak kau dehu |","meaning_en":"Speak 'dalha' (destroyer of armies) first, and add 'antyantak';","page":951,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਦਲਹਾ' (ਸੈਨਾ ਦਾ ਘਾਤਕ) ਕਹਿ ਕੇ, (ਫਿਰ) ਅੰਤ ਉਤੇ 'ਅੰਤਕ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਰਖੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਹੋਤ ਹੈ ਚੀਨ ਚਤੁਰ ਚਿਤਿ ਲੇਹੁ। ੪੧੦।","roman":"Naam paasi ke hot hai cheen chatur chiti lehu | 410 |","meaning_en":"these become names of the noose; O wise one, recognise them in your mind. 410.","page":951,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਬਣਦੇ ਹਨ। ਸੂਝਵਾਨ ਚਿਤ ਵਿਚ ਰਖ ਲੈਣ ॥੪੧੦॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[411],"number_text":"੪੧੧।","page":952,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਪ੍ਰਿਤਨਾਂਤਕ ਪਦ ਪ੍ਰਿਥਮ ਕਹਿ ਅੰਤ੍ਯਾਂਤਕ ਕੈ ਦੀਨ।","roman":"Pritnaantak pad pritham kahi antyaantak kai deen |","meaning_en":"Say the word 'pritnantak' (ender of armies) first, and give 'antyantak';","page":952,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਹੋਤ ਹੈ ਚਤੁਰ ਲੀਜੀਅਹੁ ਚੀਨ। ੪੧੧।","roman":"Naam paasi ke hot hai chatur leejeeahu cheen | 411 |","meaning_en":"these become names of the noose; O wise one, recognise them. 411.","page":952,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਪ੍ਰਿਤਨਾਤਕ' (ਸੈਨਾ ਦਾ ਨਾਸ ਕਰਨ ਵਾਲਾ) ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਹਿ ਕੇ, ਅੰਤ ਉਤੇ 'ਅੰਤਕ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ। (ਇਹ) ਪਾਸ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਹੈ। ਚਤੁਰ ਲੋਗ ਸਮਝ ਲੈਣ ॥੪੧੧॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB","note_pa":"ਇਹ ਅਰਥ ਇਸ ਪੰਕਤੀ ਸਮੇਤ ਉੱਪਰਲੀਆਂ 2 ਪੰਕਤੀਆਂ ਦਾ ਇਕੱਠਾ ਹੈ।"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[412],"number_text":"੪੧੨।","page":952,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਧੁਜਨੀ ਅਰਿ ਪਦ ਪ੍ਰਿਥਮ ਕਹਿ ਅੰਤ੍ਯਾਂਤਕਹਿ ਉਚਾਰਿ।","roman":"Dhujnee ari pad pritham kahi antyaantakhi uchaari |","meaning_en":"Say the words 'dhujni ari' (foe of the bannered army) first, then utter 'antyantak';","page":952,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਧੁਜਨੀ: an army (that bears banners)."},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਹੋਤ ਹੈ ਲੀਜਹੁ ਸੁਕਬਿ ਸੁਧਾਰਿ। ੪੧੨।","roman":"Naam paasi ke hot hai leejhu sukbi sudhaari | 412 |","meaning_en":"these become names of the noose; good poets, take them, set right. 412.","page":952,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਧੁਜਨੀ ਅਰਿ' (ਸੈਨਾ ਦਾ ਵੈਰੀ) ਕਹਿ ਕੇ ਅੰਤ ਵਿਚ 'ਅੰਤਕ' ਪਦ ਜੋੜੋ। (ਇਹ) ਪਾਸ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਹੈ। ਕਵੀ ਜਨ ਵਿਚਾਰ ਲੈਣ ॥੪੧੨॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB","note_pa":"ਇਹ ਅਰਥ ਇਸ ਪੰਕਤੀ ਸਮੇਤ ਉੱਪਰਲੀਆਂ 2 ਪੰਕਤੀਆਂ ਦਾ ਇਕੱਠਾ ਹੈ।"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[413],"number_text":"੪੧੩।","page":952,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਆਦਿ ਬਾਹਨੀ ਸਬਦ ਕਹਿ ਰਿਪੁ ਅਰਿ ਸਬਦ ਬਖਾਨ।","roman":"Aadi baahnee sabad kahi ripu ari sabad bakhaan |","meaning_en":"Say the word 'bahini' (army) first, then speak the words 'ripu ari';","page":952,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"Army → its foe → foe of that; the chain is formulaic; uncertain.","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਬਾਹਨੀ' (ਸੈਨਾ) ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਹਿ ਕੇ, (ਫਿਰ) 'ਰਿਪੁ' ਅਤੇ 'ਅਰਿ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਹੋਤ ਹੈ ਚੀਨ ਲੇਹੁ ਮਤਿਵਾਨ। ੪੧੩।","roman":"Naam paasi ke hot hai cheen lehu mativaan | 413 |","meaning_en":"these become names of the noose; O wise ones, recognise them. 413.","page":952,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਪਾਸ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਬਣ ਜਾਏਗਾ। ਬੁੱਧੀਮਾਨੋ! ਵਿਚਾਰ ਕਰ ਲਵੋ ॥੪੧੩॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[414],"number_text":"੪੧੪।","page":952,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਬਾਹਨਿ ਆਦਿ ਬਖਾਨਿ ਕੈ ਰਿਪੁ ਅਰਿ ਬਹੁਰਿ ਬਖਾਨ।","roman":"Baahni aadi bakhaani kai ripu ari bahuri bakhaan |","meaning_en":"Speak 'bahini' first, then speak 'ripu ari';","page":952,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਬਾਹਨਿ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਹਿ ਕੇ, ਫਿਰ 'ਰਿਪੁ ਅਰਿ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਹੋਤ ਹੈ ਚੀਨ ਲੇਹੁ ਬੁਧਿਵਾਨ। ੪੧੪।","roman":"Naam paasi ke hot hai cheen lehu budhivaan | 414 |","meaning_en":"these become names of the noose; O wise ones, recognise them. 414.","page":952,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਪਾਸ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਹੈ। ਸੂਝਵਾਨ ਵਿਚਾਰ ਲੈਣ ॥੪੧੪॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[415],"number_text":"੪੧੫।","page":952,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਸੈਨਾ ਆਦਿ ਉਚਾਰਿ ਕੈ ਰਿਪੁ ਅਰਿ ਬਹੁਰਿ ਬਖਾਨਿ।","roman":"Sainaa aadi uchaari kai ripu ari bahuri bakhaani |","meaning_en":"Uttering 'sena' (army) first, then speak 'ripu ari';","page":952,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਸੈਨਾ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਉਚਾਰ ਕੇ, ਫਿਰ 'ਰਿਪੁ ਅਰਿ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਹੋਤ ਹੈ ਲੀਜਹੁ ਚਤੁਰ ਪਛਾਨ। ੪੧੫।","roman":"Naam paasi ke hot hai leejhu chatur pachhaan | 415 |","meaning_en":"these become names of the noose; O wise one, recognise them. 415.","page":952,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਪਾਸ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਹੈ। ਸੂਝਵਾਨ ਵਿਚਾਰ ਲੈਣ ॥੪੧੫॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[416],"number_text":"੪੧੬।","page":952,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਹਯਨੀ ਆਦਿ ਬਖਾਨਿ ਕੈ ਅੰਤ੍ਯੰਤਕ ਕੈ ਦੀਨ।","roman":"Haynee aadi bakhaani kai antyantak kai deen |","meaning_en":"Speak 'hayani' (army of horses) first, and give 'antyantak';","page":952,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਹੋਤ ਹੈ ਚਤੁਰ ਲੀਜੀਅਹੁ ਚੀਨ। ੪੧੬।","roman":"Naam paasi ke hot hai chatur leejeeahu cheen | 416 |","meaning_en":"these become names of the noose; O wise one, recognise them. 416.","page":952,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਹਯਨੀ' (ਘੋੜ ਸਵਾਰ ਸੈਨਾ) ਪਹਿਲਾ ਕਹਿ ਕੇ, ਅੰਤ ਉਤੇ 'ਅੰਤਕ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਜੋੜੋ। (ਇਹ) ਪਾਸ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਹੈ। ਵਿਚਾਰਵਾਨ ਜਾਣ ਲੈਣ ॥੪੧੬॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB","note_pa":"ਇਹ ਅਰਥ ਇਸ ਪੰਕਤੀ ਸਮੇਤ ਉੱਪਰਲੀਆਂ 2 ਪੰਕਤੀਆਂ ਦਾ ਇਕੱਠਾ ਹੈ।"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[417],"number_text":"੪੧੭।","page":952,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਗੈਨੀ ਆਦਿ ਬਖਾਨਿ ਕੈ ਅੰਤ੍ਯੰਤਕ ਅਰਿ ਦੇਹੁ।","roman":"Gainee aadi bakhaani kai antyantak ari dehu |","meaning_en":"Speak 'gaini' (army of elephants) first, and add 'antyantak ari';","page":952,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਹੋਤ ਹੈ ਚੀਨ ਚਤੁਰ ਚਿਤ ਲੇਹੁ। ੪੧੭।","roman":"Naam paasi ke hot hai cheen chatur chit lehu | 417 |","meaning_en":"these become names of the noose; O wise one, recognise them in your mind. 417.","page":952,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਗੈਨੀ' (ਹਾਥੀ ਉਤੇ ਸਵਾਰ ਸੈਨਾ) (ਫਿਰ) ਅੰਤ ਉਤੇ 'ਅੰਤਕ ਅਰਿ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਜੋੜੋ। (ਇਹ) ਪਾਸ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਬਣਦਾ ਹੈ। ਚਤੁਰ ਲੋਗ ਵਿਚਾਰ ਕਰ ਲੈਣ ॥੪੧੭॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB","note_pa":"ਇਹ ਅਰਥ ਇਸ ਪੰਕਤੀ ਸਮੇਤ ਉੱਪਰਲੀਆਂ 2 ਪੰਕਤੀਆਂ ਦਾ ਇਕੱਠਾ ਹੈ।"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[418],"number_text":"੪੧੮।","page":952,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਪਤਿਨੀ ਆਦਿ ਬਖਾਨਿ ਕੈ ਅਰਿ ਪਦ ਬਹੁਰਿ ਉਚਾਰਿ।","roman":"Patinee aadi bakhaani kai ari pad bahuri uchaari |","meaning_en":"Speak 'patini' (army of foot-soldiers) first, then utter the word 'ari';","page":952,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਪਤਿਨੀ' (ਪੈਦਲ ਸੈਨਾ) ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਹਿ ਕੇ ਫਿਰ 'ਅਰਿ' ਪਦ ਜੋੜੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਹੋਤ ਹੈ ਜਾਨ ਲੇਹੁ ਨਿਰਧਾਰ। ੪੧੮।","roman":"Naam paasi ke hot hai jaan lehu nirdhaar | 418 |","meaning_en":"these become names of the noose; know them firmly. 418.","page":952,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਪਾਸ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਬਣਦਾ ਹੈ। ਇਸ ਨੂੰ ਮਨ ਵਿਚ ਨਿਸਚਾ ਕਰ ਲਵੋ ॥੪੧੮॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[419],"number_text":"੪੧੯।","page":952,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਰਥਨੀ ਆਦਿ ਬਖਾਨਿ ਕੈ ਰਿਪੁ ਅਰਿ ਅੰਤਿ ਉਚਾਰੁ।","roman":"Rathnee aadi bakhaani kai ripu ari anti uchaaru |","meaning_en":"Speak 'rathni' (army of chariots) first, and utter 'ripu ari' at the end;","page":952,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਰਥਨੀ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਥਨ ਕਰ ਕੇ, ਅੰਤ ਉਤੇ 'ਰਿਪੁ ਅਰਿ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਜੋੜੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਹੋਤ ਹੈ ਲੀਜਹੁ ਸੁ ਕਬਿ ਸੁਧਾਰ। ੪੧੯।","roman":"Naam paasi ke hot hai leejhu su kabi sudhaar | 419 |","meaning_en":"these become names of the noose; good poets, take them, set right. 419.","page":952,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਪਾਸ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਹੁੰਦਾ ਹੈ। ਕਵੀ ਵਿਚਾਰ ਕਰ ਲੈਣ ॥੪੧੯॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[420],"number_text":"੪੨੦।","page":952,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਨ੍ਰਿਪਣੀ ਆਦਿ ਬਖਾਨਿ ਕੈ ਰਿਪੁ ਖਿਪ ਬਹੁਰ ਉਚਾਰਿ।","roman":"Nripnee aadi bakhaani kai ripu khip bahur uchaari |","meaning_en":"Speak 'nripani' (army of kings) first, then utter 'ripu khip' (destroyer of the foe);","page":952,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਨ੍ਰਿਪਣੀ' (ਰਾਜੇ ਦੀ ਫੌਜ) ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਹਿ ਕੇ, ਪਿਛੋਂ 'ਰਿਪੁ ਖਿਪ' ਪਦ ਉਚਾਰਨ ਕਰੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਹੋਤ ਹੈ ਲੀਜਅਹੁ ਸੁ ਕਬਿ ਸੁਧਾਰ। ੪੨੦।","roman":"Naam paasi ke hot hai leeja'ahu su kabi sudhaar | 420 |","meaning_en":"these become names of the noose; good poets, take them, set right. 420.","page":952,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਪਾਸ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਬਣਦਾ ਹੈ। ਕਵੀ ਸੋਚ ਲੈਣ ॥੪੨੦॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[421],"number_text":"੪੨੧।","page":952,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਭਟਨੀ ਆਦਿ ਬਖਾਨਿ ਕੈ ਰਿਪੁ ਅਰਿ ਬਹੁਰ ਬਖਾਨ।","roman":"Bhatnee aadi bakhaani kai ripu ari bahur bakhaan |","meaning_en":"Speak 'bhatni' (army of warriors) first, then speak 'ripu ari';","page":952,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਭਟਨੀ' (ਸੂਰਮਿਆਂ ਦੀ ਸੈਨਾ) ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਹਿ ਕੇ, ਬਾਦ ਵਿਚ 'ਰਿਪੁ ਅਰਿ' ਪਦ ਜੋੜੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਹੋਤ ਹੈ ਚੀਨਹੁ ਪ੍ਰਗ੍ਯਾਵਾਨ। ੪੨੧।","roman":"Naam paasi ke hot hai cheenhu pragyaavaan | 421 |","meaning_en":"these become names of the noose; O men of understanding, recognise them. 421.","page":952,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[422],"number_text":"੪੨੨।","page":952,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਆਦਿ ਬੀਰਣੀ ਸਬਦ ਕਹਿ ਰਿਪੁ ਅਰਿ ਬਹੁਰਿ ਬਖਾਨ।","roman":"Aadi beernee sabad kahi ripu ari bahuri bakhaan |","meaning_en":"Say the word 'birni' (army of heroes) first, then speak 'ripu ari';","page":952,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਪਾਸ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਬਣਦਾ ਹੈ। ਬੁੱਧੀਮਾਨ ਸਮਝ ਲੈਣ ॥੪੨੧॥ ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਬੀਰਣੀ' (ਯੋਧਿਆਂ ਦੀ ਸੈਨਾ) ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਹਿ ਕੇ, ਫਿਰ 'ਰਿਪੁ ਅਰਿ' ਪਦ ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB","note_pa":"ਇਹ ਅਰਥ ਇਸ ਪੰਕਤੀ ਸਮੇਤ ਉੱਪਰਲੀਆਂ 2 ਪੰਕਤੀਆਂ ਦਾ ਇਕੱਠਾ ਹੈ।"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਹੋਤ ਹੈ ਚੀਨ ਲੇਹੁ ਮਤਿਵਾਨ। ੪੨੨।","roman":"Naam paasi ke hot hai cheen lehu mativaan | 422 |","meaning_en":"these become names of the noose; O wise ones, recognise them. 422.","page":952,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਪਾਸ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਬਣਦਾ ਹੈ। ਬੁੱਧੀਮਾਨ ਸਮਝ ਲੈਣ ॥੪੨੨॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[423],"number_text":"੪੨੩।","page":952,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਸਤ੍ਰਣਿ ਆਦਿ ਬਖਾਨਿ ਕੈ ਰਿਪੁ ਅਰਿ ਪੁਨਿ ਪਦ ਦੇਹੁ।","roman":"Satrani aadi bakhaani kai ripu ari puni pad dehu |","meaning_en":"Speak 'satrani' (army of foes) first, then add the words 'ripu ari';","page":952,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਸਤ੍ਰਣਿ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਹਿ ਕੇ ਫਿਰ 'ਰਿਪੁ ਅਰਿ' ਪਦ ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਹੋਤ ਹੈ ਚੀਨ ਚਤੁਰ ਚਿਤ ਲੇਹੁ। ੪੨੩।","roman":"Naam paasi ke hot hai cheen chatur chit lehu | 423 |","meaning_en":"these become names of the noose; O wise one, recognise them in your mind. 423.","page":952,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਪਾਸ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਹੁੰਦਾ ਹੈ। ਸੂਝਵਾਨ ਮਨ ਵਿਚ ਰਖ ਲੈਣ ॥੪੨੩॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[424],"number_text":"੪੨੪।","page":952,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਜੁਧਨਿ ਆਦਿ ਬਖਾਨਿ ਕੈ ਪੁਨਿ ਰਿਪੁ ਅਰਿ ਕੈ ਦੀਨ।","roman":"Judhni aadi bakhaani kai puni ripu ari kai deen |","meaning_en":"Speak 'judhni' (army of fighters) first, then give 'ripu ari';","page":952,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਜੁਧਨਿ' (ਯੁੱਧ ਕਰਨ ਵਾਲੀ ਸੈਨਾ) ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਹਿ ਕੇ, ਫਿਰ 'ਰਿਪੁ ਅਰਿ' ਪਦ ਜੋੜੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਹੋਤ ਹੈ ਚਤੁਰ ਲੀਜੀਅਹੁ ਚੀਨ। ੪੨੪।","roman":"Naam paasi ke hot hai chatur leejeeahu cheen | 424 |","meaning_en":"these become names of the noose; O wise one, recognise them. 424.","page":952,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਪਾਸ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਹੁੰਦਾ ਹੈ। ਸੂਝਵਾਨ ਸੋਚ ਲੈਣ ॥੪੨੪॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[425],"number_text":"੪੨੫।","page":952,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਰਿਪੁਣੀ ਆਦਿ ਉਚਾਰਿ ਕੈ ਰਿਪੁ ਖਿਪ ਅੰਤਿ ਬਖਾਨ।","roman":"Ripunee aadi uchaari kai ripu khip anti bakhaan |","meaning_en":"Uttering 'ripuni' first, speak 'ripu khip' at the end;","page":952,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਰਿਪੁਣੀ' (ਵੈਰੀ ਦੀ ਸੈਨਾ) ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਹਿ ਕੇ (ਫਿਰ) ਅੰਤ ਤੇ 'ਰਿਪੁ ਖਿਪ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਹਿ ਦਿਓ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਹੋਤ ਹੈ ਚਤੁਰ ਚਿਤ ਪਹਿਚਾਨ। ੪੨੫।","roman":"Naam paasi ke hot hai chatur chit pahichaan | 425 |","meaning_en":"these become names of the noose; O wise one, recognise them in your mind. 425.","page":952,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਪਾਸ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਹੁੰਦਾ ਹੈ। ਚਤੁਰ ਚਿਤ ਵਿਚ ਜਾਣ ਲੈਣ ॥੪੨੫॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[426],"number_text":"੪੨੬।","page":952,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਅਰਿਣੀ ਆਦਿ ਉਚਾਰਿ ਕੈ ਰਿਪੁ ਅਰਿ ਬਹੁਰਿ ਬਖਾਨ।","roman":"Arinee aadi uchaari kai ripu ari bahuri bakhaan |","meaning_en":"Uttering 'arini' first, then speak 'ripu ari';","page":952,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਅਰਿਣੀ' (ਵੈਰੀ ਸੈਨਾ) ਕਹਿ ਕੇ ਫਿਰ 'ਰਿਪੁ ਅਰਿ' ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਹੋਤ ਹੈ ਚੀਨ ਲੇਹੁ ਮਤਿਵਾਨ। ੪੨੬।","roman":"Naam paasi ke hot hai cheen lehu mativaan | 426 |","meaning_en":"these become names of the noose; O wise ones, recognise them. 426.","page":952,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸ ਦਾ ਬਣਦਾ ਹੈ। ਸੂਝਵਾਨ ਮਨ ਵਿਚ ਰਖ ਲੈਣ ॥੪੨੬॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[427],"number_text":"੪੨੭।","page":952,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਰਾਜਨਿ ਆਦਿ ਉਚਾਰਿ ਕੈ ਰਿਪੁ ਅਰਿ ਅੰਤਿ ਬਖਾਨ।","roman":"Raajni aadi uchaari kai ripu ari anti bakhaan |","meaning_en":"Uttering 'rajni' (army of kings) first, speak 'ripu ari' at the end;","page":952,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਰਾਜਨਿ' (ਰਾਜੇ ਦੀ ਸੈਨਾ) ਕਹਿ ਕੇ, (ਫਿਰ) ਅੰਤ ਉਤੇ 'ਰਿਪੁ ਅਰਿ' ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਹੋਤ ਹੈ ਚੀਨ ਲੇਹੁ ਬੁਧਿਵਾਨ। ੪੨੭।","roman":"Naam paasi ke hot hai cheen lehu budhivaan | 427 |","meaning_en":"these become names of the noose; O wise ones, recognise them. 427.","page":952,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਪਾਸ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਹੁੰਦਾ ਹੈ। ਬੁੱਧੀਮਾਨ ਸਮਝ ਲੈਣ ॥੪੨੭॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[428],"number_text":"੪੨੮।","page":953,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਆਦਿ ਈਸਰਣੀ ਸਬਦ ਕਹਿ ਰਿਪੁ ਅਰਿ ਬਹੁਰਿ ਬਖਾਨ।","roman":"Aadi eesarnee sabad kahi ripu ari bahuri bakhaan |","meaning_en":"Say the word 'isarni' (army of lords) first, then speak 'ripu ari';","page":953,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਈਸਰਣੀ' (ਸੁਆਮੀ ਵਾਲੀ ਸੈਨਾ) ਕਹਿ ਕੇ ਫਿਰ 'ਰਿਪੁ ਅਰਿ' ਪਦ ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸ ਕੇ ਹੋਤ ਹੈ ਚੀਨ ਲੇਹੁ ਮਤਿਵਾਨ। ੪੨੮।","roman":"Naam paas ke hot hai cheen lehu mativaan | 428 |","meaning_en":"these become names of the noose; O wise ones, recognise them. 428.","page":953,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[429],"number_text":"੪੨੯।","page":953,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਭੂਪਣਿ ਆਦਿ ਬਖਾਨਿ ਕੈ ਰਿਪੁ ਅਰਿ ਅੰਤਿ ਉਚਾਰ।","roman":"Bhoopni aadi bakhaani kai ripu ari anti uchaar |","meaning_en":"Speak 'bhupni' (army of kings) first, and utter 'ripu ari' at the end;","page":953,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸ ਦਾ ਹੁੰਦਾ ਹੈ। ਸੂਝਵਾਨੋ! ਸਮਝ ਲਵੋ ॥੪੨੮॥ ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਭੂਪਣਿ' (ਰਾਜੇ ਦੀ ਸੈਨਾ) ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਹਿ ਕੇ ਅੰਤ ਵਿਚ 'ਰਿਪੁ ਅਰਿ' ਪਦ ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB","note_pa":"ਇਹ ਅਰਥ ਇਸ ਪੰਕਤੀ ਸਮੇਤ ਉੱਪਰਲੀਆਂ 2 ਪੰਕਤੀਆਂ ਦਾ ਇਕੱਠਾ ਹੈ।"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਹੋਤ ਹੈ ਚੀਨਹੁ ਚਤੁਰ ਅਪਾਰ। ੪੨੯।","roman":"Naam paasi ke hot hai cheenhu chatur apaar | 429 |","meaning_en":"these become names of the noose; O wise ones, recognise them without limit. 429.","page":953,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਪਾਸ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਬਣ ਜਾਦਾ ਹੈ। ਸੂਝਵਾਨ ਵਿਚਾਰ ਕਰ ਲੈਣ ॥੪੨੯॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[430],"number_text":"੪੩੦।","page":953,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਨ੍ਰਿਪਜਨ ਏਸ੍ਰਣਿ ਆਦਿ ਕਹੁ ਰਿਪੁ ਅਰਿ ਅੰਤਿ ਉਚਾਰ।","roman":"Nripjan esrani aadi kahu ripu ari anti uchaar |","meaning_en":"Say 'nripjan', 'esrani' first, and utter 'ripu ari' at the end;","page":953,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਨ੍ਰਿਪਜਨ ਏਸ੍ਰਣਿ' (ਰਾਜੇ ਦੀ ਸੈਨਾ) ਕਹਿ ਕੇ ਅੰਤ ਵਿਚ 'ਰਿਪੁ ਅਰਿ' ਪਦ ਜੋੜੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਹੋਤ ਹੈ ਲੀਜਹੁ ਸੁ ਕਬਿ ਸੁਧਾਰ। ੪੩੦।","roman":"Naam paasi ke hot hai leejhu su kabi sudhaar | 430 |","meaning_en":"these become names of the noose; good poets, take them, set right. 430.","page":953,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਪਾਸ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਬਣ ਜਾਏਗਾ। ਕਵੀ ਜਨੋ! ਸੋਚ ਲਵੋ ॥੪੩੦॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[431],"number_text":"੪੩੧।","page":953,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਰਾਜਨਿ ਆਦਿ ਬਖਾਨਿ ਕੈ ਰਿਪੁ ਅਰਿ ਅੰਤਿ ਉਚਾਰ।","roman":"Raajni aadi bakhaani kai ripu ari anti uchaar |","meaning_en":"Speak 'rajni' first, and utter 'ripu ari' at the end;","page":953,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਰਾਜਨਿ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਹਿ ਕੇ ਅੰਤ ਉਤੇ 'ਰਿਪੁ ਅਰਿ' ਪਦ ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਹੋਤ ਹੈ ਚੀਨਹੁ ਚਤੁਰ ਅਪਾਰ। ੪੩੧।","roman":"Naam paasi ke hot hai cheenhu chatur apaar | 431 |","meaning_en":"these become names of the noose; O wise ones, recognise them without limit. 431.","page":953,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਪਾਸ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਹੋ ਜਾਦਾ ਹੈ। ਬੁੱਧੀਮਾਨੋ! ਵਿਚਾਰ ਲਵੋ ॥੪੩੧॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[432],"number_text":"੪੩੨।","page":953,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਏਸਨਿ ਆਦਿ ਬਖਾਨਿ ਕੈ ਅੰਤਕ ਬਹੁਰਿ ਉਚਾਰ।","roman":"Esni aadi bakhaani kai antak bahuri uchaar |","meaning_en":"Speak 'esni' first, then utter 'antak';","page":953,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਏਸਨਿ' (ਸੁਆਮੀ ਦੀ ਸੈਨਾ) ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਹਿ ਕੇ ਫਿਰ 'ਅੰਤਕ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਹੋਤ ਹੈ ਲੀਜਹੁ ਸੁ ਕਬਿ ਸੁਧਾਰ। ੪੩੨।","roman":"Naam paasi ke hot hai leejhu su kabi sudhaar | 432 |","meaning_en":"these become names of the noose; good poets, take them, set right. 432.","page":953,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਪਾਸ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਹੋ ਜਾਵੇਗਾ। ਕਵੀ ਜਨੋ! ਵਿਚਾਰ ਲਵੋ ॥੪੩੨॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[433],"number_text":"੪੩੩।","page":953,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਪ੍ਰਿਥਮ ਨਰੇਸਣਿ ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਹਿ ਰਿਪੁ ਅਰਿ ਅੰਤ ਉਚਾਰ।","roman":"Pritham naresni shabad kahi ripu ari ant uchaar |","meaning_en":"First say the word 'naresni' (army of kings), and utter 'ripu ari' at the end;","page":953,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਨਰੇਸਣਿ' (ਰਾਜੇ ਸਹਿਤ ਸੈਨਾ) ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਹਿ ਕੇ ਫਿਰ 'ਰਿਪੁ ਅਰਿ' ਅੰਤ ਵਿਚ ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਹੋਤ ਹੈ ਲੀਜਹੁ ਸੁ ਕਬਿ ਸੁਧਾਰ। ੪੩੩।","roman":"Naam paasi ke hot hai leejhu su kabi sudhaar | 433 |","meaning_en":"these become names of the noose; good poets, take them, set right. 433.","page":953,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਪਾਸ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਹੋ ਜਾਵੇਗਾ। ਕਵੀ ਜਨੋ! ਵਿਚਾਰ ਲਵੋ ॥੪੩੨॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[434],"number_text":"੪੩੪।","page":953,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਆਦਿ ਰਾਵਨੀ ਸਬਦ ਕਹਿ ਰਿਪੁ ਅਰਿ ਅੰਤਿ ਉਚਾਰ।","roman":"Aadi raavnee sabad kahi ripu ari anti uchaar |","meaning_en":"Say the word 'ravni' (army of kings, rav) first, and utter 'ripu ari' at the end;","page":953,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਰਾਵਨੀ: read as from 'rav' (king); uncertain.","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਰਾਵਨੀ' (ਰਾਜੇ ਦੀ ਸੈਨਾ) ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਹਿ ਕੇ, ਫਿਰ ਅੰਤ ਉਤੇ 'ਰਿਪੁ ਅਰਿ' ਪਦ ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸ ਕੇ ਹੋਤ ਹੈ ਲੀਜਹੁ ਸੁ ਕਬਿ ਸੁਧਾਰ। ੪੩੪।","roman":"Naam paas ke hot hai leejhu su kabi sudhaar | 434 |","meaning_en":"these become names of the noose; good poets, take them, set right. 434.","page":953,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[435],"number_text":"੪੩੫।","page":953,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਰਾਇਨਿ ਆਦਿ ਉਚਾਰਿ ਕੈ ਰਿਪੁ ਅਰਿ ਬਹੁਰਿ ਬਖਾਨ।","roman":"Raaini aadi uchaari kai ripu ari bahuri bakhaan |","meaning_en":"Uttering 'raini' (army of rais) first, then speak 'ripu ari';","page":953,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਪਾਸ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਬਣਦਾ ਹੈ। ਕਵੀ ਜਨ ਵਿਚਾਰ ਕਰ ਲੈਣ ॥੪੩੪॥ ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਰਾਇਨਿ' (ਰਾਇ ਦੀ ਸੈਨਾ) ਕਹਿ ਕੇ ਫਿਰ 'ਰਿਪੁ ਅਰਿ' ਸ਼ਬਦਾ ਦਾ ਬਖਾਨ ਕਰੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB","note_pa":"ਇਹ ਅਰਥ ਇਸ ਪੰਕਤੀ ਸਮੇਤ ਉੱਪਰਲੀਆਂ 2 ਪੰਕਤੀਆਂ ਦਾ ਇਕੱਠਾ ਹੈ।"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਹੋਤ ਹੈ ਸਮਝਹੁ ਸੁਘਰ ਸੁਜਾਨ। ੪੩੫।","roman":"Naam paasi ke hot hai samajhhu sughar sujaan | 435 |","meaning_en":"these become names of the noose; understand them, O skilled and knowing ones. 435.","page":953,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸ ਦਾ ਹੁੰਦਾ ਹੈ। ਸੁਘੜ ਜਨੋ! ਸਮਝ ਲਵੋ ॥੪੩੫॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[436],"number_text":"੪੩੬।","page":953,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਈਸਰਣਿ ਆਦਿ ਬਖਾਨਿ ਕੈ ਰਿਪੁ ਅਰਿ ਉਚਰਹੁ ਅੰਤਿ।","roman":"Eesarni aadi bakhaani kai ripu ari ucharhu anti |","meaning_en":"Speak 'isarni' first, and utter 'ripu ari' at the end;","page":953,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਈਸਰਣਿ' (ਸੁਆਮੀ ਦੀ ਸੈਨਾ) ਕਹਿ ਕੇ ਅੰਤ ਉਤੇ 'ਰਿਪੁ ਅਰਿ' ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਹੋਤ ਹੈ ਚੀਨਹੁ ਚਤੁਰ ਅਨੰਤ। ੪੩੬।","roman":"Naam paasi ke hot hai cheenhu chatur anant | 436 |","meaning_en":"these become names of the noose; O wise ones, recognise them without end. 436.","page":953,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸ ਦਾ ਹੁੰਦਾ ਹੈ। ਸੂਝਵਾਨੋ! ਸਮਝ ਲਵੋ ॥੪੩੬॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[437],"number_text":"੪੩੭।","page":953,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਧੁਜਨੀ ਆਦਿ ਬਖਾਨਿ ਕੈ ਰਿਪੁ ਅਰਿ ਅੰਤਿ ਉਚਾਰ।","roman":"Dhujnee aadi bakhaani kai ripu ari anti uchaar |","meaning_en":"Speak 'dhujni' first, and utter 'ripu ari' at the end;","page":953,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਧੁਜਨੀ' (ਧੁਜਾ ਵਾਲੀ ਸੈਨਾ) ਪਹਿਲਾ ਕਹਿ ਕੇ ਅੰਤ ਵਿਚ 'ਰਿਪੁ ਅਰਿ' ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਹੋਤ ਹੈ ਚੀਨਹੁ ਚਤੁਰ ਅਪਾਰ। ੪੩੭।","roman":"Naam paasi ke hot hai cheenhu chatur apaar | 437 |","meaning_en":"these become names of the noose; O wise ones, recognise them without limit. 437.","page":953,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸ ਦਾ ਹੁੰਦਾ ਹੈ। ਵਿਦਵਾਨੋ! ਸਮਝ ਲੈਣਾ ॥੪੩੭॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[438],"number_text":"੪੩੮।","page":953,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਦੈਤਨਿ ਆਦਿ ਬਖਾਨਿ ਕੈ ਰਿਪੁ ਅਰਿ ਅੰਤਿ ਉਚਾਰ।","roman":"Daitni aadi bakhaani kai ripu ari anti uchaar |","meaning_en":"Speak 'daitni' (army of demons) first, and utter 'ripu ari' at the end;","page":953,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਦੈਤਨਿ' (ਦੈਂਤਾ ਦੀ ਸੈਨਾ) ਪਦ ਕਹਿ ਕੇ ਅੰਤ ਉਤੇ 'ਰਿਪੁ ਅਰਿ' ਦਾ ਉਚਾਰਨ ਕਰੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੈ ਹੋਤ ਹੈ ਚੀਨਹੁ ਸੁ ਕਬਿ ਸੁਧਾਰ। ੪੩੮।","roman":"Naam paasi kai hot hai cheenhu su kabi sudhaar | 438 |","meaning_en":"these become names of the noose; good poets, recognise them, set right. 438.","page":953,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[439],"number_text":"੪੩੯।","page":953,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਰਦਨੀ ਆਦਿ ਬਖਾਨਿ ਕੈ ਰਿਪੁ ਅਰਿ ਉਚਰਹੁ ਅੰਤਿ।","roman":"Radnee aadi bakhaani kai ripu ari ucharhu anti |","meaning_en":"Speak 'radni' (army of tusked elephants) first, and utter 'ripu ari' at the end;","page":953,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਪਾਸ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਹੋ ਜਾਦਾ ਹੈ। ਕਵੀਓ! ਸਮਝ ਲਵੋ ॥੪੩੮॥ ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਰਦਨੀ' (ਦੰਦਾ ਵਾਲੇ ਹਾਥੀਆਂ ਦੀ ਸੈਨਾ) ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਹਿ ਕੇ ਅੰਤ ਉਤੇ 'ਰਿਪੁ ਅਰਿ' ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB","note_pa":"ਇਹ ਅਰਥ ਇਸ ਪੰਕਤੀ ਸਮੇਤ ਉੱਪਰਲੀਆਂ 2 ਪੰਕਤੀਆਂ ਦਾ ਇਕੱਠਾ ਹੈ।"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੈ ਹੋਤ ਹੈ ਚੀਨਹੁ ਚਤੁਰ ਬਿਅੰਤ। ੪੩੯।","roman":"Naam paasi kai hot hai cheenhu chatur biant | 439 |","meaning_en":"these become names of the noose; O wise ones, recognise them without end. 439.","page":953,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਪਾਸ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਹੁੰਦਾ ਹੈ। ਬੁੱਧੀ ਜਨੋ! ਸਮਝ ਲਵੋ ॥੪੩੯॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[440],"number_text":"੪੪੦।","page":953,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਪ੍ਰਿਥਮ ਪਦ ਉਚਰਿ ਬਾਰਣੀ ਰਿਪੁ ਅਰਿ ਅੰਤਿ ਉਚਾਰ।","roman":"Pritham pad uchri baarnee ripu ari anti uchaar |","meaning_en":"First utter the word 'barni' (army of elephants), and utter 'ripu ari' at the end;","page":953,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਬਾਰਣੀ' (ਹਾਥੀਆਂ ਵਾਲੀ ਸੈਨਾ) ਪਦ ਕਹਿ ਕੇ (ਫਿਰ) ਅੰਤ ਉਤੇ 'ਰਿਪੁ ਅਰਿ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਜੋੜੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਹੋਤ ਹੈ ਲੀਜਹੁ ਸੁ ਕਬਿ ਸੁਧਾਰ। ੪੪੦।","roman":"Naam paasi ke hot hai leejhu su kabi sudhaar | 440 |","meaning_en":"these become names of the noose; good poets, take them, set right. 440.","page":953,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਪਾਸ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਬਣਦਾ ਹੈ। ਚੰਗੇ ਕਵੀਓ! ਸਮਝ ਲਵੋ ॥੪੪੦॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[441],"number_text":"੪੪੧।","page":953,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਦ੍ਵਿਪਨਿ ਪ੍ਰਿਥਮ ਉਚਾਰਿ ਕੈ ਰਿਪੁ ਅਰਿ ਅੰਤਿ ਉਚਾਰ।","roman":"Dvipni pritham uchaari kai ripu ari anti uchaar |","meaning_en":"Uttering 'dvipni' (army of elephants) first, utter 'ripu ari' at the end;","page":953,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਦ੍ਵਿਪਨੀ' (ਦੋ ਦੰਦਾ ਵਾਲੇ ਹਾਥੀਆਂ ਦੀ ਸੈਨਾ) ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਹਿ ਕੇ, ਅੰਤ ਉਤੇ 'ਰਿਪੁ ਅਰਿ' ਦਾ ਉਚਾਰਨ ਕਰੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੈ ਏ ਸਭੈ ਨਿਕਸਤ ਚਲਤ ਹਜਾਰ। ੪੪੧।","roman":"Naam paasi kai e sabhai niksat chalat hajaar | 441 |","meaning_en":"all these names of the noose come forth in thousands. 441.","page":953,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਸ ਤਰ੍ਰਹਾ) ਇਹ ਸਾਰੇ ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਬਣਦੇ ਜਾਣਗੇ ॥੪੪੧॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[442],"number_text":"੪੪੨।","page":953,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਦੁਰਦਨੀ ਪ੍ਰਿਥਮ ਬਖਾਨਿ ਕੈ ਰਿਪੁ ਅਰਿ ਪੁਨਿ ਪਦ ਦੇਹੁ।","roman":"Duradnee pritham bakhaani kai ripu ari puni pad dehu |","meaning_en":"Speak 'durdani' (army of elephants) first, then add the words 'ripu ari';","page":953,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਦੁਰਦਨਿ' (ਹਾਥੀ ਸੈਨਾ) ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਹਿ ਕੇ ਫਿਰ 'ਰਿਪੁ ਅਰਿ' ਪਦ ਜੋੜੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਹੋਤ ਹੈ ਚੀਨ ਚਤੁਰ ਚਿਤਿ ਲੇਹੁ। ੪੪੨।","roman":"Naam paasi ke hot hai cheen chatur chiti lehu | 442 |","meaning_en":"these become names of the noose; O wise one, recognise them in your mind. 442.","page":953,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਪਾਸ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਹੋ ਜਾਏਗਾ। ਸਮਝਦਾਰੋ! ਵਿਚਾਰ ਲਵੋ ॥੪੪੨॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[443],"number_text":"੪੪੩।","page":953,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਸਾਵਜਨੀ ਪਦ ਪ੍ਰਿਥਮ ਕਹਿ ਰਿਪੁ ਅਰਿ ਅੰਤਿ ਉਚਾਰ।","roman":"Saavajnee pad pritham kahi ripu ari anti uchaar |","meaning_en":"Say the word 'savjani' (army of beasts?) first, and utter 'ripu ari' at the end;","page":953,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਸਾਵਜਨੀ: perhaps 'army of elephants/wild beasts'; uncertain.","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਸਾਵਜਨੀ' (ਹਾਥੀ-ਸੈਨਾ) ਪਦ ਕਹਿ ਕੇ ਅੰਤ ਉਤੇ 'ਰਿਪੁ ਅਰਿ' ਪਦ ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਹੋਤ ਹੈ ਲੀਜਹੁ ਸੁ ਕਬਿ ਸੁਧਾਰ। ੪੪੩।","roman":"Naam paasi ke hot hai leejhu su kabi sudhaar | 443 |","meaning_en":"these become names of the noose; good poets, take them, set right. 443.","page":953,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਪਾਸ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਬਣ ਜਾਏਗਾ। ਕਵੀਓ! ਸਮਝ ਲਵੋ ॥੪੪੩॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[444],"number_text":"੪੪੪।","page":953,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਮਾਤੰਗਨਿ ਪਦ ਪ੍ਰਿਥਮ ਕਹਿ ਰਿਪੁ ਅਰਿ ਪਦ ਕਹਿ ਅੰਤਿ।","roman":"Maatangni pad pritham kahi ripu ari pad kahi anti |","meaning_en":"Say the word 'matangni' (army of elephants) first, and say 'ripu ari' at the end;","page":953,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਮਾਤੰਗਨਿ' (ਹਾਥੀ-ਸੈਨਾ) ਪਦ ਕਹਿ ਕੇ ਅੰਤ ਉਤੇ 'ਰਿਪੁ ਅਰਿ' ਪਦ ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਹੋਤ ਹੈ ਚੀਨਹੁ ਚਤੁਰ ਅਨੰਤ। ੪੪੪।","roman":"Naam paasi ke hot hai cheenhu chatur anant | 444 |","meaning_en":"these become names of the noose; O wise ones, recognise them without end. 444.","page":953,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਪਾਸ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਹੋ ਜਾਏਗਾ। ਵਿਦਵਾਨੋ! ਸਮਝ ਲਵੋ ॥੪੪੪॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[445],"number_text":"੪੪੫।","page":954,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਪ੍ਰਿਥਮ ਤੁਰੰਗਨੀ ਸਬਦ ਕਹਿ ਰਿਪੁ ਅਰਿ ਅੰਤਿ ਬਖਾਨ।","roman":"Pritham turangnee sabad kahi ripu ari anti bakhaan |","meaning_en":"First say the word 'turangni' (army of horses), and speak 'ripu ari' at the end;","page":954,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਤੁਰੰਗਨੀ' (ਘੋੜ ਸਵਾਰ ਸੈਨਾ) ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਹਿ ਕੇ, ਅੰਤ ਉਤੇ 'ਰਿਪੁ ਅਰਿ' ਪਦ ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਹੋਤ ਹੈ ਚਤੁਰ ਲੇਹੁ ਪਹਿਚਾਨ। ੪੪੫।","roman":"Naam paasi ke hot hai chatur lehu pahichaan | 445 |","meaning_en":"these become names of the noose; O wise one, recognise them. 445.","page":954,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਪਾਸ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਬਣ ਜਾਦਾ ਹੈ। ਸੂਝਵਾਨੋ! ਪਛਾਣ ਲਵੋ ॥੪੪੫॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[446],"number_text":"੪੪੬।","page":954,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਹਸਤਨਿ ਆਦਿ ਉਚਾਰਿ ਕੈ ਰਿਪੁ ਅਰਿ ਪਦ ਕੈ ਦੀਨ।","roman":"Hasatni aadi uchaari kai ripu ari pad kai deen |","meaning_en":"Uttering 'hastni' (army of elephants) first, give the words 'ripu ari';","page":954,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਹਸਤਨਿ' (ਹਾਥੀਆਂ ਦੀ ਸੈਨਾ) ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਹਿ ਕੇ, (ਫਿਰ) 'ਰਿਪੁ ਅਰਿ' ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਹੋਤ ਹੈ ਚਤੁਰ ਲੀਜੀਅਹੁ ਚੀਨ। ੪੪੬।","roman":"Naam paasi ke hot hai chatur leejeeahu cheen | 446 |","meaning_en":"these become names of the noose; O wise one, recognise them. 446.","page":954,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਪਾਸ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਹੋ ਜਾਦਾ ਹੈ। ਸੂਝਵਾਨੋ! ਸਮਝ ਲਵੋ ॥੪੪੬॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[447],"number_text":"੪੪੭।","page":954,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਪ੍ਰਿਥਮ ਉਚਰਿ ਪਦ ਦੰਤਨੀ ਰਿਪੁ ਅਰਿ ਅੰਤਿ ਬਖਾਨ।","roman":"Pritham uchri pad dantnee ripu ari anti bakhaan |","meaning_en":"First utter the word 'dantni' (army of tuskers), and speak 'ripu ari' at the end;","page":954,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਦੰਤਨੀ' (ਦੰਦਾ ਵਾਲੇ ਹਾਥੀਆਂ ਦੀ ਸੈਨਾ) ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਹਿ ਕੇ, ਅੰਤ ਉਤੇ 'ਰਿਪੁ ਅਰਿ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਹੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸ ਕੇ ਹੋਤ ਹੈ ਚੀਨ ਲੇਹੁ ਬੁਧਿਵਾਨ। ੪੪੭।","roman":"Naam paas ke hot hai cheen lehu budhivaan | 447 |","meaning_en":"these become names of the noose; O wise ones, recognise them. 447.","page":954,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[448],"number_text":"੪੪੮।","page":954,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਦੁਰਦਨਿ ਆਦਿ ਉਚਾਰਿ ਕੈ ਮਰਦਨਿ ਅੰਤਿ ਬਖਾਨ।","roman":"Duradni aadi uchaari kai maradni anti bakhaan |","meaning_en":"Uttering 'durdani' first, speak 'mardani' (crusher) at the end;","page":954,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਪਾਸ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਹੋ ਜਾਦਾ ਹੈ। ਸੂਝਵਾਨੋ! ਸਮਝ ਲਵੋ ॥੪੪੭॥ ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਦੁਰਦਨਿ' (ਹਾਥੀ ਸੈਨਾ) ਪਦ ਕਹਿ ਕੇ ਅੰਤ ਉਤੇ 'ਮੁਰਦਨਿ' (ਮੁਰਦਾ ਕਰਨ ਵਾਲੀ) ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB","note_pa":"ਇਹ ਅਰਥ ਇਸ ਪੰਕਤੀ ਸਮੇਤ ਉੱਪਰਲੀਆਂ 2 ਪੰਕਤੀਆਂ ਦਾ ਇਕੱਠਾ ਹੈ।"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਹੋਤ ਹੈ ਲੀਜਹੁ ਸਮਝ ਸੁਜਾਨ। ੪੪੮।","roman":"Naam paasi ke hot hai leejhu samajh sujaan | 448 |","meaning_en":"these become names of the noose; O knowing ones, understand them. 448.","page":954,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਪਾਸ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਬਣਦਾ ਹੈ। ਸਮਝਦਾਰੋ! ਵਿਚਾਰ ਕਰ ਲਵੋ ॥੪੪੮॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[449],"number_text":"੪੪੯।","page":954,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਪਦਮਨਿ ਆਦਿ ਉਚਾਰੀਐ ਰਿਪੁ ਅਰਿ ਅੰਤਿ ਬਖਾਨ।","roman":"Padamni aadi uchaareeai ripu ari anti bakhaan |","meaning_en":"Utter 'padmani' (army of elephants?) first, and speak 'ripu ari' at the end;","page":954,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਪਦਮਨਿ: perhaps elephant army (padmi = elephant); uncertain.","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਪਦਮਨਿ' (ਹਾਥੀ ਸੈਨਾ) ਪਦ ਉਚਾਰ ਕੇ, ਅੰਤ ਉਤੇ 'ਰਿਪੁ ਅਰਿ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਜੋੜੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਹੋਤ ਹੈ ਲੀਜਹੁ ਸਮਝ ਸੁਜਾਨ। ੪੪੯।","roman":"Naam paasi ke hot hai leejhu samajh sujaan | 449 |","meaning_en":"these become names of the noose; O knowing ones, understand them. 449.","page":954,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਪਾਸ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਬਣਦਾ ਹੈ। ਸਮਝਦਾਰੋ! ਵਿਚਾਰ ਕਰ ਲਵੋ ॥੪੪੮॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[450],"number_text":"੪੫੦।","page":954,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਬ੍ਯਾਲਾ ਆਦਿ ਬਖਾਨੀਐ ਰਿਪੁ ਅਰਿ ਪਦ ਕੈ ਦੀਨ।","roman":"Byaalaa aadi bakhaaneeai ripu ari pad kai deen |","meaning_en":"Speak 'byala' (army of elephants/serpents?) first, and give the words 'ripu ari';","page":954,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਬ੍ਯਾਲਾ: 'vyal' can be elephant or serpent; uncertain."},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਹੋਤ ਹੈ ਸੁ ਕਬਿ ਲੀਜੀਅਹੁ ਚੀਨ। ੪੫੦।","roman":"Naam paasi ke hot hai su kabi leejeeahu cheen | 450 |","meaning_en":"these become names of the noose; good poets, recognise them. 450.","page":954,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਬ੍ਰਯਾਲਾ' (ਹਾਥੀ ਸੈਨਾ) ਪਦ ਕਹਿ ਕੇ, ਫਿਰ 'ਰਿਪੁ ਅਰਿ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਹਿ ਦਿਓ। (ਇਹ) ਪਾਸ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਹੋ ਜਾਦਾ ਹੈ। ਕਵੀਓ! ਚੇਤੇ ਕਰ ਲਵੋ ॥੪੫੦॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB","note_pa":"ਇਹ ਅਰਥ ਇਸ ਪੰਕਤੀ ਸਮੇਤ ਉੱਪਰਲੀਆਂ 2 ਪੰਕਤੀਆਂ ਦਾ ਇਕੱਠਾ ਹੈ।"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[451],"number_text":"੪੫੧।","page":954,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਆਦਿ ਸਬਦ ਕਹਿ ਕੁੰਜਰੀ ਅੰਤ ਰਿਪੰਤਕ ਦੀਨ।","roman":"Aadi sabad kahi kunjree ant ripantak deen |","meaning_en":"Say the word 'kunjri' (army of elephants) first, and give 'ripantak' (ender of foes) at the end;","page":954,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਕੁੰਜਰੀ' (ਹਾਥੀ ਸੈਨਾ) ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਹਿ ਕੇ, ਅੰਤ ਉਤੇ 'ਰਿਪੰਤਕ' (ਵੈਰੀ ਦਾ ਨਾਸ਼ ਕਰਨ ਵਾਲੀ) ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਹੋਤ ਹੈ ਸੁਘਰ ਲੀਜੀਅਹੁ ਚੀਨ। ੪੫੧।","roman":"Naam paasi ke hot hai sughar leejeeahu cheen | 451 |","meaning_en":"these become names of the noose; O skilled ones, recognise them. 451.","page":954,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਪਾਸ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਬਣ ਜਾਦਾ ਹੈ। ਸੁਘੜ ਜਨੋ! ਚੇਤੇ ਕਰ ਲਵੋ ॥੪੫੧॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[452],"number_text":"੪੫੨।","page":954,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਇੰਭੀ ਆਦਿ ਸਬਦ ਉਚਰੀਐ ਰਿਪੁ ਅਰਿ ਕੌ ਪੁਨਿ ਦੀਨ।","roman":"Inbhee aadi sabad uchreeai ripu ari kau puni deen |","meaning_en":"Utter the word 'imbhi' (army of elephants) first, then give 'ripu ari';","page":954,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਇੰਭੀ' (ਗਜ ਸੈਨਾ) ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਹਿ ਕੇ ਫਿਰ 'ਰਿਪੁ ਅਰਿ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਹੋਤ ਹੈ ਲੀਜਹੁ ਸਮਝ ਪ੍ਰਬੀਨ। ੪੫੨।","roman":"Naam paasi ke hot hai leejhu samajh prabeen | 452 |","meaning_en":"these become names of the noose; O skilled ones, understand them. 452.","page":954,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸ ਦਾ ਹੁੰਦਾ ਹੈ। ਸਮਝਦਾਰੋ! ਸਮਝ ਲਵੋ ॥੪੫੨॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[453],"number_text":"੪੫੩।","page":954,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਪ੍ਰਿਥਮ ਕੁੰਭਨੀ ਸਬਦ ਕਹਿ ਰਿਪੁ ਅਰਿ ਅੰਤਿ ਬਖਾਨ।","roman":"Pritham kunbhnee sabad kahi ripu ari anti bakhaan |","meaning_en":"First say the word 'kumbhni' (army of elephants), and speak 'ripu ari' at the end;","page":954,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਕੁੰਭਨੀ' (ਹਾਥੀ-ਸੈਨਾ) ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਹਿ ਕੇ, (ਫਿਰ) ਅੰਤ ਉਤੇ 'ਰਿਪੁ ਅਰਿ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਜੋੜ ਲਵੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਹੋਤ ਹੈ ਲੀਜੀਅਹੁ ਸਮਝ ਸੁਜਾਨ। ੪੫੩।","roman":"Naam paasi ke hot hai leejeeahu samajh sujaan | 453 |","meaning_en":"these become names of the noose; O knowing ones, understand them. 453.","page":954,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਪਾਸ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਬਣ ਜਾਦਾ ਹੈ। ਸੂਝਵਾਨੋ! ਸੋਚ ਲਵੋ ॥੪੫੩॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[454],"number_text":"੪੫੪।","page":954,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਕਰਨੀ ਪ੍ਰਿਥਮ ਉਚਾਰਿ ਕੈ ਰਿਪੁ ਅਰਿ ਅੰਤਿ ਬਖਾਨ।","roman":"Karnee pritham uchaari kai ripu ari anti bakhaan |","meaning_en":"Uttering 'karni' (army of elephants) first, speak 'ripu ari' at the end;","page":954,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਕਰਨੀ' (ਹਾਥੀ ਸੈਨਾ) ਪਦ ਉਚਾਰ ਕੇ ਅੰਤ ਉਤੇ 'ਰਿਪੁ ਅਰਿ' ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਹੋਤ ਹੈ ਲੀਜੀਅਹੁ ਸਮਝ ਸੁਜਾਨ। ੪੫੪।","roman":"Naam paasi ke hot hai leejeeahu samajh sujaan | 454 |","meaning_en":"these become names of the noose; O knowing ones, understand them. 454.","page":954,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਪਾਸ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਬਣ ਜਾਦਾ ਹੈ। ਸੂਝਵਾਨੋ! ਸੋਚ ਲਵੋ ॥੪੫੩॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[455],"number_text":"੪੫੫।","page":954,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਪ੍ਰਿਥਮ ਸਿੰਧੁਰੀ ਸਬਦ ਕਹਿ ਰਿਪੁ ਅਰਿ ਅੰਤਿ ਉਚਾਰ।","roman":"Pritham sindhuree sabad kahi ripu ari anti uchaar |","meaning_en":"First say the word 'sindhuri' (army of elephants), and utter 'ripu ari' at the end;","page":954,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਸਿੰਧੁਰੀ' (ਗਜ ਸੈਨਾ) ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਹਿ ਕੇ ਅੰਤ ਵਿਚ 'ਰਿਪੁ ਅਰਿ' ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਸਕਲ ਹੀ ਨਿਕਸਤ ਚਲਤ ਅਪਾਰ। ੪੫੫।","roman":"Naam paasi ke sakal hee niksat chalat apaar | 455 |","meaning_en":"countless names of the noose come forth. 455.","page":954,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਸਾਰੇ ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਬਣਦੇ ਚਲੇ ਜਾਦੇ ਹਨ ॥੪੫੫॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[456],"number_text":"੪੫੬।","page":954,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਆਦਿ ਅਨਕਪੀ ਸਬਦ ਕਹਿ ਰਿਪੁ ਆਰਿ ਅੰਤਿ ਬਖਾਨ।","roman":"Aadi anakpee sabad kahi ripu aari anti bakhaan |","meaning_en":"Say the word 'anakpi' (army of elephants) first, and speak 'ripu ari' at the end;","page":954,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਅਨਕਪੀ: read as 'anekapi' (elephant); ਆਰਿ printed so, read as ਅਰਿ; uncertain."},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸ ਕੇ ਹੋਤ ਹੈ ਲੀਜਹੁ ਸੁ ਕਬਿ ਸੁਧਾਰ। ੪੫੬।","roman":"Naam paas ke hot hai leejhu su kabi sudhaar | 456 |","meaning_en":"these become names of the noose; good poets, take them, set right. 456.","page":954,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[457],"number_text":"੪੫੭।","page":954,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਪ੍ਰਿਥਮ ਨਾਗਨੀ ਸਬਦ ਕਹਿ ਰਿਪੁ ਅਰਿ ਅੰਤਿ ਬਖਾਨ।","roman":"Pritham naagnee sabad kahi ripu ari anti bakhaan |","meaning_en":"First say the word 'nagni' (army of elephants), and speak 'ripu ari' at the end;","page":954,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਅਨਕਪੀ' (ਹਾਥੀ-ਸੈਨਾ) ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਹਿ ਕੇ ਅੰਤ ਉਤੇ 'ਰਿਪੁ ਅਰਿ' ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ। (ਇਹ) ਪਾਸ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਬਣ ਜਾਦਾ ਹੈ। ਕਵੀ ਜਨੋ! ਵਿਚਾਰ ਕਰ ਲਵੋ ॥੪੫੬॥ ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਨਾਗਨੀ' (ਹਾਥੀ-ਸੈਨਾ) ਕਹਿ ਕੇ, ਅੰਤ ਉਤੇ 'ਰਿਪੁ ਅਰਿ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਜੋੜੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB","note_pa":"ਇਹ ਅਰਥ ਇਸ ਪੰਕਤੀ ਸਮੇਤ ਉੱਪਰਲੀਆਂ 3 ਪੰਕਤੀਆਂ ਦਾ ਇਕੱਠਾ ਹੈ।"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਹੋਤ ਹੈ ਚੀਨ ਲੇਹੁ ਮਤਿਵਾਨ। ੪੫੭।","roman":"Naam paasi ke hot hai cheen lehu mativaan | 457 |","meaning_en":"these become names of the noose; O wise ones, recognise them. 457.","page":954,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਪਾਸ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਬਣ ਜਾਵੇਗਾ। ਬੁੱਧੀਮਾਨੋ! ਸੋਚ ਲਵੋ ॥੪੫੭॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[458],"number_text":"੪੫੮।","page":954,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਹਰਿਨੀ ਆਦਿ ਉਚਾਰੀਐ ਰਿਪੁ ਅਰਿ ਅੰਤਿ ਬਖਾਨ।","roman":"Harinee aadi uchaareeai ripu ari anti bakhaan |","meaning_en":"Utter 'harini' (army of horses?) first, and speak 'ripu ari' at the end;","page":954,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਹਰਿਨੀ: 'hari' = horse; uncertain.","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਹਰਿਨੀ' (ਹਾਥੀ ਦਲ) ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਹਿ ਕੇ (ਫਿਰ) ਅੰਤ ਉਤੇ 'ਰਿਪੁ ਅਰਿ' ਪਦ ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਹੋਤ ਹੈ ਸਮਝ ਲੇਹੁ ਬੁਧਿਵਾਨ। ੪੫੮।","roman":"Naam paasi ke hot hai samajh lehu budhivaan | 458 |","meaning_en":"these become names of the noose; O wise ones, understand them. 458.","page":954,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਪਾਸ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਹੈ। ਸੂਝਵਾਨੋ! ਸਮਝ ਲਵੋ ॥੪੫੮॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[459],"number_text":"੪੫੯।","page":954,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਮਾਤੰਗਨਿ ਪਦ ਪ੍ਰਿਥਮ ਕਹਿ ਰਿਪੁ ਅਰਿ ਅੰਤਿ ਉਚਾਰ।","roman":"Maatangni pad pritham kahi ripu ari anti uchaar |","meaning_en":"Say the word 'matangni' first, and utter 'ripu ari' at the end;","page":954,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਮਾਤੰਗਨਿ' (ਹਾਥੀ-ਸੈਨਾ) ਪਦ ਕਹਿ ਕੇ, (ਫਿਰ) ਅੰਤ ਉਤੇ 'ਰਿਪੁ ਅਰਿ' ਪਦ ਉਚਾਰਨ ਕਰੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਹੋਤ ਹੈ ਲੀਜਹੁ ਸੁ ਕਬਿ ਸੁਧਾਰ। ੪੫੯।","roman":"Naam paasi ke hot hai leejhu su kabi sudhaar | 459 |","meaning_en":"these become names of the noose; good poets, take them, set right. 459.","page":954,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਪਾਸ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਬਣਦਾ ਹੈ। ਕਵੀਓ! ਵਿਚਾਰ ਲਵੋ ॥੪੫੯॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[460],"number_text":"੪੬੦।","page":954,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਆਦਿ ਉਚਰਿ ਪਦ ਬਾਜਿਨੀ ਰਿਪੁ ਅਰਿ ਅੰਤਿ ਬਖਾਨ।","roman":"Aadi uchri pad baajinee ripu ari anti bakhaan |","meaning_en":"First utter the word 'bajini' (army of horses), and speak 'ripu ari' at the end;","page":954,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਬਾਜਿਨੀ' (ਘੋੜ ਸਵਾਰ ਸੈਨਾ) ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਹਿ ਕੇ ਅੰਤ ਵਿਚ 'ਰਿਪੁ ਅਰਿ' ਪਦ ਜੋੜੋ।","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਪਾਸਿ ਕੇ ਹੋਤ ਹੈ ਸੁਘਰ ਸਤਿ ਕਰਿ ਮਾਨ। ੪੬੦।","roman":"Naam paasi ke hot hai sughar sati kari maan | 460 |","meaning_en":"these become names of the noose; O skilled one, accept this as true. 460.","page":954,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"(ਇਹ) ਪਾਸ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਬਣਦਾ ਹੈ। ਸੌਝਵਾਨੋ! ਸਚ ਕਰ ਕੇ ਮੰਨ ਲਵੋ ॥੪੬੦॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}]}],"ending":{"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਇਤਿ ਸ੍ਰੀ ਨਾਮ ਮਾਲਾ ਪੁਰਾਣ ਸ੍ਰੀ ਪਾਸਿ ਨਾਮ ਚਤੁਰਥਮੋ ਧਿਆਇ ਸਮਾਪਤਮ ਸਤ ਸੁਭਮ ਸਤੁ। ੪।","roman":"Iti sree naam maalaa puraan sree paasi naam chaturathmo dhiaai samaaptam sat subham satu | 4 |","meaning_en":"Here ends the fourth chapter of Sri Nam Mala Purana, the names of the noose, completed. All is true and auspicious. 4.","page":954,"meaning_status":"draft","meaning_pa":"ਇਥੇ ਸ੍ਰੀ ਨਾਮ ਮਾਲਾ ਪੁਰਾਣ ਦੇ ਸ੍ਰੀ ਪਾਸਿ ਨਾਮ ਵਾਲੇ ਚੌਥੇ ਅਧਿਆਇ ਦੀ ਸਮਾਪਤੀ, ਸਭ ਸ਼ੁਭ ਹੈ ॥੪॥","meaning_pa_source":"BaniDB"}],"page":954,"number":[4]}});
